<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EZK" style="id">RRK26.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">EZEKIELI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ekitabo Kya Nabi Ezekieli</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ezekieli</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ezk</para>
  <para style="mt2">EKITABO KYA NABI</para>
  <para style="mt1">EZEKIELI</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EZK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ezekieli okworekwa ekitiinisa kya Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 8:3">Ezk 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 40:2">40:2</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 4:3">Kub 4:3</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:10">Mak 1:10</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:56">Byak 7:56</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwa makumi ashatu, omu kwezi kwa kana, aha kiro kyakwo kya kataano, nkaba ndi omu baatwairwe omu bukwatwa aha mugyera Kebari, eiguru ryashuuruuka, naareeba okworekwa nikuruga ahari Ruhanga. <verse eid="EZK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 1:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:12">2 Bag 24:12</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 24:15">15</ref>. </char></note> Aha kiro kya kataano eky'okwo kwezi (gukaba guri omwaka gwa kataano okwiha obu omugabe Yehoyakiini yaatwarwa omu bukwatwa), <verse eid="EZK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 1:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:22">Ezk 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 18:46">1 Bag 18:46</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 3:15">2 Bag 3:15</ref>. </char></note> ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikaija ahari Ezekieli omunyamurwa, mwene Buuzi, ari omu nsi y'Abakaludaaya aha mugyera Kebari; Okwo niyo omukono gwa MUKAMA gwamuhikiireho. <verse eid="EZK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 1:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:19">Ezk 23:19</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 1:27">Ezk 1:27</ref>. </char></note> Ku naagiire kugira nti, naareeba omuyaga gw'amaani gwaija niguruga aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, n'ekicu kuhango ekyehinguririziibwe omushana ogurikumurinkana, kyaguma nikirugwamu omuriro ogurikurabya nk'omurabyo, kandi ahagati y'ogwo muriro haabaho ekintu ekirikushusha nk'omuringa ogurikwengyengyeta. <verse eid="EZK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 10:14">Ezk 10:14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 4:6-8">Kush 4:6-8</ref>. </char></note> Omuri ekyo kicu haarugamu ebihangwirwe bina ebiine amagara. Kandi oku nikwo byabaire nibishusha. Bikaba biine ekyemerero nk'eky'omuntu; <verse eid="EZK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 1:6" />kwonka buri kimwe kikaba kiine obuso buna, kandi kiine amapapa ana. <verse eid="EZK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:6">Dan 10:6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:15">Kush 1:15</ref>. </char></note> Amaguru gaabyo gagororokire, ahansi y'ebigyere byabo nihashusha nk'ebyara by'enyana, kandi nibyengyengyeta nk'omuringa ogweziibwe. <verse eid="EZK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 1:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:17">Ezk 1:17</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 10:8">10:8</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 10:21">21</ref>. </char></note> Aha mbaju zaabyo ina bikaba biine engaro nk'ez'omuntu ahansi y'mapapa gaabyo. Kandi byona bikaba biine obuso n'amapapa ebirikushusha biti. <verse eid="EZK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 10:11">Ezk 10:11</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 10:22">22</ref>. </char></note> Amapapa gaabyo gakaba nigakoranaho; buri kimwe nikigyenda omu maisho kitarikuhinduka; byona nibigyendera hamwe. <verse eid="EZK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 1:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 10:14">Ezk 10:14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 4:7">Kush 4:7</ref>. </char></note> Emisusire yaabyo ahamaisho, buri kimwe kikaba kiine aha maisho nk'ah'omuntu; kandi byona bina biine aha maisho nk'ah'entare aha rubaju rwa buryo, biine aha maisho nk'ah'ente aha rubaju rwa bumosho, kandi biine aha maisho nk'ah'eishamba aha nkomo. <verse eid="EZK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:23">Ezk 1:23</ref>. </char></note> Okwo nikwo aha maisho gaabyo haabaire nihashusha. Amapapa gaabyo gakaba gashashaanwire; buri kimwe kiine amapapa abiri, buri ipapa nirikora aha rya kigyenzi kyakyo, n'agandi abiri gashwekire omubiri gwakyo. <verse eid="EZK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 1:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 10:17">Ezk 10:17</ref>. </char></note> Buri kimwe kikaba nikigyenda omu maisho kitarikuhinduka. Ei Omwoyo yaabaire aza yoona, niyo byabaire bitoora bitarikuhinduka. <verse eid="EZK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:5">Dan 10:5</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 10:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 28:3">Mat 28:3</ref>. </char></note> Ahagati y'ebyo bihangirwe bina ebiine amagara hakaba hariho ekirikushusha nk'amakara agarikwaka, nk'emuri ezirikukora oku n'oku ahagati yaabyo; ogwo muriro nigwaka munonga, kandi omuri ogwo muriro haaguma niharugamu omurabyo. <verse eid="EZK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 1:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:27">Mat 24:27</ref>. </char></note> Ebyo bihangirwe byaguma nibikora oku n'oku nk'omurabyo gurikurabya. <verse eid="EZK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 1:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15, 16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 10:9">Ezk 10:9</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 10:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Ku naabaire ninkireeba ebyo bihangirwe bina ebiine amagara, naareeba enziga aha nsi aha rubaju rw'ebyo bihangirwe, enziga emwe ahabwa buri kimwe ahari ebyo ebina. <verse eid="EZK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 1:16" />Emisusire y'ezo nziga n'oku zaabaire zikozirwe zikaba nizengyengyeta nka berulo; zoona ina zikaba nizishushana; oku zaabaire zikozirwe, zikaba nizireebeka oti, buri nziga eri omu ndiijo. <verse eid="EZK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 1:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:8">Ezk 1:8</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 1:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 10:11">10:11</ref>. </char></note> Ku zaabaire ziba nizigyenda, zigyenda zitarikuhinduka, nizitoora orubaju rwona oru zaayenda ahari ezo ina. <verse eid="EZK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 1:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 10:12">Ezk 10:12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 4:8">Kush 4:8</ref>. </char></note> Ezo nziga zikaba ziine empanka n'enyomyo; ezo mpanka zikaba ziijwire amaisho okuzeehinguririza. <verse eid="EZK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 1:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19-21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 10:16">Ezk 10:16</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 10:17">17</ref>. </char></note> Ebyo bihangirwe ku byabaire bigyenda, ezo nziga zibigyenda aha rubaju; kandi ku byabaire biimuka byaza ahaiguru, nazo ziimuka ziza ahaiguru. <verse eid="EZK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 1:20" />Ei Omwoyo yaabaire aza yoona, niyo byabaire bitoora, n'ezo nziga ziimuka nabyo; ahabw'okuba Omwoyo w'ebyo bihangirwe ebiine amagara akaba ari n'omuri ezo nziga. <verse eid="EZK 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 1:21" />Ku byabaire bigyenda, nazo zigyenda; bikyemerera, nazo zeemerera; ku byabaire biimuka byaza ahaiguru, ezo nziga nazo ziimuka nabyo, ziza ahaiguru; ahabw'okuba Omwoyo w'ebyo bihangirwe ebiine amagara akaba ari n'omuri ezo nziga.<verse eid="EZK 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 1:22" />Ahaiguru y'emitwe y'ebyo bihangirwe ebiine amagara, hakaba hariho ekirikushusha eiguru, ekirikumurinkana nka kristalo, kibambire ahaiguru y'emitwe yaabo. <verse eid="EZK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 1:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:11">Ezk 1:11</ref>. </char></note> Ahansi yaakyo amapapa gaabyo gashashaanwire, buri rimwe nirireebana na rigyenzi ryaryo; kandi buri kihangirwe kiine amapapa abiri gashwekire omubiri gwakyo. <verse eid="EZK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 1:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 43:2">Ezk 43:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 29:4">Zab 29:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 68:33">68:33</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 10:6">Dan 10:6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:15">Kush 1:15</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ku byabaire bigyenda, mpurira okuhoorera kw'amapapa gaabyo kuri nk'okuhoorera kw'amaizi maingi, nk'okuhinda kw'Ow'obushoboorozi bwona, obwaku bwakwo buri nk'obw'orwari rw'eihe ry'engabo; ku byabaire byemerera, bigwisa amapapa gaabyo. <verse eid="EZK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 1:25" />Kandi ahaiguru y'ekirikushusha eiguru ekyabaire kiri aha mitwe yaabyo, haareetwaho eiraka; ku byabaire byemerera, bigwisa amapapa gaabyo.<verse eid="EZK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 1:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 10:1">Ezk 10:1</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 24:10">Kur 24:10</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 8:15">Dan 8:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ahaiguru y'ekirikushusha eiguru ekyabaire kiri aha mitwe yaabyo, hakaba hariho ekirikushusha ekitebe ky'obukama, nikishusha eibaare rya safiro, kandi ahari ekyo ekirikushusha ekitebe ky'obukama hariho ekirikushusha omuntu. <verse eid="EZK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 1:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:4">Ezk 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 8:2">8:2</ref>. </char></note> Okwiha omu bwezirikiro bwe okugarura ahaiguru naareeba nihengyengyeta nk'omuringa gweziibwe, ogurikushusha nk'omuriro gwehinguririize embaju zoona; kandi okwiha omu bwezirikiro bwe okugarura ahansi, naareeba nihashusha omuriro; kandi hariho ekirikumurinkana aha mbaju ze zoona. <verse eid="EZK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 1:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:23">Ezk 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 43:3">43:3</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 8:17">Dan 8:17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:17">Kush 1:17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 4:3">4:3</ref>; <ref loc="REV 10:1">10:1</ref>. </char></note> Nk'oku omuhanganzima gureebeka aha kicu aha izooba ry'enjura, nikwo okureebeka kw'okumurinkana kwabaire kumehinguririize.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 1:28">Ebyo bikaba biri ekishushani ky'ekitiinisa kya MUKAMA. Ku naakireebire, naagwa ahansi njuumaire, naahurira eiraka ry'orikugamba.<verse eid="EZK 1:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EZK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ezekieli okutumwa aha Baisraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 8:17">Dan 8:17</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 10:11">10:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yangira ati: Mwana w'omuntu, imuka oyemerere, ngambe naiwe. <verse eid="EZK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:24">Ezk 3:24</ref>. </char></note> Ku yangambiire, Omwoyo yantaahamu, yaanyemereza, naahurira ogwo owaabaire naagamba naanye, <verse eid="EZK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:25">Yer 3:25</ref>. </char></note> nangira ati: Mwana w'omuntu, ninkutuma aha bantu ba Israeli, eihanaga ry'abagomi abangomeire; bo na baishenkurubo bakancumuraho n'okuhitsya eri izooba. <verse eid="EZK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:7">Ezk 3:7</ref>. </char></note> Abo bantu n'abanyarubwa, baine emitima egangaire. Abo nibo ndikukutumaho; ku oraabahikye, obagire oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba. <verse eid="EZK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 2:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:7">Ezk 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 3:11">3:11</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 33:33">33:33</ref>. </char></note> Kandi bo, yaaba bahurira, yaaba banga, (ahabw'okuba n'ab'enju engomi,) kwonka nibaija kumanya ku nabi abaire abarimu. <verse eid="EZK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 2:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:9">Ezk 3:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 1:8">Yer 1:8</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 7:4">Mik 7:4</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:14">1 Pet 3:14</ref>. </char></note> Naiwe Mwana w'omuntu we, otabatiina, kandi otatiina ebigambo byabo, n'obu oraabe ori omu mikwatangwe n'omu mahwa, kandi otwire omuri skoropio. Otatiina ebigambo byabo, n'obu kwakuba okuhahaaza omutima ahabw'emireebekyere yaabo, ahakuba n'enju engomi. <verse eid="EZK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 2:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:5">Ezk 2:5</ref>. </char></note> Obagambire ebigambo byangye, yaaba bahurira, yaaba banga kuhurira; ahakuba n'enju engomi.<verse eid="EZK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 2:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 10:9">Kush 10:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka iwe mwana w'omuntu, hurira eki ndikukugambira; otaba omugomi nk'egyo nju engomi; yashamya akanwa kaawe, orye eki ndaakuhe. <verse eid="EZK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 8:3">Ezk 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 10:10">Dan 10:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 10:2">Kush 10:2</ref>. </char></note> Ku naagiire kugira nti, naareeba omukono gungororoirwe; kandi reeba, gukaba gwine omuzingo gw'ekitabo; <verse eid="EZK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 2:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:1">Kush 5:1</ref>. </char></note> yaaguzingururira omu maisho gangye, kandi gukaba guhandiikirwe omunda n'enyima, n'ebiguhandiikirwemu bikaba biri eby'amaganya, n'eby'okucura, n'eby'obusaasi.<verse eid="EZK 2:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EZK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okwehanangiriza Ezekieli okuteisa abantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 2:8">Ezk 2:8</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 2:9">9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima yangira ati: Mwana w'omuntu, rya eki waaheebwa, orye ogu muzingo, ogyende, ogambire enju ya Israeli. <verse eid="EZK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 3:2" />Ntyo naayashama, yampa ogwo muzingo kugurya. <verse eid="EZK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:16">Yer 15:16</ref>; <ref loc="REV 10:9">Kush 10:9</ref>, <ref loc="REV 10:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Yangira ati: Mwana w'omuntu, rya ogu muzingo ogu naakuha, ogwijuze omunda yaawe. Ahonaaho naagurya; omu kanwa gwannurira nk'obwoki.<verse eid="EZK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 3:4" />Yaaguruka yangira ati: Mwana w'omuntu, irooko oze aha nju ya Israeli, obagambire ebigambo byangye; <verse eid="EZK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 3:5" />ahakuba tiwaatumwa ha bantu b'orurimi rw'enduga-mahanga nari orugumire, kureka waatumwa aha nju ya Israeli, <verse eid="EZK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 3:6" />ti ha mahanga maingi g'orurimi rw'enduga-mahanga nari orugumire, abu otarikuhurirana nabo. Buzimazima kuri naakutuma aha bantu nk'abo, bakaakuhuriire. <verse eid="EZK 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 3:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:4">Ezk 2:4</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">Yoh 15:20</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ab'enju ya Israeli tibarikwija kukuhurira; ahabw'okuba naanye tibarikwenda kumpurira; ahakuba ab'enju ya Israeli boona baine obuso bugumire n'emitima egangaire. <verse eid="EZK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 3:8" />Reeba, ngangaize aha maisho gaawe, ngu habone kugangaarira ahaabo, n'obuso bwawe kugangaarira obwabo. <verse eid="EZK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:6">Ezk 2:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 50:7">Isa 50:7</ref>. </char></note> Naahindura obuso bwawe nk'arimaasi, bugume okukira eibaare ry'enkangabuye. Otatiina, kandi otahahaazibwa emireebekyere yaabo, n'obu baraabe bari enju engomi. <verse eid="EZK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 3:10" />Kandi yangira ati: Mwana w'omuntu, ebigambo byangye byona, ebi naaza kukugambira, obitaasye omu mutima gwawe, kandi obihurire n'amatu gaawe. <verse eid="EZK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 3:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:4">Ezk 2:4</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 2:5">5</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima ogyende, oze omu bantu baawe abaatwairwe omu bukwatwa, obagire oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba, yaaba bahurira, yaaba banga.<verse eid="EZK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 3:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 8:3">Ezk 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 18:12">1 Bag 18:12</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 8:39">Byak 8:39</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Omwoyo yankiriza; ekitiinisa kya MUKAMA ku kyabaire nikikiimuka omu mwanya gwakyo, naahurira okuhoorera kwingi munonga; <verse eid="EZK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:24">Ezk 1:24</ref>. </char></note> nikwo kuhoorera kw'amapapa g'ebyo bihangirwe ebiine amagara nigakoranaho, n'okuhoorera kw'ezo nziga aha rubaju rwabyo okurikushusha okurigita kw'omutsitsa. <verse eid="EZK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 3:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:3">Ezk 1:3</ref>. </char></note> Omwoyo yankiriza, yantwara, naagyenda ngwirwe kubi, nyine ekiniga kingi; kandi omukono gwa MUKAMA gukaba gungumize; <verse eid="EZK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 3:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 2:13">Yob 2:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 137:1">Zab 137:1</ref>. </char></note> naahika Telabiibu, naashanga abaabaire batwairwe omu bukwatwa, batwire aha mugyera Kebari, naamarayo ebiro mushanju nshutami ahagati yaabo nshobeirwe.<verse eid="EZK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 3:16" />Ebyo biro mushanju ku byahweire, ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 3:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 33:7">Ezk 33:7</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, nkugizire omurinzi w'enju ya Israeli; ku oraagume waahurira ekigambo ekirikuruga omu kanwa kangye, obanteisize. <verse eid="EZK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 3:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18, 19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 14:14">Ezk 14:14</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 33:8">33:8</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 33:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 4:16">1 Tim 4:16</ref>. </char></note> Ku ndigira omubi nti: Buzimazima oryafa, naiwe otaamuteisa, nari okumwehanangiriza kuruga omu muhanda gwe omubi, ngu abone kujuna amagara ge, ogwo mubi aryafeera omu bibi bye, kwonka eshagama ye niiwe ndigibuuza. <verse eid="EZK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 3:19" />Kwonka ku oriteisa ogwo mubi, yaayanga kuruga omu bubi bwe, nari omu muhanda gwe omubi, aryafeera omu kutahikiirira kwe, kwonka iwe oryaba okirize amagara gaawe. <verse eid="EZK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 3:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:18">Ezk 3:18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 18:24">18:24</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 33:18">33:18</ref>; <ref loc="JER 6:21">Yer 6:21</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:20">2 Pet 2:20</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ohikiriire, ku arireka okuhikiirira kwe, yaakora eby'okutahikiirira, naanye naata enkongi omu maisho ge, aryafa; ahakuba tomuteisize, aryafa ahabw'ekyo kibi kye, kandi eby'okuhikiirira bye ebi yaakozire tibiriijukwa; kwonka eshagama ye niiwe ndigibuuza. <verse eid="EZK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 3:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:19">Ezk 3:19</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ku oriteisa ohikiriire ogwo ngu atashiisha, nawe ataashiisha, buzimazima aryaba ohuriire, ahabw'okuba aikiriize kuteisibwa; naiwe oryaba okirize amagara gaawe.<verse eid="EZK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 3:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 3:14">Ezk 3:14</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 8:4">8:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okwo niyo omukono gwa MUKAMA gwanyiziireho, akangira ati: Imuka, oze omu ruhita; okwo niyo ndaagambire naiwe. <verse eid="EZK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 3:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:1">Ezk 1:1</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 1:28">28</ref>. </char></note> Ntyo naimuka naaza omu ruhita; kandi reeba, ekitiinisa kya MUKAMA, ekirikushusha eki naareebeire aha mugyera Kebari, kyayemerera aho, naagwa ahansi njuumaire. <verse eid="EZK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 3:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:2">Ezk 2:2</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Omwoyo yantaahamu, yaanyemereza, yaagamba naanye, naagira ati: Irooko oyekingirane omu nju yaawe. <verse eid="EZK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 3:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 4:8">Ezk 4:8</ref>. </char></note> Kandi iwe Mwana w'omuntu, nibaija kukutaho emirunga, bagikubohese, kandi toribaasa kuza mu bantu; <verse eid="EZK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 3:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:5">Ezk 2:5</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 2:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:20-22">Luk 1:20-22</ref>. </char></note> kandi niinyija kuramatisa orurimi rwawe omu nkanka, obe ekiteta, obure agabahana; ahabw'okuba n'enju engomi. <verse eid="EZK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 3:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:11">Ezk 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 24:27">24:27</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 33:22">33:22</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:11">Kush 22:11</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ku ndigamba naiwe, ndyayashamya akanwa kaawe, obagire oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugmba. Orikwenda kuhurira, ahurire; n'otarikwenda kuhurira, arereere; ahabw'okuba n'enju engomi.<verse eid="EZK 3:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EZK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ezekieli okworekwa eby'okugotwa kwa Yerusaalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 4:1" />Mbwenu iwe Mwana w'omuntu, twara eitafaari, orite omu maisho gaawe, oriteereho ekishushani ky'orurembo Yerusaalemu, <verse eid="EZK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 21:22">Ezk 21:22</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 25:1">2 Bag 25:1</ref>. </char></note> orugote, orwombekyeho ebigo, orurundeho eby'okutemberaho, kandi oruteereho ensiisira kururwanisa, orubyareho ebiti by'okuhiguza orugo embaju zoona; <verse eid="EZK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 12:6">Ezk 12:6</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 21:2">21:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:18">Isa 8:18</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:3">29:3</ref>. </char></note> kandi ogire ekyoma ky'eibaati, okyemereze nk'ekisiika ahagati yaawe n'orurembo; orugumyeho amaisho, rube nk'orugotsirwe, orugotere kimwe. Ekyo kiryaba akamanyiso aha nju ya Israeli. <verse eid="EZK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 4:4" />Bwanyima obyamire orubaju rwa bumosho, nkuteho ekifubiro ky'enju ya Israeli; kandi oryayekorera ekifubiro kyabo, ekirikwingana n'ebiro byona ebi orimara orubyamiire. <verse eid="EZK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 4:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:4">Ezk 23:4</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 23:5">5</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 23:9">9</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 23:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:34">Kub 14:34</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba ndyakutaho omubaro gw'ebiro magana ashatu na makumi mwenda, ogurikwingana n'omubaro gw'emyaka y'ekifubiro kyabo; okwo nikwo orimara omwanya oyekoreire ekifubiro ky'enju ya Israeli. <verse eid="EZK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 4:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:11">Ezk 23:11</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 23:12">12</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ku oriheza ebyo, oryagaruka obyame, kwonka obyamire orubaju rwa buryo, oyekorere ekifubiro ky'enju ya Yuda; ekiro kimwe eki nkuteereireho kingane omwaka gumwe gw'ekifubiro. <verse eid="EZK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 4:7" />Kandi oryagumya amaisho gaawe aha kugotwa kwa Yerusaalemu, omukono gwawe gutaine ki gushwekire, orwo rurembo oruhanuurire ebirirubaho. <verse eid="EZK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:25">Ezk 3:25</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 25:1-3">2 Bag 25:1-3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi reeba, nkutaireho emirunga, ngu otarihindukira orundi rubaju, okuhitsya obu orihikiiriza ebiro byona eby'okugota kwawe.<verse eid="EZK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 4:9" />Kandi ogire engano, sayiri, ebihimba, enkoore, omugusha n'oburo, obite omu nyungu emwe, obigoyemu oburo. Omuri ebyo biro magana ashatu na makumi mwenda, ebi orimara obyamiire orubaju rumwe, nibyo origuma nooryaho. <verse eid="EZK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 4:10" />Eby'okurya ebi orirya, biryaguma bipimwe, shekeli makumi abiri buri izooba, obirye rimwe buri izooba. <verse eid="EZK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 4:11" />Kandi oryaguma onywe amaizi garengirwe; kimwe kya mukaaga kya hiini, oganywe rimwe buri izooba. <verse eid="EZK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 4:12" />Ebyo by'okurya oryaguma obirye nk'embumburi ya sayiri, noobiteekyesa amazi g'abantu nibakureeba. <verse eid="EZK 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 4:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 1:8">Dan 1:8</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 9:3">Hos 9:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi MUKAMA naagira ati: Okwo nikwo Abaisraeli barirya eby'okurya byabo bisiisikaire omu maisho g'amahanga agu ndibabingiramu. <verse eid="EZK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 4:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:31">Kur 23:31</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:18">Lev 7:18</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 7:24">24</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 65:4">Isa 65:4</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 10:14">Byak 10:14</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima naagira nti: Ai bambe, Mukama RUHANGA! Reeba, naaba kubaho tinkeeshiishaga na kintu kyona; ahakuba okwiha omu buto bwangye n'okuhitsya hati tinkaryaga kyefeereire, nari ekitaafura kyona; kandi n'enyama erikuzira tekahikaga mu kanwa kangye. <verse eid="EZK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 4:15" />Nikwo kungira ati: Reeba, naakwikiriza kuteekyesa amasha g'ente omu mwanya gw'amazi g'abantu. <verse eid="EZK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 4:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:16">Ezk 5:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 12:19">12:19</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:26">Lev 26:26</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 105:16">Zab 105:16</ref>. </char></note> Yaagaruka yangira ati: Mwana w'omuntu, reeba, ndyahenda eky'okwehimbagiririzaho ky'aba Yerusaalemu, nibyo by'okurya byabo, bagume barye eby'okurya bipimirwe nibatiina, kandi banywe amaizi agu barengyeirwe bahahaize emitima. <verse eid="EZK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 4:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 24:23">Ezk 24:23</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:39">Lev 26:39</ref>. </char></note> Ekyo ndyakikora, ngu babone kutuubirwa eby'okurya byabo n'amaizi gaabo, baareebane bonka na bonka bashobeirwe, bahwe aha magufa ahabw'okufubirwa kwabo.<verse eid="EZK 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EZK 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 44:20">Ezk 44:20</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 7:20">Isa 7:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi iwe Mwana w'omuntu, gira rurara y'obwogi, ogikorese nk'orumweiso rw'omumwi, omwe omutwe gwawe n'ebireju byawe; bwanyima ogire eminzaani y'okupimisa, obone kubaganisa eishokye. <verse eid="EZK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 5:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 4:1">Ezk 4:1</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 4:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 12:14">12:14</ref>. </char></note> Ebiro by'okugota ku birihwa, kimwe kya kashatu kyaryo okyokyeze ahagati y'orurembo; kimwe kya kashatu kyaryo ekindi okitware, oyehinguririze orurembo nookitemesa rurara; kandi kimwe kya kashatu kyaryo ekindi okimaamagize omu mwanya, kitwarwe omuyaga; naanye ndyasyorayo rurara, ngibikuratse. <verse eid="EZK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 5:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 40:6">Yer 40:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:16">52:16</ref>. </char></note> Ahari ebyo bicweka oiheho rikye, orizingiririre omu kicweka kya ifo ky'ekanzu yaawe. <verse eid="EZK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 5:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 41:1">Ezk 41:1</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 41:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 42:18">42:18</ref>. </char></note> Kandi oihe rikye ahari eryo orinagye omu muriro, risye; aho niho omuriro guriruga gukahika aha nju ya Israeli. <verse eid="EZK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 5:5" />Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Egi niyo Yerusaalemu, ei naataire ahagati y'amahanga n'ensi ezigyehinguriririize. <verse eid="EZK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 5:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:47">Ezk 16:47</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 38:12">38:12</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ekagomera ebiragiro byangye, yaarengyesereza okukira ago mahanga, kandi ekagomera ebi naataireho okukira ezo nsi ezigyehinguriririize, ahabw'okwanga ebiragiro byangye n'okutagyendera mu bi naataireho. <verse eid="EZK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 5:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 11:12">Ezk 11:12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 16:47">16:47</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:10">Yer 2:10</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo Mukama RUHANGA arikugambira naagira ati: Nk'oku muri abanyarubwa okukira amahanga agabeehinguriririize, mukanga kworobera ebiragiro byangye, mutagyendere mu bi naataireho, kureka mukatwaza nk'emigyenzo y'abanyamahanga ababeehinguriririize oku eri, <verse eid="EZK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 5:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 11:9">Ezk 11:9</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 23:10">23:10</ref>. </char></note> nikyo Mukama RUHANGA arikugambira naagira ati: Reeba, nyowe, nyowe buzima naaba omubisha waawe, ndyakureetamu ebifubiro, amahanga nigakireeba. <verse eid="EZK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 5:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 1:12">Tonz 1:12</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:12">Dan 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 3:2">Amo 3:2</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'ebihagaro byawe, ndyakugira oku ntakakugiraga, kandi tindigaruka kukikora obundi. <verse eid="EZK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 5:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:2">Ezk 5:2</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 5:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:33">Bir 28:33</ref>; <ref loc="JER 19:9">Yer 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 2:20">Tonz 2:20</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo baishe b'abaana n'abatabani baabo bariryanirira omuriiwe, nkakureetaho ebifubiro, kandi ab'omuriiwe abariba bahonokireho, nkabataataanisiza ei emiyaga yona ereetwa. <verse eid="EZK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 5:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:20">Ezk 7:20</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 11:18">11:18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 14:16">14:16</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:30">Yer 7:30</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo Mukama RUHANGA naagira ati: Nk'oku mwahagaize Omwanya gwangye ogurikwera ebintu byanyu ebirikunugwa n'ebihagaro byanyu byona, buzimazima niinyerahira nti: Niinyija kukutuubya, eriisho ryangye tiririkusaasira, kandi tindikugirira mbabazi. <verse eid="EZK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 5:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:2">Ezk 5:2</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 6:11">6:11</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 6:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 9:16">Yer 9:16</ref>. </char></note> Kimwe kya kashatu ky'abantu baawe kiryaitwa orufu, kimarirweho enjara omuriiwe; kimwe kya kashatu ekindi kiryaitwa rurara aha mbaju zaawe zoona; kandi na kimwe kya kashatu ekindi ndyakitaataanisiza ei emiyaga yoona ereetwa, nsyoreyo rurara, ngibakuratse.<verse eid="EZK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 5:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 6:12">Ezk 6:12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 16:42">16:42</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:6">36:6</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 4:11">Tonz 4:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okwo nikwo ekiniga kyangye kirihwa, nkabamariraho ekiniga kyangye, nkeemara akandi aha mutima; bwanyima ku ndibamariraho ekiniga kyangye, baryamanya ku nyowe, MUKAMA, ngambire, nyine eihato. <verse eid="EZK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 5:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:5">Ezk 5:5</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 22:4">22:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:5">Yer 22:5</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 2:15">Tonz 2:15</ref>. </char></note> Kandi bwanyima ndyakuhindura amatongo n'ekijumo omu mahanga agakwehinguriririize n'omu maisho g'abahinguzi boona. <verse eid="EZK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 5:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 14:8">Ezk 14:8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:17">25:17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 24:9">Yer 24:9</ref>. </char></note> Ku ndibataho ebifubiro mbagwereirwe kubi, mbainiire ekiniga kingi nimbahana munonga, <verse eid="EZK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 5:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 4:16">Ezk 4:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:23">Bir 32:23</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 32:24">24</ref>. </char></note> ku ndibarekurira emyambi y'enjara erikwita, ei ndyohereza kubacwekyereza; ku ndiguma nimbareetaho enjara, naahenda eki murikwehimbagiririzaho, nibyo by'okurya byanyu, muryaba ekijumo eky'okugaaniiza, eky'okureeberaho, kandi ekirikutiinisa aha mahanga agabeehinguriririize. Nyowe MUKAMA, niinye naakigamba. <verse eid="EZK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 5:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 14:15">Ezk 14:15</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:22">Lev 26:22</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ndyabateeza enjara, n'enyamaishwa mbi zibashahure abaana; orufu n'okusheesha eshagama biryabarabamu, kandi ndyabareetaho rurara. Nyowe MUKAMA, niinye naakigamba.<verse eid="EZK 5:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EZK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Okuteisa abantu ahabw'okuramya ebishushani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 6:1" />Bwanyima ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyanyijaho nikigira kiti. <verse eid="EZK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 6:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 36:1">Ezk 36:1</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, naga amaisho aha bibungo bya Israeli, obihanuurire ebiribigwera, <verse eid="EZK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 6:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3-6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:30">Lev 26:30</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 26:31">31</ref>. </char></note> noogira oti: Imwe bibungo bya Israeli 'mwe, muhurire ekigambo kya Mukama RUHANGA. Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugambira enshozi, ebibungo, emigyera n'empanga, naagira ati: Reeba, nyowe, nyowe nyenka ndyabareetaho rurara, ncwekyereze emyanya yaanyu mikuru ey'okuramizamu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 36:4">Ezk 36:4</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 36:6">6</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="EZK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 6:4" />Amatambiro gaanyu garyacweka busha, n'ebishushani byanyu by'eizooba bisheenyagurwe, kandi emitumbi y'abantu baanyu abariitwa ndyaginaga omu maisho g'ebishushani byanyu ebirikuramibwa. <verse eid="EZK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 6:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:14">2 Bag 23:14</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 23:16">16</ref>. </char></note> Kandi emitumbi y'Abaisraeli ndyaginaga omu maisho g'ebishushani byabo, nnaganagye amagufa gaanyu embaju zoona ez'amatambiro gaanyu. <verse eid="EZK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 6:6" />Ahu murituura hoona, endembo zaanyu ziryahinduka amatongo, n'emyanya yaanyu mikuru y'okuramizamu eryasheenywa, amatambiro gaanyu gasheenywe, gacwekye busha; ebishushani byanyu ebirikuramibwa biryayatagurwa, bicwekyerezibwe, ebyoterero byanyu biihweho, n'emirimo yaanyu emarweho. <verse eid="EZK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 6:7" />Abarikwitwa baryagwa ahagati yaanyu, mumanyireho ku ndi MUKAMA.<verse eid="EZK 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 6:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 12:16">Ezk 12:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka ndyagira omuriimwe abu naarokora. Ku muriba mwagizire abaahonoka ahari rurara omu mahanga, ku muriba mwataataaniire omu nsi zaago, <verse eid="EZK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 6:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:16">Ezk 7:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:43">20:43</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:15">Kur 34:15</ref>. </char></note> bwanyima abarirokokaho omuriimwe baryanyijukira omu mahanga, ei bariba batwairwe bari enkwatwa, bamanye oku naahenzirwe emitima yaabo erikururuuha eyaanyimwire, n'amaisho gaabo agarikururuuha gakatwarwa ebishushani byabo ebirikuramibwa; baryayetamwa ahabw'ebihagaro byona ebi baakozire. <verse eid="EZK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 6:10" />Obwo baryamanya ku ndi MUKAMA, kandi eki naagambire nti: Ndyabareetaho ako kabi, ku ntarakigambiire busha.<verse eid="EZK 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 6:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 5:12">Ezk 5:12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 21:14">21:14</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:6">25:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Ahabw'ebihagaro byona ebi enju ya Israeli yaakozire, yemaamaate, oteere omutsindo ahansi, ogire oti: Ai bambe! Ahakuba baryaitwa rurara, enjara n'orufu. <verse eid="EZK 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 6:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:13">Ezk 5:13</ref>. </char></note> Ori hare aryaitwa rurara, n'oriba yaatsigaireho agoteirwe omu rurembo, aryaitwa enjara. Okwo nikwo ndihikiiriza ekiniga kyangye aharibo. <verse eid="EZK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 6:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 6:4">Ezk 6:4</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 6:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:28">20:28</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:20">Yer 2:20</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 4:13">Hos 4:13</ref>. </char></note> Emitumbi yaabo ku erirambirirana ahagati y'ebishushani byabo ebirikuramibwa, n'okwehinguririza amatambiro gaabo, aha mitwe y'ebibungo byona n'enshozi zoona, ahansi y'ekiti kyona ekibisi ekyetwa omurinzi, n'ahansi y'omwela gwona oguyumbize, ahu baabaire bootererera ebishushani byabo ebirikuramibwa emigaju erikutaamirana, obwo nibwo barimanya ku ndi MUKAMA. <verse eid="EZK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 6:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 6:6">Ezk 6:6</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:13">25:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 5:25">Isa 5:25</ref>. </char></note> Ndyababangira omukono, ensi ngihindure amatongo, n'ahatarikutuurwa, ahu baabaire batwire hoona, okuruga omu ihamba okuhika Ribula. Obwo nibwo barimanya ku ndi MUKAMA.<verse eid="EZK 6:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EZK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Abaisraeli okufubirwa ahabw'ebibi byabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 7:1" />Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyagaruka kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 7:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:23">Isa 10:23</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 4:18">Tonz 4:18</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 8:2">Amo 8:2</ref>. </char></note> Kandi iwe Mwana w'omuntu 'we, hurira eki Mukama RUHANGA arikugambira enju ya Israeli, naagira ati: Mbwenu byahwa! Muheru yaahika aha nshonda ina zoona ez'ensi. <verse eid="EZK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 7:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:8">Ezk 7:8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 18:30">18:30</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu naiwe yaakuhikaho, naaza kukurekurira ekiniga kyangye, nkucwere orubanja orushemereire emitwarize yaawe, nkufubire ahabw'ebihagaro byawe byona. <verse eid="EZK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 7:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 9:10">Ezk 9:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 11:21">11:21</ref>. </char></note> Eriisho ryangye tiririkusaasira, kandi tindikugirira mbabazi, kureka ndyakufubira, nkuture emitwarize yaawe n'ebihagaro byawe ebiri ahagati omuriiwe. Obwo nibwo orimanya ku ndi MUKAMA.<verse eid="EZK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 7:5" />Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Akabi, akabi k'aha muheru! Reeba nikaija. <verse eid="EZK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 7:6" />Muheru yaija, omuheru gwahika, byakwimukirira. Reeba, nibikuhikaho. <verse eid="EZK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 7:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:10">Ezk 7:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 12:23">12:23</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 1:14">Zef 1:14</ref>. </char></note> Iwe otwire omu nsi 'we, ekifubiro kyawe kyakuhikaho; obunaku bwahika, eizooba riri haihi, eizooba ry'okujagararira omu bibungo, ti ry'okuteereraho kaari k'okushemererwa. <verse eid="EZK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 7:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:3">Ezk 7:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:21">20:21</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu naaza kukushukaho ekiniga kyangye, nkumarireho okuguubwa kubi kwangye, nkucwere orubanja nk'emitwarize yaawe oku eri, nkufubire ninkutura ebihagaro byawe byona. <verse eid="EZK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 7:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:4">Ezk 7:4</ref>. </char></note> Eriisho ryangye tiririkusaasira, kandi tindikugirira mbabazi; kureka ndyakufubira nkuture emitwarize yaawe n'ebihagaro byawe ebiri omuriiwe. Obwo nibwo murimanya ku ndi MUKAMA ofubira.<verse eid="EZK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 7:10" />Reeba, eryo izooba! Reeba niriija. Ekifubiro kyawe kyaija, enkoni yaarabya, amaryo gaatooka. <verse eid="EZK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 7:11" />Orubwa rukuzire, rwahinduka enkoni y'obubi. Omuribo tihaine oritsigaraho; n'omu bintu byabo ebingi, nari omu butungi bwabo tihaine kiritsigaraho, n'obu kwakuba okugira omukuru orikweshumba abandi. <verse eid="EZK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 7:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:7">Ezk 7:7</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 7:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 24:2">Isa 24:2</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:29">1 Kor 7:29</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 7:30">30</ref>. </char></note> Obunaku bwahika, eizooba niriirira haihi. Omuguzi arekye kushemererwa, n'omutunzi arekye kuganya, ahabw'okuba ekiniga kiri aha ihanga ryabo ryona. <verse eid="EZK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 7:13" />Abatunzi tibarigarurirwa bi baatunzire, n'obu bariba bakiriho; ahabw'okuba ekiniga kiri aha ihanga ryabo ryona, kandi tikirihinduka; n'ahabw'okutahikiirira kwe tihariho muntu origumya ho amagara ge.<verse eid="EZK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 7:14" />Bateire enzamba, baateekateeka byona, kwonka tihaine ohurwire, ahabw'okuba ekiniga kyangye kiri aha ihanga ryabo ryona. <verse eid="EZK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 7:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 14:18">Yer 14:18</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 1:20">Tonz 1:20</ref>. </char></note> Aheeru hariho rurara, omunda harimu orufu n'enjara, abari omu ishwa nibaitwa rurara, n'abari omu rurembo nibamarwaho orufu n'enjara. <verse eid="EZK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 7:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 6:8">Ezk 6:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 38:14">Isa 38:14</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ku harigira abaahonokaho, baryahungira omu bibungo nk'enkombe z'omu mpanga, boona nibaganya, buri muntu naaborooga ahabw'ebibi bye. <verse eid="EZK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 7:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 21:7">Ezk 21:7</ref>. </char></note> Emikono ya boona eryahwa amaani, n'entegye za boona ziryabonda, zibe nk'amaizi. <verse eid="EZK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 7:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 55:5">Zab 55:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 15:2">Isa 15:2</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 15:3">3</ref>. </char></note> Baryayezirika ebiguniya, obwoba bubashekye; boona bagire enshoni ahamaisho, n'emitwe y'abantu boona ebe enkomborora. <verse eid="EZK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 7:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 44:12">Ezk 44:12</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 11:4">Enf 11:4</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 1:18">Zef 1:18</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 6:10">1 Tim 6:10</ref>. </char></note> Baryanaga efeeza zaabo omu mihanda, n'ezaabu zaabo tiziribaasa kubajuna aha izooba ry'ekiniga kya MUKAMA. Tiziribamara njara, kandi tiziribaigutsa; ahabw'okuba ezo nizo zaababeereire ekirikuteeza entsibo, ekyabareeteire okutahikiirira. <verse eid="EZK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 7:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 9:7">Ezk 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:30">Yer 7:30</ref>. </char></note> Ebyo bintu byabo ebihunzire bakaba babikoresa okwehaisa ekitiinisa ekitaine mugasho, kandi baabikoramu ebishushani byabo by'ebihagaro, n'ebintu byabo by'ebihagaro, n'ebintu byabo ebirikunugirwa kimwe. Nikyo mbihinduriire ebitashemeire aharibo. <verse eid="EZK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 7:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21, 22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 24:21">Ezk 24:21</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ndyabihayo omu mikono y'abanyamahanga, babinyagye, n'omu mikono y'ababi ab'omu nsi babishahure, babihagare. <verse eid="EZK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 7:22" />Ndyabaihaho amaisho, bashiishe Omwanya gwangye ogw'obuguzi bwingi, abambuzi bagutaahemu, bagushiishe, <verse eid="EZK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 7:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:11">Ezk 7:11</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 9:9">9:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 6:7">Yer 6:7</ref>. </char></note> baguhindure amatongo. Nk'oku ensi eijwire obwitani, n'orurembo rukaijura eitima, <verse eid="EZK 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 7:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:21">Ezk 7:21</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 1:6">Hab 1:6</ref>. </char></note> nikyo ndireetera amahanga agarikukira obubi, gakakubuura amaka gaabo. Ndyamaraho amaani gaabo agu barikwehimbisizaho, n'emyanya yaabo erikwera eshiishwe. <verse eid="EZK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 7:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 8:15">Yer 8:15</ref>. </char></note> Enaku ku ziriija, baryasherura obusingye, kwonka tibaribubona. <verse eid="EZK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 7:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:1">Ezk 20:1</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 20:3">3</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 2:7">Mal 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 12:6">1 Bag 12:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 4:20">Yer 4:20</ref>. </char></note> Akabi karyakuratwa akandi, orukuru rukuratwe orundi; baryasherura okworekwa ahari nabi, kwonka omunyamurwa aryabura ekiragiro, n'abakuru babure obwengye bw'okuha abantu. <verse eid="EZK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 7:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:4">Ezk 7:4</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe aryaganya, omunyiginya aryayehumbika okushoberwa, n'emikono y'abantu b'omuri egyo nsi eryasharazibwa obwoba. Ndyabagira nk'oku emitwarize yaabo eri, mbacwere emanja, nk'oku emicwere yaabo eri; haza bamanye ku ndi MUKAMA.<verse eid="EZK 7:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EZK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ezekieli okworekwa eihato eri Ruhanga aine ahabw'abantu be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 8:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 1:2">Ezk 1:2</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 1:3">3</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 6:32">2 Bag 6:32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwa mukaaga, omu kwezi kwa mukaaga aha kiro kyakwo kya kataano, nkaba nshutami omu nju yangye, abakuru ba Yuda banshutami omu maisho; omukono gwa Mukama RUHANGA gwampikiraho okwo. <verse eid="EZK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 8:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:27">Ezk 1:27</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:9">Dan 7:9</ref>. </char></note> Ku naagiire kugira nti, naareeba orikushusha omuntu; okwiha omu bwezirikiro bwe okugarura ahansi gukaba guri omuriro; kandi okwiha omu bwezirikiro bwe okugarura ahaiguru nihengyengyeta nk'omuringa ogweziibwe. <verse eid="EZK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 8:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:9">Ezk 2:9</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 3:12">3:12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 11:1">11:1</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 11:24">24</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:16">Bir 32:16</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 12:2">2 Kor 12:2</ref>. </char></note> Yaagorora ekirikushusha omukono, yaakwata obutsibo bw'eishokye ryangye, Omwoyo yankiriza, yampitsya ahagati y'ensi n'eiguru, yantwara Yerusaalemu ndi omu kworekwa kwa Ruhanga, yampitsya ah'orikutaahira nooza omu irembo ry'ekikaari ky'omunda, ekirikureeba aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, ahu ekitebe ky'ekishushani ekirikugwisa kubi Ruhanga kyabaire kiri. <verse eid="EZK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 8:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:23">Ezk 3:23</ref>. </char></note> Kandi reeba, ekitiinisa kya Ruhanga wa Israeli kikaba kiri okwo, nk'oku naakyorekyeirwe omu ruhita.<verse eid="EZK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 8:5" />Bwanyima yangira ati: Mwana w'omuntu, hati imutsya amaisho gaawe, oreebe aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho. Ntyo naagaimutsya, naareebayo, kandi reeba, aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho bw'ah'orikutaahira omu irembo ry'eitambiro hakaba hariho ekishushani ekirikureetera Ruhanga eihato. <verse eid="EZK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 8:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:14">2 Bus 36:14</ref>. </char></note> Yaagaruka yangira ati: Mwana w'omuntu, nooreeba ebi barikukora? Nooreeba ebihagaro by'eihano ebi ab'enju ya Israeli barikukorera aha, ebirikumbinga nkaza hare n'Omwanya gwangye ogurikwera? Kwonka noija kureeba ebindi bihagaro by'eihano ebirikukira ebyo. <verse eid="EZK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 8:7" />Bwanyima yantwara aha irembo ry'ekyo kikaari; ku naagiire kugira nti, naareeba ekishenshero omu rugo. <verse eid="EZK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 8:8" />Yangira ati: Mwana w'omuntu, hangusya ekyo kishenshero. Ntyo ku naahereize kukihangusya, naareeba orwigi. <verse eid="EZK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 8:9" />Yaagaruka yangira ati: Taahamu, oreebe ebihagaro by'eihano ebi barikukorera aha. <verse eid="EZK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 8:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:23">Rom 1:23</ref>. </char></note> Naanye naataahamu; ku naagiire kugira nti, naareeba ebishushani by'emiringo yoona y'ebirikwekurura ahansi, n'eby'enyamaishwa ezirikunugwa, n'eby'ebishushani byona ebirikuramibwa ab'enju ya Israeli, biteirwe aha kisiika embaju zoona. <verse eid="EZK 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 8:11" />Kandi omu maisho gaabyo heemereiremu abashaija makumi mushanju ab'omu bakuru b'enju ya Israeli, n'ahagati yaabo heemereireho Yaazania mwene Shafani, buri omwe aine ekyoterero kye omu ngaro; obwo omwika gw'obubaane nigucumbuuka ahaiguru nigutaamirana. <verse eid="EZK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 8:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 9:9">Ezk 9:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 10:11">Zab 10:11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:15">Isa 29:15</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima yangira ati: Mwana w'omuntu, ebyo waareeba ebi abakuru b'enju ya Israeli barikukorera omu mwirima, buri muntu omu bishengye by'ebishushani by'ebiteekateeko bye? Ahabw'okuba nibagira bati: MUKAMA tarikutureeba; MUKAMA atsigireho ensi yaitu. <verse eid="EZK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 8:13" />Yaagaruka yangira ati: Noija kureeba ebindi bihagaro by'eihano ebi barikukora.<verse eid="EZK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 8:14" />Bwanyima yantwara ah'orikutaahira nooza omu irembo ry'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho ery'enju ya MUKAMA; kandi reeba, hakaba hashutamiyo abakazi nibacurira Tamuzi. <verse eid="EZK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 8:15" />Yangira ati: Mwana w'omuntu 'we, ebyo waabireeba? Noija kureeba ebindi bihagaro ebirikukira ebyo.<verse eid="EZK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 8:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 9:2">Ezk 9:2</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 40:6">Kur 40:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:27">Yer 2:27</ref>; <ref loc="JER 8:2">8:2</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:17">Yoel 2:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima yantwara, yampitsya omu kikaari ky'omunda eky'enju ya MUKAMA. Ku naagiire kugira nti, naareeba aha rwigi rwa hekalu ya MUKAMA ahagati y'ekisasi n'eitambiro abashaija nka makumi abiri na bataano, bateire hekalu ya MUKAMA emigongo nibareeba oburugwa-izooba, nibaramya eizooba, amaisho bagahangire ei ririkureetwa. <verse eid="EZK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 8:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:23">Ezk 7:23</ref>. </char></note> Yaagaruka yangira ati: Mwana w'omuntu 'we, ebyo waabireeba? Noogira ngu ebihagaro ebi ab'enju ya Yuda barikukora n'ekintu kikye? Bashemereire kubuzya ensi eby'eitima n'okweyongyera kungwisa kubi? Reeba, nibata amataagi aha nyindo. <verse eid="EZK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 8:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:11">Ezk 5:11</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 5:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 1:28">Enf 1:28</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:15">Isa 1:15</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo ndikorera eby'ekiniga kingi; eriisho ryangye tiriribasaasira, kandi tindibagirira mbabazi; n'obu barimboroogyera omu matu bata, tindibahurira.<verse eid="EZK 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EZK 9" />
  <para style="s1">Ezekieli okworekwa abashaija mukaaga abaatumirwe kwita abataine kamanyiso aha buso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 9:1" />Bwanyima naahurira naagamba n'eiraka rihango, naagira ati: Imwe abarikurinda orurembo, mwirire haihi, buri muntu aine eky'okurwanisa ekirikucwekyereza omu ngaro ze. <verse eid="EZK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 9:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 8:16">Ezk 8:16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 4:1">2 Bus 4:1</ref>. </char></note> Kandi reeba, haija abashaija mukaaga, baareetwa omu muhanda gw'eirembo rya ruguru, eririkureeba aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, buri omwe aine eky'okurwanisa ekirikwita omu ngaro ze; kandi ahakaba hariho ondiijo mushaija, ojwaire ebijwaro bya kitaani, ari hamwe nabo, aine eihembe rya bwino aha izinio. Baataaha, baayemerera aha rubaju rw'eitambiro ry'omuringa. <verse eid="EZK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 9:3" />Baashanga ekitiinsia kya Ruhanga wa Israeli kyatembire kuruga ahari baakerubi, ahu kyabaire kiba, kyahika aha muryango gw'enju. MUKAMA yaayeta ogwo mushaija owaabaire ajwaire ebijwaro bya kitaani, aine eihembe rya bwino aha izinio. <verse eid="EZK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 9:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 119:136">Zab 119:136</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:3">Kush 7:3</ref>. </char></note> Yaamugira ati: Irooko orabarabe omu rurembo Yerusaalemu, ote akamanyiso aha buso bw'abantu abarikutsinda nibabooga ahabw'ebihagaro byona ebirikukorerwamu; <verse eid="EZK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 9:5" />kandi abo bashaija mukaaga yaabagambira mpuriire, naagira ati: Mwirooko murabarabe omu rurembo mumukuratiire, mwite abantu; amaisho gaanyu garekye kusaasira, kandi mutagira ou mwagirira embabazi; <verse eid="EZK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 9:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:17">2 Bus 36:17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 9:4">Kush 9:4</ref>. </char></note> mumareho abagurusi, abatsigazi, empangare, abaana bato n'abakazi; kwonka omuntu weena oine ako kamanyiso mutamukoraho. Kandi mutandikire omu Mwanya gwangye ogurikwera. Batyo baatandikira ahari abo bakuru abaabaire bari omu maisho g'enju. <verse eid="EZK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 9:7" />Yaagaruka yaabagira ati: Mushiishe enju, kandi ebikaari byayo mubiijuze emitumbi. Mbwenu mwirooko mugyende. Batyo baagyenda, baita ab'omu rurembo. <verse eid="EZK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 9:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:8">Ezk 7:8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 11:13">11:13</ref>. </char></note> Ku baabaire nibakibaita, naatsigara nyenka, naagwa ahansi njuumaire, naataka nti: Ai bambe, Mukama RUHANGA! Mbwenu omu kushuka ahari Yerusaalemu ekiniga kyawe nooyenda kumaraho Abaisraeli boona abatsigaireho?<verse eid="EZK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 9:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 7:23">Ezk 7:23</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 8:12">8:12</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 21:16">2 Bag 21:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yangira ati: Orubanja rw'enju ya Israeli n'eya Yuda rurengyesereize munonga; ensi eijwire eshagama, n'orurembo rwijwirwemu okwita emanja; ahakuba nibagira bati: MUKAMA atsigireho ensi yaitu, kandi taine ki arikureeba. <verse eid="EZK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 9:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:4">Ezk 7:4</ref>. </char></note> Naanye eriisho ryangye tiriribasaasira, kandi tindibagirira mbabazi; kureka ndyabatura ebi baakozire, mbibarunde aha mitwe.<verse eid="EZK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 9:11" />Bwanyima reeba, ogwo mushaija owaabaire ajwaire ebijwaro bya kitaani, aine eihembe rya bwino aha izinio, yaija, yaagamba ebi baamutuma, naagira ati: Naakora nk'oku wandagiira.<verse eid="EZK 9:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EZK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Ezekieli okworekwa ekitiinisa kya Ruhanga na baakerubi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 10:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 1:22">Ezk 1:22</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 1:26">26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku naagiire kugira nti, naareeba, omu mwanya ogw'ahaiguru y'emitwe ya baakerubi, ekirikushusha eibaare rya safiro, ekiri nk'ekitebe ky'obukama. <verse eid="EZK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 10:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 9:2">Ezk 9:2</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 9:3">3</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaagambira ogwo mushaija owaabaire ajwaire ebijwaro bya kitaani ati: Irooko oze ahagati y'enziga ezirikwehinguririza, eziri ahansi ya baakerubi; bwanyima oijuze engaro zaawe zombi makara agarikwotsya, agu oraihe ahagati ya baakerubi, oganaganagye ahaiguru y'orurembo. Atyo yaazizamu nindeeba. <verse eid="EZK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 10:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 8:16">Ezk 8:16</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 8:10">1 Bag 8:10</ref>. </char></note> Obu ogwo mushaija yaataahamu, baakerubi bakaba beemereire aha rubaju rw'enju orw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo, n'ekicu kiijwire ekikaari ky'omunda. <verse eid="EZK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 10:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:28">Ezk 1:28</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 43:2">43:2</ref>. </char></note> Ekitiinisa kya MUKAMA kyaruga ahari baakerubi, kyainamuka, kyayemerera aha muryango gw'enju; egyo nju yaijura ekicu, n'ekikaari kyaijura okumurinkana kw'ekitiinisa kya MUKAMA. <verse eid="EZK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 10:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:24">Ezk 1:24</ref>. </char></note> Okuhoorera kw'amapapa ga baakerubi kwahuririrwa hare, kwahika n'omu kikaari ky'aheeru, kuri nk'eiraka rya Ruhanga Ow'obushoboorozi bwona yaaba naagamba.<verse eid="EZK 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 10:6" />MUKAMA ku yaaherize kuragiira ogwo mushaija owaabaire ajwaire ebijwaro bya kitaani ati: Iha omuriro ahagati y'enziga ezirikwehinguririza, ahagati ya baakerubi, yaazizamu, yaayemerera aha rubaju rw'enziga emwe. <verse eid="EZK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 10:7" />Bwanyima kerubi yaagorora omukono gwe, ari ahagati ya baakerubi bagyenzi be, yaakununkirira omuriro oguri ahagati ya baakerubi, yaiha omuriro ahari ogwo, yaaguta omu ngaro z'ogwo mushaija owaabaire ajwaire ebijwaro bya kitaani; nawe yaagutwara, yaashohora. <verse eid="EZK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 10:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:8">Ezk 1:8</ref>. </char></note> Kandi baakerubi abo bakaba baine ekirikushusha engaro y'omuntu ahansi y'amapapa gaabo.<verse eid="EZK 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ezekieli okugaruka kworekwa ebihangirwe bina ebiine amagara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 10:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:9, 10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 1:15">Ezk 1:15</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 1:16">16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku naagiire kugira nti, naareeba enziga ina ziri aha rubaju rwa baakerubi, enziga emwe aha rubaju rwa buri kerubi; kandi ezo nziga zikaba nizishusha eibaare rya berulo. <verse eid="EZK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 10:10" />Emisusire y'ezo nziga, zoona ina zikaba nizishushana, nizireebeka oti buri nziga eri omu ndiijo. <verse eid="EZK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 10:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:17">Ezk 1:17</ref>. </char></note> Ku zaabaire ziba nizigyenda, zigyenda zitarikuhinduka, nizitoora ibara rubaju ahari ezo ina. Ei enziga ey'omumaisho yaabaire ereeba yoona, ngyenzi zaayo zigikurata, nizigyenda zitarikuhinduka. <verse eid="EZK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 10:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:18">Ezk 1:18</ref>; <ref loc="REV 4:8">Kush 4:8</ref>. </char></note> Ezo nziga ezi baakerubi bana baabaire baine, hamwe n'empanka zaazo n'enyomyo zaazo, byona bikaba biine amaisho embaju zoona. <verse eid="EZK 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 10:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 10:2">Ezk 10:2</ref>. </char></note> Ezo nziga, oku naahuriire, zikaba nizeetwa “enziga ezirikwehinguririza”. <verse eid="EZK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 10:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:6">Ezk 1:6</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 10">10</ref>. </char></note> Kandi buri kerubi akaba aine obuso buna; ahamaisho h'ow'okubanza hakaba hari ahamaisho ha kerubi; ahamaisho h'owa kabiri hari ah'omuntu; ah'owa kashatu hari ah'entare, kandi ah'owa kana hari ah'eishamba.<verse eid="EZK 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 10:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 1:1">Ezk 1:1</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 1:5">5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baakerubi abo baaguruka, baaza ahaiguru. Baakerubi abo nibyo bihangirwe ebiine amagara ebi naareebire aha mugyera Kebari. <verse eid="EZK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 10:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:19">Ezk 1:19</ref>. </char></note> Baakerubi abo ku baabaire bagyenda, ezo nziga zibagyenda aha rubaju; ku baabaire baimutsya amapapa kuguruka kuza ahaiguru, ezo nziga zikaba zitahinduka kubaruga aha rubaju. <verse eid="EZK 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 10:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:21">Ezk 1:21</ref>. </char></note> Ku baabaire beemerera, nazo zeemerera; bakiguruka, nazo ziguruka nabo; ahabw'okuba Omwoyo w'ebyo bihangirwe ebiine amagara akaba azirimu.<verse eid="EZK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 10:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 7:20-22">Ezk 7:20-22</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 9:12">Hos 9:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima ekitiinisa kya MUKAMA kyaruga aha muryango gw'enju, kyayemerera ahaiguru ya baakerubi. <verse eid="EZK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 10:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 11:1">Ezk 11:1</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 11:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 43:2">43:2</ref>. </char></note> Baakerubi baimutsya amapapa gaabo, baaguruka baaza ahaiguru, ezo nziga zibari aha rubaju, nimbareeba nibagyenda; baayemerera aha rwigi rw'eirembo ry'enju ya MUKAMA ery'oburugwa-izooba; n'ekitiinisa kya Ruhanga wa Israeli kyabasangira.<verse eid="EZK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 10:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 1:15">Ezk 1:15</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 1:22">22</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 1:26">26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebyo nibyo bihangirwe ebiine amagara ebi naareebire ahansi ya Ruhanga wa Israeli aha mugyera Kebari; bwanyima naamanya ku bari baakerubi. <verse eid="EZK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 10:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:6">Ezk 1:6</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 1:8">8</ref>. </char></note> Buri omwe akaba aine ahamaisho hana, n'amapapa ana, kandi ahansi y'amapapa gaabo hariho ebirikushusha engaro z'omuntu. <verse eid="EZK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 10:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:10">Ezk 1:10</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 1:12">12</ref>. </char></note> Kandi emisusire yaabo ey'ahamaisho niyo eri ei naareebire aha mugyera Kebari. Buri omwe yaagumizamu atarikuhinduka.<verse eid="EZK 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="EZK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Ezekieli okworekwa ebifubiro by'Abaisraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 3:12">Ezk 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 10:19">10:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Omwoyo yankiriza, yantwara aha irembo ry'enju ya MUKAMA, eririkureeba oburugwa-izooba; kandi reeba, aha rwigi rw'eryo irembo hakaba hariho abashaija makumi abiri na bataano; omuri abo naareebamu Yaazania mwene Azuri, na Pelatia mwene Benaaya, abategyeki b'eihanga. <verse eid="EZK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 11:2" />Atyo yangira ati: Mwana w'omuntu, aba bashaija nibo bantu abacuma enaama z'okutahikiirira, bakaha ab'omuri oru rurembo obwengye bubi, <verse eid="EZK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 11:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 12:22">Ezk 12:22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 24:3">24:3</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 24:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 29:27">Yer 29:27</ref>, <ref loc="JER 29:28">28</ref>. </char></note> nibagira bati: Obunaku bw'okwombeka amaju tibukahikire; oru rurembo n'enyungu, naitwe turi enyama. <verse eid="EZK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 11:4" />N'ahabw'ekyo Mwana w'omuntu, hanuura, obahanuurire ebiribabaho.<verse eid="EZK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 11:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 20:32">Ezk 20:32</ref>; <ref loc="JER 16:17">Yer 16:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Omwoyo wa MUKAMA yaanyijaho, yangira ati: Gira oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Imwe nju ya Israeli 'mwe, ebi nibyo murikuteekateeka; ahakuba nimmanya ebiri omumitima yaanyu. <verse eid="EZK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 11:6" />Murengyesereize kwita abantu baanyu omuri oru rurembo, n'enguuto zaamwo mwaziijuza emitumbi. <verse eid="EZK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 11:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 24:7">Ezk 24:7</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo Mukama RUHANGA arikugirira ati: Abantu baanyu abu mwaitsire, mukarambika emitumbi yaabo omuri oru rurembo nibo nyama, n'oru rurembo nirwo nyungu; kwonka imwe muryarwihwamu. <verse eid="EZK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 11:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 10:24">Enf 10:24</ref>; <ref loc="JER 42:16">Yer 42:16</ref>. </char></note> Mukaba mutiina rurara, kwonka ndyagireeta, ebaite; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba. <verse eid="EZK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 11:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:8">Ezk 5:8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 7:21">7:21</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ndyarubaihamu, mbaheyo omu mikono y'abanyamahanga, mbateho ebifubiro. <verse eid="EZK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 11:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:18-21">2 Bag 25:18-21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 39:6">Yer 39:6</ref>. </char></note> Muryaitwa rurara, mbacwere orubanja muri aha mwatano gwa Israeli; haza mumanye ku ndi MUKAMA. <verse eid="EZK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 11:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 11:3">Ezk 11:3</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 11:7">7</ref>. </char></note> Oru rurembo tiruribabeera nyungu, kandi naimwe timuriba nyama omuriyo; kureka ndyabacwera orubanja muri aha mwatano gwa Israeli; <verse eid="EZK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 11:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 8:10">Ezk 8:10</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 8:14">14</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 8:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:30">Bir 12:30</ref>. </char></note> haza muryamanya ku ndi MUKAMA; ahabw'okuba timuragyendeire mu biragiro byangye, n'obu kwakuba okuhikiiriza ebi naataireho; kureka mukakuratira ebiragiro by'abanyamahanga ababeehinguriririize.<verse eid="EZK 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 11:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 9:8">Ezk 9:8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 11:1">11:1</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 5:5">Byak 5:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima ku naabaire ninkihanuura, Pelatia mwene Benaaya yaafa. Naagwa ahansi njuumaire, naataka n'eiraka rihango ningira nti: Ai bambe, Mukama RUHANGA! Noija kumariraho kimwe abatsigaireho omu Baisraeli?<verse eid="EZK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ezekieli okworekwa okugarurwa kw'Abaisraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 11:14" />Bwanyima ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 11:15" />Mwana w'omuntu, beene waanyu, abu waabingirwe nabo, enju ya Israeli yoona, abo boona nibo abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu bagambireho nibagira bati: Barugire ahari MUKAMA, baaza hare; ensi egi niitwe tugihairwe kuba obuhunguzi. <verse eid="EZK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 11:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:13">Isa 8:13</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 8:14">14</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo obagire oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: N'obu ndaabe naabaihire omu nsi yaabo, nkabatwara hare omu mahanga, kandi nkabataataanisiza omu nsi zaago, kwonka ndyababeera Omwanya ogurikwera okumara omwanya mukye omuri ezo nsi ezi baagiiremu. <verse eid="EZK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 11:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 28:25">Ezk 28:25</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 11:12">Isa 11:12</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo ogire oti: Oku nikwo Mukama arikugamba naagira ati: Ndyabataaruura mbaihe omu mahanga, mbateeranire hamwe, nimbaiha omu nsi ezi mwataataaniiremu, mbahe ensi ya Israeli. <verse eid="EZK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 11:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:11">Ezk 5:11</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:23">37:23</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ku barihikayo, baryaihamu ebintu byona ebirikunugwa, n'ebihagaro byayo byona. <verse eid="EZK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 11:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 36:26">Ezk 36:26</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 51:10">Zab 51:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:39">Yer 32:39</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 7:12">Zek 7:12</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 4:32">Byak 4:32</ref>. </char></note> Ndyabaha omutima gumwe, mbatemu omwoyo musya, nyihe omutima gw'eibare omu buhangwa bwabo, mbahe omutima gworobi, <verse eid="EZK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 11:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 14:11">Ezk 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:28">36:28</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:12">Lev 26:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:33">Yer 31:33</ref>. </char></note> babone kugyendera omu biragiro byangye, n'okukwata ebi naataireho n'okubyorobera; kandi baryaba abantu bangye, naanye mbe Ruhanga waabo. <verse eid="EZK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 11:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 9:4-6">Ezk 9:4-6</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka abo abu emitima yaabo erikukuratira ebyabo ebirikunugwa n'ebihagaro byabo, ndyabatura ebi baakozire, mbibatungikirire aha mitwe; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba.<verse eid="EZK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 11:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 10:19">Ezk 10:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima baakerubi baimutsya amapapa gaabo, n'enziga zaabo zibari aha rubaju, n'ekitiinisa kya Ruhanga wa Israeli kiri ahaiguru yaabo. <verse eid="EZK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 11:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 14:4">Zek 14:4</ref>. </char></note> Ekitiinisa kya MUKAMA kyaimuka, kyaruga ahagati y'orurembo, kyayemerera aha kibungo ekiri aha burugwa-izooba bw'orurembo. <verse eid="EZK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 11:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 8:3">Ezk 8:3</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Omwoyo yankiriza, yantwara Bukaludaaya omu nkwatwa, nkiri omu kworekwa kw'Omwoyo wa Ruhanga. Ku naahikireyo, okwo kworekwa oku naareebire kwandugaho. <verse eid="EZK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 11:25" />Ntyo naateekyerereza ezo nkwatwa, ebi nyorekirwe MUKAMA byona.<verse eid="EZK 11:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="EZK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Obumanyiso bw'okuhunga kwabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 12:1" />Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyagaruka kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 12:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:5">Ezk 2:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 6:9">Isa 6:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 5:21">Yer 5:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:13">Mat 13:13</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, otuura omu b'enju engomi, abaine amaisho g'okureeba, kwonka tibareeba, n'amatu g'okuhurira, kwonka tibahurira; ahakuba n'enju engomi. <verse eid="EZK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 12:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 36:3">Yer 36:3</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo, Mwana w'omuntu, koma ebintu byawe by'okufuruka, ofurukye nyomushana nibakureeba, ogyende nk'omufuruki orugye omu mwanya gwawe, oze omu gundi nibakureeba. Obundi bakaayetegyereza, n'obu baraabe bari enju engomi. <verse eid="EZK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 12:4" />Oshohoze ebintu byawe nyomushana nibakureeba, nk'eby'okufuruka oku biba; naiwe oshohore wenka omu mwabazyo nibakureeba, nk'oku abarikufuruka bagira. <verse eid="EZK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 12:5" />Bwanyima ocwe ekishenshero omu rugo nibakureeba, obe nimwo waarabya ebyo bintu. <verse eid="EZK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 12:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 4:3">Ezk 4:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:18">Isa 8:18</ref>. </char></note> Ote ebyo bintu byawe aha ibega nibakureeba, obishohoze hariho omwirima; kandi oyeshwekye ahamaisho, orekye kureeba ahansi, ahabw'okuba nkutaireho kuba ak'okureeberaho aha nju ya Israeli. <verse eid="EZK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 12:7" />Ntyo naakora nk'oku naaragiirwa. Naashohoza ebintu byangye nyomushana, nk'oku eby'okufuruka biba; kandi omu mwabazyo naacwa ekishenshero omu rugo n'emikono yangye nyenka. Naashohora hariho omwirima, ntaire ebintu byangye aha ibega nibandeeba.<verse eid="EZK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 12:8" />Omu kasheeshe ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 12:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 24:19">Ezk 24:19</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, enju ya Israeli, enju engomi, tekubuurize eti: Nookora ki? <verse eid="EZK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 12:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:11-13">2 Bus 36:11-13</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu obagire oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Okuhanuura oku n'okw'eby'omunyiginya w'omuri Yerusaalemu, n'eby'ab'enju ya Israeli boona barimu. <verse eid="EZK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 12:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 24:24">Ezk 24:24</ref>. </char></note> Ogire oti: Ndi ak'okureeberaho kaanyu; nk'oku nkozire, nabo nikwo barikorwa batyo; baryatwarwa omu bukwata, bari enkwatwa. <verse eid="EZK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 12:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:4">2 Bag 25:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 39:4">Yer 39:4</ref>. </char></note> N'omunyiginya, oriba ari omuribo, aryata ebintu bye aha ibega hariho omwirima, ashohore, acwe ekishenshero omu rugo, akirabemu; aryayeshweka ahamaisho, arekye kureeba ahansi n'amaisho ge. <verse eid="EZK 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 12:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 17:20">Ezk 17:20</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 25:7">2 Bag 25:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:11">Yer 52:11</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ndyamurengyezaho ekigoye, akwatwe omutego gwangye; bwanyima mmutware Babulooni omu nsi y'Abakaludaaya, kwonka tarigireeba; kandi niyo arigwa. <verse eid="EZK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 12:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:2">Ezk 5:2</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 5:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 25:5">2 Bag 25:5</ref>. </char></note> Boona abariba bamushagatiire kumuhwera, n'engabo ze zoona, ndyabataataanisiza embaju zoona ei emiyaga ereetwa, nsyoreyo rurara, ngibakuratse. <verse eid="EZK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 12:15" />Ku ndibataataanisiza omu mahanga, naabanaganaga omu nsi zaago, baryamanya ku ndi MUKAMA. <verse eid="EZK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 12:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 6:8">Ezk 6:8</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ndyareka bamwe omuribo bahonokye ahari rurara, enjara n'orufu, babone kwaturira ebihagaro byabo byona omu mahanga ei bariza; kandi bamanye ku ndi MUKAMA.<verse eid="EZK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 12:17" />Kandi ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyagaruka kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 12:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 4:10">Ezk 4:10</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 4:11">11</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, rya eby'okurya byawe nootengyeza, kandi onywe amaizi nootetema, oyemereize omutima, <verse eid="EZK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 12:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 4:16">Ezk 4:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 7:23">7:23</ref>. </char></note> ogambire abantu omuri egyo nsi oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba aha by'abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu n'ab'omu nsi ya Israeli, naagira ati: Baryarya eby'okurya byabo beemereize emitima, kandi banywe amaizi bashobeirwe, ahabw'okuba ensi yaabo eryaba emazirwemu ebigirimu byona, nibaturwa eitima ry'abagitwiremu boona. <verse eid="EZK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 12:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 6:6">Ezk 6:6</ref>. </char></note> Endembo ezitwiremu ziryahindurwa amatongo, ensi ebe kifurukwa, naimwe muryamanya ku ndi MUKAMA.<verse eid="EZK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 12:21" />Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyagaruka kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 12:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 11:3">Ezk 11:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 5:19">Isa 5:19</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:4">2 Pet 3:4</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, egi nfumu ei mucwa aha nsi ya Israeli, erikugira eti: Ebiro bitwireho; okworekwa kwona kurugiremu busha, neemanyisa ki? <verse eid="EZK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 12:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:7">Ezk 7:7</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 7:12">12</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo obagire oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugmba naagira ati: Egyo nfumu ndyagimaraho, kandi tibarigaruka kugicwa omuri Israeli. Kureka obagire oti: Ebiro biiriire haihi, na buri kworekwa kuri haihi kuhikiirizibwa. <verse eid="EZK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 12:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 13:6">Ezk 13:6</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 13:7">7</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 13:23">23</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba tiharigaruka kubaho kworekwa kw'ebishuba, nari okuragura kw'okumamarika omu nju ya Israeli; <verse eid="EZK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 12:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 12:2">Ezk 12:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 13:22">Isa 13:22</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 55:11">55:11</ref>. </char></note> kureka nyowe MUKAMA, ndyagamba, kandi eki ndigamba kiryaba kwo; tikirigaruka kukyererezibwa, kureka omu biro byanyu, imwe enju engomi, ndyagamba ekigambo, nkihikiirize; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba. <verse eid="EZK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 12:26" />Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyagaruka kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 12:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 12:22">Ezk 12:22</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 6:3">Amo 6:3</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, reeba, ab'enju ya Israeli nibagira bati; Ebi ayorekirwe ebiro ebi, n'ebiriija hahweireho ebiro bingi; kandi naahanuura eby'obunaku obukiri hare munonga. <verse eid="EZK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 12:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 12:25">Ezk 12:25</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo obagire oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Tihariho kigambo kyangye na kimwe ekirigaruka kukyererezibwa; kureka ekigambo eki ndikugamba kiryaba kwo; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 12:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="EZK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ebya baanabi b'ebishuba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 13:1" />Kandi ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 13:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:16">Yer 23:16</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, hanuura ebiriba ahri baanabi ba Israeli abarikuhanuura; ogambire abarikuhanuura ebi barikugunja omu mitima yaabo, noogira oti: Muhurire ekigambo kya MUKAMA! <verse eid="EZK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 13:3" />Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Baanabi b'ebifa-mutima baryareeba enaku, abakuratira eby'omu mitima yaabo bonka, haza bataine ki boorekirwe. <verse eid="EZK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 13:4" />Iwe Israeli, baanabi baawe bari nka zaamuha z'omu matongo. <verse eid="EZK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 13:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 22:30">Ezk 22:30</ref>. </char></note> Timukainamukaga ha bisheenyuka, n'obu kwakuba okwombeka orugo, ahabw'enju ya Israeli, ngu mubone kwemerera omu rugamba muhamire, aha izooba rya MUKAMA. <verse eid="EZK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 13:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6, 7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 12:24">Ezk 12:24</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 22:28">22:28</ref>; <ref loc="JER 14:14">Yer 14:14</ref>. </char></note> Baanabi abo boorekirwe ebitaine ku biri, baaragura eby'ebishuba, nibagira bati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba, haza MUKAMA atabatumire; kandi baareetera abantu kugira amatsiko ngu ekigambo kyabo kiryaba kwo. <verse eid="EZK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 13:7" />Timurikumanya ku okworekwa oku mureebire kuri okwa busha, kandi okuragura kwanyu ku kuri okw'ebishuba, obu murikugira muti: MUKAMA niwe akigambire, haza ntaine ki ngambire?<verse eid="EZK 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 13:8" />Nikyo Mukama RUHANGA arikugirira ati: Ahabw'okugamba ebitaine mugasho, mukoorekwa eby'ebishuba, reeba, nikyo ndikubarwanisiza, nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira. <verse eid="EZK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 13:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 13:6">Ezk 13:6</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:38">20:38</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 7:5">Neh 7:5</ref>. </char></note> Omukono gwangye guryaguma gurwanise baanabi, abarikworekwa ebitaine mugasho, bakaragura eby'ebishuba; tibariba b'omu ishengyero ry'abantu bangye, tibarihandiikwa mu kitabo ky'amaziina g'ab'enju ya Israeli, n'obu kwakuba okutaaha omu nsi ya Israeli; kandi muryamanya ku ndi Mukama RUHANGA. <verse eid="EZK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 13:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 22:28">Ezk 22:28</ref>; <ref loc="JER 6:14">Yer 6:14</ref>. </char></note> Baanabi abo bahabiise abantu bangye nibagira bait: N'obusingye, haza obusingye butariho; kandi abantu ku barikwombeka ekisiika ekitagumire, baanabi abo baija bakisiigiriza n'obudongo butanogire; <verse eid="EZK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 13:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:11, 13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 38:22">Ezk 38:22</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo ogambire abo abarikukisiigiriza n'obudongo butanogire oti: Nikiija kugwa. Haryagwa enjura nyingi n'emengo z'orubaare, haije n'eihunga ry'amaani. <verse eid="EZK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 13:12" />Mbwenu ekyo kisiika ku kirigwa, tibaribabuuza bati: Nya budongo buri obu mwasiigiriize burahi? <verse eid="EZK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 13:13" />Nikyo Mukama RUHANGA arikugirira ati: Ahabw'ekiniga ndyareeta eihunga ry'amaani; ahabw'okuguubwa kubi ngwise enjura nyingi, kandi ahabw'ekiniga ngwise emengo z'orubaare, bikicwekyereze. <verse eid="EZK 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 13:14" />Ndyasheenya ekisiika eki mwasiigiriize n'obudongo, nkigwise ahansi, omusingi gwakyo gureebwe; omu kugwa kwakyo naimwe mucwekyereremu; haza mumanye ku ndi MUKAMA. <verse eid="EZK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 13:15" />Okwo nikwo ndimarira ekiniga kyangye ahari ekyo kisiika n'ahari abo abaakisiigiriize n'obudongo obutanogire; kandi imwe, ndyabagambira nti: Ekisiika n'abaakisiigiriize n'obudongo tibikiriho, <verse eid="EZK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 13:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 13:10">Ezk 13:10</ref>. </char></note> abo nibo baanabi ba Israeli abaabaire nibahanuura ebya Yerusaalemu, bakagireebera okworekwa kw'obusingye, haza obusingye butariho; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba.<verse eid="EZK 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 13:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 13:2">Ezk 13:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naiwe Mwana w'omuntu 'we, teera ekitsyori bahara b'abantu baawe abarikuhanuura ebi barikugunja omu mitima yaabo, obahanuurire ebiribabaho, <verse eid="EZK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 13:18" />noogira oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Baryareeba enaku, abakazi ababaziira engisha, bakazijweka abantu boona omu bujwariro bw'enyerere, bakakora n'ebitambaara by'okwetwekyerera eby'abantu aba buri rugyero, nibahiiga amagara gaabo! Nimwija kuhiiga amagara g'abantu bangye, mukiza ag'abandi, ngu mubone kwetungira amagoba? <verse eid="EZK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 13:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 28:21">Enf 28:21</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 3:5">Mik 3:5</ref>. </char></note> Mukanjumisa omu bantu bangye ahabw'eigaro rimwe rya sayiri n'otwate tw'oburo, nimwita abantu abatakufiire, mukakiza abatashemereire kugumaho, nimubakirisa ebishuba ebi murikubeihabeihesa abantu bangye, abakunda kuhurira ebishuba.<verse eid="EZK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 13:20" />Nikyo Mukama RUHANGA arikugirira ati: Reeba, niinyanga engisha zaanyu ezi murikutegyesa abantu; ndyazibahuruutura aha mikono, ndekye abantu abu murikutega beegyendere nk'enyonyi. <verse eid="EZK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 13:21" />Ebitambaara byanyu eby'okwetwekyerera ndyabibataagurira aha mutwe, njune abantu bangye, mbaihe omu mikono yaanyu; tibarigaruka kuba mu mikono yaanyu obundi nk'eminyago; kandi muryamanya ku ndi MUKAMA. <verse eid="EZK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 13:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:21">Ezk 18:21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:14">Yer 23:14</ref>. </char></note> Mukahahaaza omutima gw'ohikiriire n'ebishuba byanyu, ou nyowe ntahahaarize; mwagumya omubi ngu arekye kuhinduka kuruga omu mitwarize ye emibi, akajuna amagara ge; <verse eid="EZK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 13:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 12:24">Ezk 12:24</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:10">34:10</ref>. </char></note> n'ahabw'ekyo timurigaruka kureeba kworekwa okutaine mugasho, n'obu kwakuba okuragura; kandi ndyajuna abantu bangye, mbaihe omu mikono yaanyu. Obwo nibwo murimanya ku ndi MUKAMA.<verse eid="EZK 13:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="EZK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Okuteisa abarikuramya ebishushani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 14:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 8:1">Ezk 8:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima bamwe aha bakuru ba Israeli baija ahi ndi, banshutama omu maisho. <verse eid="EZK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 14:2" />Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 14:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:19">Ezk 7:19</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:3">20:3</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, aba bantu bataahize omu mitima yaabo ebishushani byabo ebirikuramibwa, baata ekirikuteeza entsibo eky'okutahikiirira kwabo omu maisho gaabo. Noogira ngu nshemereire kubaikiriza kugira ekintu kyona eki baanyehanuuzaho? <verse eid="EZK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 14:4" />Mbwenu ogambe nabo, obagire oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Ibara muntu ow'omu nju ya Israeli otaahize omu mutima gwe ebishushani bye ebirikuramibwa, akata ekirikuteeza entsibo eky'okutahikiirira kwe omu maisho ge, haza akaza owa nabi, nyowe MUKAMA niinye ndimwegarukiramu nimmutura omuna gw'ebishushani bye ebirikuramibwa, <verse eid="EZK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 14:5" />mbone kukwata emitima y'ab'enju ya Israeli, abampararukire ahabw'ebishushani byabo ebirikuramibwa.<verse eid="EZK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 14:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 18:30">Ezk 18:30</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo ogire enju ya Israeli oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Mweteise, mutaane n'ebishushani byanyu, mwihe amaisho aha bihagaro byanyu byona. <verse eid="EZK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 14:7" />Ahabw'okuba ibara muntu ow'omu nju ya Israeli nari ow'omu banyamahanga owaabashuuhuukiremu orikumpararuka, akataasya omu mutima gwe ebishushani bye ebirikuramibwa, akata ekirikuteeza entsibo eky'okutahikiirira kwe omu maisho ge, haza akaza owa nabi ngu amuunyehanuuzeho, nyowe MUKAMA niinye ndimwegarukiramu; <verse eid="EZK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 14:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 15:7">Ezk 15:7</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 17:10">Lev 17:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:37">Bir 28:37</ref>; <ref loc="JER 44:11">Yer 44:11</ref>. </char></note> ogwo mushaija ndyamuta omu kaso, mmugire eky'okureeberaho n'eky'okucweraho enfumu, mmucwere kimwe omu bantu bangye; kandi muryamanya ku ndi MUKAMA. <verse eid="EZK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 14:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:23">1 Bag 22:23</ref>; <ref loc="JER 4:10">Yer 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 2:11">2 Tes 2:11</ref>. </char></note> Kandi nabi ku aribeihwabeihwa, yaagira eki yaagamba, nyowe MUKAMA niinye ndiba mmubeihabeihire, ndyamubangira omukono, mmucwekyereze arugye omu bantu bangye Abaisraeli. <verse eid="EZK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 14:10" />Baryagiibwaho ekifubiro, ekifubiro kya nabi n'eky'orimwehanuuzaho biryaingana, <verse eid="EZK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 14:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 11:20">Ezk 11:20</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:23">37:23</ref>. </char></note> ab'enju ya Israeli barekye kugaruka kuhaba kundugaho, nari kugaruka kweshiisha n'ebicumuro byabo byona; kureka babe abantu bangye, naanye mbe Ruhanga waabo; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 14:12" />Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyagaruka kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 14:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 4:16">Ezk 4:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 15:8">15:8</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, ensi ku erincumuraho, yaakora ebitari by'obwesigwa, naanye naagibangira omukono, naahenda eki erikwehimbagiririzaho, nibyo by'okurya byayo, naagiteeza enjara, naagimaramu abantu n'amatungo, <verse eid="EZK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 14:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:19">Ezk 3:19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 15:1">Yer 15:1</ref>. </char></note> n'obu abantu aba bashatu, Noa, Danieli na Yobu baakuba barimu, bakaakiza amagara gaabo bonka ahabw'okuhikiirira kwabo; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba. <verse eid="EZK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 14:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 33:28">Ezk 33:28</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:22">Lev 26:22</ref>. </char></note> Ku ndyohereza enyamaishwa kubuga ensi, zaagishiisha, yaaba amatongo, hataagira owaagirabamu ahabw'ezi nyamaishwa, <verse eid="EZK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 14:16" />n'obu abo bantu bonshatu baakuba barimu, niinyerahira, tibakaabaasa kukiza batabani baabo nari bahara baabo; bo bonka bakaakira, kwonka ensi yo ehinduka amatongo; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira. <verse eid="EZK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 14:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 14:13">Ezk 14:13</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:25">Lev 26:25</ref>. </char></note> Nari shi, ku nditeeza ensi rurara, ningira nti: Ka rurara ebugye ensi, ngimaremu abantu n'amatungo; <verse eid="EZK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 14:18" />n'obu abo bantu bonshatu baakuba barimu, niinyerahira, tibakaabaasa kukiza batabani baabo nari bahara baabo; kureka bo bonka bakaakira; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba. <verse eid="EZK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 14:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:8">Ezk 7:8</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 24:15">2 Sam 24:15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:3-6">Kush 16:3-6</ref>. </char></note> Nari shi, egyo nsi ku ndigiteeza orufu, naagishukaho ekiniga kyangye, ninsheesha eshagama kugimaramu abantu n'amatungo, <verse eid="EZK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 14:20" />n'obu Noa, Danieli na Yobu baakuba barimu, niinyerahira tibakaabaasa kukiza batabani baabo nari bahara baabo, kureka bakaakiza amagara gaabo bonka ahabw'okuhikiirira kwabo; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 14:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 5:17">Ezk 5:17</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 33:27">33:27</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:8">Kush 6:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Mbwenu tindikizaho kuteeza Yerusaalemu ebifubiro by'amaani ebi bina, rurara, enjara, enyamaishwa mbi, n'orufu, ngu mbone kugimaramu abantu n'amatungo! <verse eid="EZK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 14:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 6:8">Ezk 6:8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 16:54">16:54</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:43">20:43</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ku hariba haagizire abaahonokaho ab'okugiihamu abaana baabo b'aboojo n'ab'abaishiki, bwanyima baija ahariimwe, mwareeba emitwarize yaabo n'ebi barikukora, muryagarukwa emitima omunda ahabw'enaku ezi ndiba nyitsize Yerusaalemu, ahabw'ebyo byona ebi naagiteerize. <verse eid="EZK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 14:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:8">Yer 22:8</ref>, <ref loc="JER 22:9">9</ref>. </char></note> Kandi baryabagarura emitima omunda, ku murireeba emitwarize yaabo n'ebi barikukora; obwo nibwo murimanya ku ebi naagikoziremu byona, ntarabatuzire busha; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="EZK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Israeli okushushanisibwa n'ekiti ky'omuzaabibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 15:1" />Kandi ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 15:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 19:10-14">Ezk 19:10-14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 80:8">Zab 80:8</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 10:1">Hos 10:1</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, ekiti ky'omuzaabibu n'amataagi gaakyo nibikiza ki ebindi biti by'omu kibira? <verse eid="EZK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 15:3" />Hariho owaakugitemaho empimbi, akagira eki yaagibaijamu? Nari shi, abantu bakaakitemaho enkondo y'okuhanikaho ekintu kyona? <verse eid="EZK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 15:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:6">Yoh 15:6</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, kicumiirwe okuba enku z'okuhemba; mbwenu omutwe gwakyo n'ekibunu kyakyo ku birisya, byahwaho, ahagati yaakyo haasiriira, kiryaba kikiine omugasho gwona? <verse eid="EZK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 15:5" />Reeba, obu kibaire kikihundiriire, kibaire kitaine mugasho, reero kaashwa, obu kihiire kikasiriira! <verse eid="EZK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 15:6" />Nikyo Mukama RUHANGA arikugirira ati: Nk'oku ekiti ky'omuzaabibu kiri omu biti by'omu kibira, eki naahaireyo kuba enku, nikwo ndihayo abatuuzi b'omuri Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="EZK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 15:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 6:7">Ezk 6:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 14:8">14:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 21:10">Yer 21:10</ref>. </char></note> Ndyabata omu kaso; n'obu barihunga omuriro, kwonka ogwo muriro guryabamaraho; kandi ku ndibata omu kaso, nibwo murimanya ku ndi MUKAMA. <verse eid="EZK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 15:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 6:14">Ezk 6:14</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 14:13">14:13</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima ndyahindura egyo nsi amatongo, ahabw'okuba bakakora ebitari by'obwesigwa; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="EZK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Yerusaalemu okushushanisibwa n'omukazi maraaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 16:1" />Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyagaruka kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 16:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 22:2">Ezk 22:2</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, manyisa Yerusaalemu ebihagaro byayo, <verse eid="EZK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 16:3" />noogira oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugambira Yerusaalemu, ati: Obukomooko bwawe n'obuzaarwa bwawe ori ow'omu nsi ya Kanaani; sho akaba ari Omuamori na nyoko ari Omuhiitikazi. <verse eid="EZK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 16:4" />Eby'okuzaarwa kwawe obu waazaarwa, tibarakushariire, tibarakwogize kukushemeza, tibarakusiigire mwonyo, n'obu kwakuba okukuta omu twenda tw'obwereere. <verse eid="EZK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 16:5" />Tihariho owaakureebeise eriisho ry'embabazi, ngu akugirire esaasi, akukorere ebyo; kureka okanagwa omu ishwa aha izooba eri waazaariirweho, ahabw'okuba okaba noonugwa.<verse eid="EZK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 16:6" />Bwanyima ku naabaire ninkurabaho, naareeba nooyekuringa omu shagama, naakugira, okiri omuri egyo shagama, nti: Kagire amagara, <verse eid="EZK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 16:7" />okakura nk'ekimezire omu ishwa. Naiwe waakura, waanyeeta, waaba empangare, amabeere gaagwa, n'eishokye ryawe ryakura; kwonka waaguma ojwaire busha, ori entangaare.<verse eid="EZK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 16:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 19:5">Kur 19:5</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 24:7">24:7</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 24:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="RUT 3:9">Rus 3:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku naabaire ninkurabaho obundi, naakwetegyereza, naareeba ohikize obunaku bw'okurigirwa; naakunagaho omunagiro gwangye, naajweka enjuuro yaawe, naakurahira, naaragaana naiwe endagaano, waaba owangye; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira. <verse eid="EZK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 16:9" />Bwanyima naakwozya, naakwogyezaho kimwe eshagama; naakusiiga amajuta. <verse eid="EZK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 16:10" />Kandi naakujweka emyenda y'amabara g'ebicwererane, naakujweka enkaito z'oruhu rw'engongi; naakuzirika emyenda ya bafuta, naakushweka emyenda ya riiri. <verse eid="EZK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 16:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:11, 12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:40">Ezk 23:40</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 23:42">42</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 24:22">Kut 24:22</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 24:47">47</ref>. </char></note> Naakujweka amahunde, engoro aha mukono, n'emikuufu omu bitsya. <verse eid="EZK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 16:12" />Naakuta empeta aha nyindo n'omu matu, n'ekirunga kirungi aha mutwe. <verse eid="EZK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 16:13" />Okwo nikwo waahunzirwe ezaabu n'efeeza, n'ebijwaro byawe bikaba biri bafuta na riiri n'emyenda y'amabara gacwereraine. Okaba orya eby'esaano y'obunono n'obwoki n'amajuta. Okaba ori murungi okutakareebwaga, waarugaho waaba omwigarire. <verse eid="EZK 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 16:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 2:15">Tonz 2:15</ref>. </char></note> Okurangaanwa kwawe kwahika omu mahanga ahabw'oburungi bwawe, ahabw'okuba bukaba buhikiibwe ekitiinisa eki naakuhaire; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 16:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:15, 16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:21">Isa 1:21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:20">Yer 2:20</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 1:2">Hos 1:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka okeesiga oburungi bwawe, waaba maraaya ahabw'okurangaanwa kwawe, waayehayo waaba owa ibara muhinguzi. <verse eid="EZK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 16:16" />Waatwara bimwe aha bijwaro byawe, waayekorera endaaro zihunzire, waazishambaniramu; tihariho nk'ebyo ebirabaireho, kandi tibiribaho. <verse eid="EZK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 16:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:20">Ezk 7:20</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 16:11">16:11</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 16:12">12</ref>. </char></note> Kandi okatwara amahunde gaawe amarungi agaakozirwe omu zaabu zangye n'efeeza zangye, ebi naakuhaire waabyekoreramu ebishushani by'abashaija, waashambana nabyo; <verse eid="EZK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 16:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:18, 19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:41">Ezk 23:41</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 2:8">Hos 2:8</ref>. </char></note> waatwara ebijwaro byawe eby'amabara agacwereraine, waabibishweka, kandi waata amajuta gangye n'obubaane bwangye omu maisho gaabyo. <verse eid="EZK 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 16:19" />Kandi n'eby'okurya byangye ebi naakuhaire, eby'esaano y'obunono n'amajuta n'obwoki, ebi naabaire nkugaburira, waabita omu maisho gaabyo, ngu bibe ekisooroora ekirungi; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira. <verse eid="EZK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 16:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:20, 21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:26">Ezk 20:26</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 20:37">37</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 23:37">23:37</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 16:3">2 Bag 16:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:37">Zab 106:37</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 57:5">Isa 57:5</ref>. </char></note> Kandi okatwara batabani baawe na bahara baawe, abu wanzaariire, waababitambira ngu bibamareho. <verse eid="EZK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 16:21" />Noogira ngu obwamaraaya bwawe n'ekintu kikye, kandi okongyeraho n'okwita abaana bangye, okabahayo aharibyo kuba ebitambo by'okurabya omu muriro? <verse eid="EZK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 16:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:6">Ezk 16:6</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 16:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 2:3">Hos 2:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omuri ebyo bihagaro byawe byona n'obwamaraaya bwawe toraijukire biro by'obuto bwawe, obu waabaire ojwaire busha, ori entangaare, nooyekuringa omu shagama.<verse eid="EZK 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 16:23" />Mbwenu bwanyima y'ebyo bibi byawe byona, (oryareeba enaku; eego oryazireeba, nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira), <verse eid="EZK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 16:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:24, 25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:15">Ezk 16:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 3:2">Yer 3:2</ref>. </char></note> waayeyombekyera enju ahatunguukire, waayekorera omwanya mukuru ogw'okuramizamu omuri buri nguuto, <verse eid="EZK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 16:25" />ahari buri iteeraniro ry'emihanda waaraayisizaho oburungi bwawe nooyehayo ahari ibara muhinguzi; otyo waahinguranisa obwamaraaya bwawe; <verse eid="EZK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 16:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:7">Ezk 20:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 23:19">23:19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:18">Yer 7:18</ref>, <ref loc="JER 7:19">19</ref>. </char></note> Kandi okaraaya n'Abanyamisri, bataahi baawe enduruuhi, waakanyisa obwamaraaya bwawe kungwisa kubi. <verse eid="EZK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 16:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:18">2 Bus 28:18</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, nikyo nkubangiriire omukono, nkatuubya egabo yaawe, nkakuhayo aha bazigu baawe abarikwenda kukumira, bahara b'Abafilistia abaitsirwe enshoni ahabw'emitwarize yaawe mibi erengyesereize. <verse eid="EZK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 16:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:12">Ezk 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 16:7-18">2 Bag 16:7-18</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:18">Yer 2:18</ref>, <ref loc="JER 2:36">36</ref>. </char></note> Kandi okaraaya n'Abaasiria, ahabw'okuba tohaaga; buzimazima okaraaya nabo, nabwo tiwaahaaga. <verse eid="EZK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 16:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:14-17">Ezk 23:14-17</ref>. </char></note> Kandi okahinguranisa obwamaraaya bwawe omu nsi y'abashuubuzi ba Bukaludaaya; n'abo nabo tibaakuhaazya.<verse eid="EZK 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 16:30" />Mukama RUHANGA yaagira ati: omutima gwawe ka gurwaziibwe okwetenga, ahabw'okuba okozire ebyo byona, ebikorwa omukazi maraaya owaariire enshoni, <verse eid="EZK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 16:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:24">Ezk 16:24</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 16:25">25</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 16:33">33</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 16:34">34</ref>. </char></note> kandi oyeyombekyeire enju ahatunguukire, waayekorera omwanya mukuru ahari buri nteeraniro y'emihanda; kandi torabaire nka baamaraaya abandi, ahabw'okuba okaba ogaya okugurirwa. <verse eid="EZK 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 16:32" />Eshi ori omukazi enshambani, otaasya abahinguzi omu mwanya gwa baro! <verse eid="EZK 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 16:33" />Baamaraaya boona bagurirwa abashaija, kwonka iwe niiwe oha bashambane baawe boona ebiconco, noobagurira ngu bakwijeho nibaruga embaju zoona ahabw'obwamaraaya bwawe. <verse eid="EZK 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 16:34" />N'ahabw'ekyo obwamaraaya bwawe bwine omutaano n'obw'abandibakazi; kandi tihariho owaakwohize kuba maraaya, kureka iwe niiwe ogurira abantu, bo tibaakugurira. Nikyo obeereire ow'omutaano n'abandi.<verse eid="EZK 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 16:35" />Mbwenu, iwe maraaya 'we, hurira ekigambo kya MUKAMA. <verse eid="EZK 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 16:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:20">Ezk 16:20</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 16:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:38">Zab 106:38</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Manya, obuhemu bwawe bushuurwirwe, n'enjuuro yaawe yaareebwa butunu ahabw'obwamaraaya bwawe, obu waagizire na bashambane baawe, n'ahabw'ebishushani byawe byona ebirikuramibwa, n'ahabw'eshagama y'abaana ei waabihaire. <verse eid="EZK 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 16:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:27">Ezk 16:27</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 23:22">23:22</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 23:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 1:8">Tonz 1:8</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 2:10">Hos 2:10</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 8:10">8:10</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 3:5">Nah 3:5</ref>. </char></note> Reeba ahabw'ebyo byona ndyateeranira hamwe bashambane baawe boona, abaabaire bakushemeza, abu waabaire okunda boona, n'abu waabaire oyanga boona. Ndyabateeranira hamwe, bakurwanise nibaruga oku n'oku, nkujwekyere busha omu maisho gaabo, bareebe enjuuro yaawe yoona. <verse eid="EZK 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 16:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 21:30">Ezk 21:30</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:10">Lev 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 9:6">Kut 9:6</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ndyakucwera orubanja oruri nk'orw'abakazi abasiisire obushwere, bakasheesha eshagama, nkuteho ekifubiro ky'eshagama, nkwiniire ekiniga n'eihato; <verse eid="EZK 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 16:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:7">Ezk 16:7</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 16:11">11</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 16:12">12</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 16:24">24</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 16:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 23:26">23:26</ref>. </char></note> bwanyima nkuheyo omu mikono ya bashambane baawe, baasheenye enju yaawe eri ey'ahatunguukire, n'egyo myanya yaawe emikuru; kandi baryakujuura ebijwaro byawe, banyagye ebintu byawe eby'amahunde, bakutsigye entangaare, ojwaire busha; <verse eid="EZK 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 16:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:46">Ezk 23:46</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 23:47">47</ref>. </char></note> bakureetere eihe rikuteere, bakuteere amabaare, kandi bakurezye na zaarurara zaabo. <verse eid="EZK 16:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 16:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:8">Ezk 5:8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 16:33">16:33</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 16:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 23:27">23:27</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 23:47">47</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 25:9">2 Bag 25:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 39:8">Yer 39:8</ref>. </char></note> Kandi baryayotsya amaka gaawe, bakuheere ebifubiro omu maisho g'abakazi baingi, nkuzibire kugaruka kuraaya; kandi torigaruka kuhayo bintu byawe obundi. <verse eid="EZK 16:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 16:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:13">Ezk 5:13</ref>. </char></note> Okwo nikwo ndikumariraho ekiniga kyangye, eihato ryangye rikakurugaho, nkatuuza, nkareka kugaruka kukugirira ekiniga. <verse eid="EZK 16:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 16:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:4">Ezk 7:4</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 16:22">16:22</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okutaijuka biro by'obuto bwawe, okaanyitsa ekiniga n'ebyo byona, nikyo naanye ndikuzimuuririra ebi waakozire, nkabikurunda aha mutwe; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira. Nangwa kuri otarakozire by'obwamaraaya, okabyongyera aha bihagaro byawe byona!<verse eid="EZK 16:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 16:44" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:44: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 12:22">Ezk 12:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, omucwi w'enfumu aryakucwaho enfumu egi, ati: Nyina niwe muhara. <verse eid="EZK 16:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 16:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:3">Ezk 16:3</ref>. </char></note> Ori owa nyoko owaayangire iba n'abaana be; kandi ori owa mukuru waawe na murumuna waawe, abaayangire baibabo n'abaana baabo. Nyoko akaba ari Omuhiitikazi, na sho ari Omuamori. <verse eid="EZK 16:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 16:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:4">Ezk 23:4</ref>. </char></note> Mukuru waawe ni Samaria, owaabaire atwire aha bukiizi bwawe bwa bumosho na bahara be; kandi murumuna waawe, owaabaire atwire aha bukiizi bwawe bwa buryo, ni Sodoma na bahara be. <verse eid="EZK 16:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 16:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:6">Ezk 5:6</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 5:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 21:9">2 Bag 21:9</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka torahaagiibwe kugyendera mu mihanda yaabo, n'obu kwakuba okutwaza nk'ebihagaro byabo oku biri; kureka omu kaanya kakye munonga okasiisikara omu mitwarize yaawe yoona okukira abandi. <verse eid="EZK 16:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 16:48" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:48: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:15">Mat 10:15</ref>. </char></note> Mukama RUHANGA naagira ati: <verse eid="EZK 16:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 16:49" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:49: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:10">Kut 13:10</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, eki nikyo kicumuro kya murumuna waawe Sodoma; we na bahara be bakagira amaryo, eby'okurya bingi n'okugogyera; tiyaahwera booro n'abakyene. <verse eid="EZK 16:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="EZK 16:50" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:50: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:13">Kut 13:13</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:24">19:24</ref>. </char></note> Bakaba beekunika, bakorera ebihagaro omu maisho gangye; ntyo ku naabireebire, naabaihaho. <verse eid="EZK 16:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EZK 16:51" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:51: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:11">Yer 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:41">Mat 12:41</ref>. </char></note> Nangwa na Samaria terakozire imwe kya kabiri ky'ebibi byawe; kwonka iwe okakora ebihagaro bingi okubakira; ahabw'ebyo bihagaro byona ebi waakozire, okareetera mukuru waawe na murumuna waawe kureebeka nk'abahikiriire. <verse eid="EZK 16:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="EZK 16:52" />Yemera enshoni zaawe, ahabw'okuba niiwe waihiiseho mukuru waawe na murumuna waawe orubanja. Ahabw'ebibi ebi waakozire ebirikukira ebyabo kuba bibi, bakukirize okuhikiirira. N'ahabw'ekyo bwerabwera, oyemere enshoni zaawe, ahabw'okuba niiwe waareeteire mukuru waawe na murumuna waawe okureebeka nk'abahikiriire.<verse eid="EZK 16:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="EZK 16:53" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:53: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 39:25">Ezk 39:25</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 30:3">Bir 30:3</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:7">Zef 2:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyagarura abantu baabo abaatwairwe bari enkwatwa, enkwatwa za Sodoma na bahara be, n'eza Samaria na bahara be, n'ezaawe ezizirimu, <verse eid="EZK 16:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="EZK 16:54" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:54: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 14:22">Ezk 14:22</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 14:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 39:26">39:26</ref>. </char></note> obone kwemera enshoni zaawe, obwerabwere ahabw'ebi waakozire, ebyabareeteire kugarukwa emitima omunda. <verse eid="EZK 16:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="EZK 16:55" />Kandi ebya murumuna waawe, Sodoma na bahara be, n'ebya mukuru waawe, Samaria na bahara be, boona baryagaruka omu buteeka bwabo obwa ira; naiwe oryagaruka omu buteeka bwawe obwa ira hamwe na bahara baawe. <verse eid="EZK 16:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="EZK 16:56" />Murumuna waawe Sodoma akaba atari eky'okucweraho enfumu omu biro by'amaryo gaawe, obubi bwawe butakashuurwirwe? <verse eid="EZK 16:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="EZK 16:57" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:57: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:27">Ezk 16:27</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 28:24">28:24</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 16:5-7">2 Bag 16:5-7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 7:1">Isa 7:1</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 7:2">2</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu obaire nkawe, waaba eky'okujumwa ahari bahara ba Siria na bataahi be na bahara b'Abafilistia abakwehinguririize abarikukugaya. <verse eid="EZK 16:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="EZK 16:58" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:58: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:35">Ezk 23:35</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 23:49">49</ref>. </char></note> Oyekoreire orubanja orw'obwamaraaya bwawe n'ebihagaro byawe; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 16:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="EZK 16:59" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:59: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 17:18">Ezk 17:18</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 17:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 29:12-14">Bir 29:12-14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mukama RUHANGA naagira ati: Eego iwe owaagayire endahiro, okaita endagaano, ndyakugira nk'oku waagizire. <verse eid="EZK 16:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="EZK 16:60" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:60: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:8">Ezk 16:8</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 2:24">Kur 2:24</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:40">Yer 32:40</ref>. </char></note> N'obu kiraabe kyabaire kityo, ndyaijuka endagaano ei naaragaine naiwe omu biro by'obuto bwawe, mpamye naiwe endagaano etarihwaho. <verse eid="EZK 16:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="EZK 16:61" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:61: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 6:9">Ezk 6:9</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 16:46">16:46</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:43">20:43</ref>. </char></note> Ku ndireeta mukuru waawe na murumuna waawe, naabakuha kuba nka bahara baawe, kwonka kitari habw'endagaano yaawe, obwo nibwo oriijuka emihanda yaawe, okakwatwa enshoni. <verse eid="EZK 16:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="EZK 16:62" />Kandi ndyahamya endagaano yangye naiwe, haza omanye ku ndi MUKAMA. <verse eid="EZK 16:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="EZK 16:63" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:63: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:19">Rom 3:19</ref>. </char></note> Obone kwijuka, okakwatwa enshoni, orekye kugaruka kugamba, ahabw'enshoni zaawe, naaheza kukusaasira byona ebi waakozire; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 16:63" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="EZK 17" />
  <para style="s1">Enfumu y'empungu ibiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 17:1" />Kandi ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 17:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:49">Ezk 20:49</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, gambira enju ya Israeli ekishaakuzo, ogicwere enfumu, <verse eid="EZK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 17:3" />noogira oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Empungu mpango ey'amapapa mahango kandi maraingwa, eine amooya g'amabara maingi, ekaija Lebanooni, yaatwara omutwe gw'omwereezi, <verse eid="EZK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 17:4" />yaagucwaho akataagi akarikuhereeruka aha mutwe, yaakatwara omu nsi y'obushuubuzi, yakabyara omu rurembo rw'abashuubuzi. <verse eid="EZK 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 17:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:7-9">Bir 8:7-9</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima yaatwara emwe aha mbibo z'omuri egyo nsi, yaagibiba omu itaka eririkweza, kandi yaagibyara haihi n'amaizi maingi, nk'akati k'omukinga, <verse eid="EZK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 17:6" />kaakura, kaaba omuzaabibu mugufu, gwajanjamura amataagi; ago mataagi gaagwo gaakura nigatoora ei egyo mpungu eri, n'emizi yaagwo yaaguma ahu gwamezire. Katyo kaarugwamu omuzaabibu, kaatookaho amataagi, gaayumbya.<verse eid="EZK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 17:7" />Kwonka hakaba hariho endiijo mpungu mpango y'amapapa mahango n'amooya maingi; kandi reeba, emizi y'ogwo muzaabibu yaaranda neetora ei eri, gwajanjamura amataagi gaagwo, gaatora ei eri kuguma neegagiitirira. <verse eid="EZK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 17:8" />Yaagwiha omu isya eri gwabyairwemu, yaagutwara, yaagubyara omu itaka rirungi haihi n'amaizi maingi, ngu gubone kutooka amataagi kwera ebijuma n'okuba omuzaabibu gw'ekitiinisa. <verse eid="EZK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 17:9" />Gira oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Beitu ebyo, guryaba gye? Egyo mpungu terigukuura ekagurandura n'emizi, ekagutemaho amataagi, ngu amababi gaagwo goona agarikubengyeya gahotokye? Nangwa n'okugarandura tikiryetenga mukono gw'amaani nari abantu baingi. <verse eid="EZK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 17:10" />Beitu shi, ku barigukuura, baagubyara ahandi, ebyo guryaba gye? Omuyaga gw'oburugwa-izooba ku guriguteera, tiguryomera kimwe omu isya eri baagubyairemu?<verse eid="EZK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 17:11" />Bwanyima ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 17:12" />Mbwenu gambira egyo nju engomi oti: Timurikumanya amakuru g'ebigambo ebyo? Bagire oti: Reeba, omugabe wa Babulooni akaija Yerusaalemu, yaakwata omugabe waayo, n'abanyiginya baayo, yaabatwara owe Babulooni. <verse eid="EZK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 17:13" />Yaatwara omwe aha baana b'ogwo mugabe, yaaragaana nawe endagaano naamurahiza. Kandi yaatwara abantu bakuru b'omuri egyo nsi, <verse eid="EZK 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 17:14" />ngu obugabe bugarurwe ahansi, burekye kutunguuka, kureka buhamibwe okukwata endagaano ye. <verse eid="EZK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 17:15" />Kwonka yaamugomera, yaatuma entumwa Misri kushaba embaraasi n'eihe rihango. Nimugira ngu, aryaba gye? Omuntu orikukora ebintu nk'ebyo aryakira? Naabaasa kwita endagaano, akire? <verse eid="EZK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 17:16" />Mukama RUHANGA naagira ati: Niinyerahira, buzimazima omu mwanya, ogu omugabe owaamwemekire atwiremu, ou agayire endahiro ye, kandi akaita endagaano ye, omuri Babulooni nimwo arigwa. <verse eid="EZK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 17:17" />Faraho n'eihe rye ry'amaani n'engabo ze nyingi tarimuha mikono aha rugamba, ku barirunda eby'okutemberaho, baayombekaho ebigo, kucwekyereza abantu baingi. <verse eid="EZK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 17:18" />Ahabw'okugaya endahiro akaita endagaano, n'ahabw'okuheza kwimutsya omukono akagaruka akakora ebyo byona, tarikira. <verse eid="EZK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 17:19" />Nikyo Mukama RUHANGA arikugirira ati: Niinyerahira, buzimazima endahiro yangye ei agayire, n'endagaano yangye ei aitsire, ndyabimutura mbimurunde aha mutwe. <verse eid="EZK 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 17:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 12:13">Ezk 12:13</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:35">20:35</ref>. </char></note> Ndyamurengyezaho ekigoye, akwatwe omutego gwangye, mmutaasye Babulooni, mmucwerereyo orubanja rw'ekicumuro eki ancumwireho. <verse eid="EZK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 17:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 12:14">Ezk 12:14</ref>. </char></note> Kandi engabo ze z'entoore zoona ziryaitwa rurara, n'abarihonokaho bataataanisizibwe ei emiyaga yoona ereetwa; kandi muryamanya ku nyowe, MUKAMA, niinye naakigambire.<verse eid="EZK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 17:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 17:3">Ezk 17:3</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 17:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:6">Zab 2:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Nyowe ahabwangye ndyaiha eitaagi aha mutwe gw'omwereezi, ndibyare, ncwe akataagi koorobi akarikuhereerukayo aha mutwe gwayo, nkeebyarire nyenka aha mutwe gw'orushozi ruraingwa orutunguukire. <verse eid="EZK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 17:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:40">Ezk 20:40</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 31:6">31:6</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 4:12">Dan 4:12</ref>. </char></note> Aha rushozi ruraingwa rwa Israeli niho ndikabyara, katookye amataagi, kaane, kabe omwereezi gw'ekitiinisa. Enyamaishwa z'emiringo yoona ziryatuura ahansi yaagwo, kandi omu kicuucu ky'amataagi gaagwo ebirikuguruka eby'emiringo yoona nimwo biryarika. <verse eid="EZK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 17:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 21:26">Ezk 21:26</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 22:14">22:14</ref>. </char></note> Kandi emiti yoona ey'omu ishwa eryamanya ku nyowe MUKAMA ngarura ahansi emiti miraingwa, nkatunguura emigufu, nkoomya emiti mibisi, nkabengyeyesa eyomire. Nyowe MUKAMA niinye naakigamba, kandi ndyakikora.<verse eid="EZK 17:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="EZK 18" />
  <para style="s1">Oku Ruhanga acwera omuntu weena orubanja orumushemereire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 18:1" />Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyagaruka kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 18:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2, 3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:29">Yer 31:29</ref>, <ref loc="JER 31:30">30</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 5:7">Tonz 5:7</ref>. </char></note> Mugyenderera ki kucwera ensi ya Israeli enfumu egi, erikugira eti: Abazaire bariire emizaabibu erikushaarira, amaino g'abaana gaaba nigo gaagira amangigina? <verse eid="EZK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 18:3" />Mukama RUHANGA naagira ati: Niinyerahira, timurigaruka kucwa egyo nfumu omuri Israeli. <verse eid="EZK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 18:4" />Emyoyo yoona n'eyangye; omwoyo gw'omuzaire n'ogwangye, kandi n'ogw'omwana n'ogwangye; omwoyo ogukora ekibi nigwo gurifa.<verse eid="EZK 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 18:5" />Omuntu ku araabe ari ohikiriire, yaakora eby'ebiragiro kandi ebihikire; <verse eid="EZK 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 18:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 22:9-11">Ezk 22:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 33:25">33:25</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 18:19">Lev 18:19</ref>. </char></note> ku araabe atarikuriira ha nshozi, atarikwimukiza maisho ebishushani by'enju ya Israeli ebirikuramibwa, atarikushiisha muka mutaahi we, n'obu kwakuba okuhika omukazi ori omu kwezi, <verse eid="EZK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 18:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:26">Kur 22:26</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 25:14">Lev 25:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 58:7">Isa 58:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:35">Mat 25:35</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 25:36">36</ref>. </char></note> atarikukora kubi muntu weena, orikugarurira omukwatiriize omukwato gwe, atarikunyaga by'abandi, kureka orikuha abaine enjara eby'okurya bye, akajweka abajwaire busha, <verse eid="EZK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 18:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:15">Kur 22:15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:16">Bir 1:16</ref>. </char></note> atarikuguza ngu bamuhe ekiteebwamu, n'obu kwakuba okutwara enshaagi, kureka orikuzibira omukono gwe kukora eby'okutahikiirira, orikuramura omuntu na mugyenzi we omu buryo, <verse eid="EZK 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 18:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:11">Ezk 20:11</ref>. </char></note> kandi orikuguma naagyendera omu biragiro byangye, akoorobera ebi naataireho; ogwo niwe ahikiriire, kandi taribura kugumaho; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba.<verse eid="EZK 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 18:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 16:38">Ezk 16:38</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku arizaara omwana omunyagi, orikusheesha eshagama, otarikukora kintu na kimwe omuri ebyo ebimushemereire, <verse eid="EZK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 18:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:11, 12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:11">Ezk 5:11</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 18:6">18:6</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 18:7">7</ref>. </char></note> kureka orikuriira aha nshozi, orikushiisha muka mutaahi we, <verse eid="EZK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 18:12" />orikukora kubi abooro n'abakyene, orikunyaga eby'abandi, otarikugarura kyakwatiriziibwe, orikwimukiza amaisho ebishushani ebirikuramibwa, orikukora ebihagaro. <verse eid="EZK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 18:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:8">Ezk 18:8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 33:4">33:4</ref>. </char></note> Orikuguza ngu bamuhe ekiteebwamu, akatwara enshaagi, omwana ogwo aryagumaho? Tarigumaho. Ahabw'okukora ebihagaro ebyo byona, taribura kufa; kandi orubanja rw'eshagama ruryaba ahariwe.<verse eid="EZK 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 18:14" />Kwonka ogwo mushaija ku arizaara omwana orikureeba ebibi ebi ishe akozire byona, akatiina, kwonka atakore nk'ebyo, <verse eid="EZK 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 18:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:15-17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:6-9">Ezk 18:6-9</ref>. </char></note> otarikuriira ha nshozi n'obu kwakuba okwimukiza amaisho ebishushani by'enju ya Israeli, otarikushiisha muka mutaahi we, <verse eid="EZK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 18:16" />otarikukora kubi muntu weena, otarikukwatiriza, otarikunyaga kintu kyona eky'abandi, kureka orikuha abaine enjara eby'okurya bye, akajweka abajwaire busha, <verse eid="EZK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 18:17" />orikuzibira omukono gwe kukora eby'okutahikiirira, otarikutwara kiteebwamu nari enshaagi, orikworobera ebi naataireho, akagyendera omu biragiro byangye, omwana ogwo tarifa ahabw'okutahikiirira kwa ishe; buzimazima aryagumaho. <verse eid="EZK 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 18:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:18">Ezk 3:18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 18:12">18:12</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ishe, ahabw'okuba akaita kubi abantu ataine saasi, yaanyaga mwene waabo, yaakora omu bantu ebitari birungi, reeba, ogwo aryafa ahabw'okutahikiirira kwe. <verse eid="EZK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 18:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:2">Ezk 18:2</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 18:5">5</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 18:9">9</ref>. </char></note> N'obu kiraabe kiri kityo, nimugira muti: Ahabw'enki omwana tarikuturwa okutahikiirira kwa ishe? Omwana ku arikora eby'ebiragiro kandi ebihikire, yaata omutima aha kworobera ebiragiro byangye byona, buzimazima aryagumaho. <verse eid="EZK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 18:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:4">Ezk 18:4</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 24:16">Bir 24:16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 3:10">Isa 3:10</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 3:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:9">Rom 2:9</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu orikukora ekibi niwe arifa. Omwana tariturwa kutahikiirira kwa ishe, na ishe w'omwana tariturwa kutahikiirira kw'omwana we. Okuhikiirira kw'ohikiriire niwe kuribarirwa, kandi n'obubi bw'omubi niwe buribarirwa.<verse eid="EZK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oku Ruhanga ataine kushemererwa ahabw'okufa kw'ababi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 18:21" />Kwonka omuntu mubi ku arihinduka yaareka ebibi ebi yaakozire byona, yaayorobera ebiragiro byangye byona, yaakora eby'ebiragiro kandi ebihikire, buzimazima aryagumaho, tarifa. <verse eid="EZK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 18:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 33:16">Ezk 33:16</ref>. </char></note> Omu by'okushiisha byona ebi yaakozire tihariho na kimwe ekirimwijukwaho; aryagumaho ahabw'eby'okuhikiirira ebi akozire. <verse eid="EZK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 18:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 33:11">Ezk 33:11</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:9">2 Pet 3:9</ref>. </char></note> Nimugira ngu ngira okushemererwa kwona ahabw'okufa kw'omubi? Nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba. Eki nyenda t'okureka omuhanda gwe omubi, akagumaho? <verse eid="EZK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 18:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 33:12">Ezk 33:12</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 33:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:21">2 Pet 2:21</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu ohikiriire ku arihinduka yaareka okuhikiirira kwe, yaakora eby'okutahikiirira, yaakora ebihagaro ebi omusiisi akora, aryagumaho? Omu by'okuhikiirira byona ebi yaakozire tihariho na kimwe ekirimwijukwaho; ahabw'ekicumuro eki acumwire, n'ekibi eki akozire, aryafa.<verse eid="EZK 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 18:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 33:17">Ezk 33:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'obu kiraabe kiri kityo, nimugira muti: Emitwarize ya MUKAMA tehikire. Imwe b'enju ya Israeli 'mwe, nimugira ngu emitwarize yangye tehikire? Eyaanyu tiyo etahikire? <verse eid="EZK 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 18:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 33:18">Ezk 33:18</ref>. </char></note> Ohikiriire ku arihinduka yaareka okuhikiirira kwe, yaakora eby'okutahikiirira, aryafa abizire; ahabw'eky'okutahikiirira eki akozire, aryafa. <verse eid="EZK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 18:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:21">Ezk 18:21</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 23:19">23:19</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omuntu mubi ku arihinduka yaareka eby'okushiisha ebi yaakozire, yaakora eby'ebiragiro kandi ebihikire, aryakiza amagara ge. <verse eid="EZK 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 18:28" />Ahabw'okuteekateeka akahinduka, akareka eby'okushiisha ebi yaakozire, buzimazima aryagumaho, tarifa. <verse eid="EZK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 18:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:25">Ezk 18:25</ref>. </char></note> N'obu kiraabe kiri kityo, enju ya Israeli neegira eti: Emitwarize ya Mukama tehikire. Imwe nju ya Israeli 'mwe, nimugira ngu emitwarize yangye tehikire? Eyaanyu tiyo etahikire? <verse eid="EZK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 18:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:3">Ezk 7:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 33:20">33:20</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 14:1">Hos 14:1</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo imwe ab'enju ya Israeli, nikyo ndibacwerera orubanja, buri muntu nk'oku emitwarize ye eri; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira. Mweteise, muhindukye, murekye eby'okushiisha byanyu byona, okutahikiirira kurekye kubacwekyereza. <verse eid="EZK 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 18:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 11:19">Ezk 11:19</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 33:11">33:11</ref>. </char></note> Munagye hare eby'okushisha byanyu byona, ebi mwancumwireho, mwetungire omutima musya n'omwoyo musya! Mbwenu nimwendera ki kufa, imwe nju ya Israeli 'mwe? <verse eid="EZK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 18:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:23">Ezk 18:23</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba tinshemerererwa kufa kw'omuntu weena; n'ahabw'ekyo muhindukye, mubone kugumaho; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 18:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="EZK 19" />
  <para style="s1">Ezekieli okucurira Abaisraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 19:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 26:17">Ezk 26:17</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 5:1">Amo 5:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi naiwe, curira abanyiginya ba Israeli, <verse eid="EZK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 19:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:9">Kut 49:9</ref>. </char></note> noogira oti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:2">Nyoko akaba ari ki mishi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:2">Manya akaba ari entare enkazi eyaabaire ebyama omu zindi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:2">Ekonkyeza ebyana byayo ahagati y'emigunju y'entare.<verse eid="EZK 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 19:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 23:30">2 Bag 23:30</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 23:31">31</ref>. </char>
    </note> Etyo yaayorora ekyana kimwe aha byana byayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:3">Kyaba omugunju gw'entare.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:3">Gwayega kukwata eki guhiigire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:3">Gwarya abantu.<verse eid="EZK 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 19:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 23:33">2 Bag 23:33</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 23:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:4">2 Bus 36:4</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 4:20">Tonz 4:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ab'amahanga baaguteerera enduuru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:4">Gwagwa omu busya bwabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:4">Baagutwaza amarobo omu nsi ya Misri.<verse eid="EZK 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 19:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 23:34">2 Bag 23:34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Egyo ntare ku yaagutegyereize, gwabura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:5">Yaahwa amatsiko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:5">Yaareeta ekindi kyana omu byana byayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:5">Yaakigira omugunju.<verse eid="EZK 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 19:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 22:13">Yer 22:13</ref>, <ref loc="JER 22:17">17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kyaguma nikizengyerera omu zindi ntare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:6">Kyarugaho kyaba omugunju gw'entare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:6">Gwayega kukwata eki gwitsire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:6">Gwarya abantu.<verse eid="EZK 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 19:7" />Bwanyima gwasheenya ebigo byabyo ebigumire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:7">Gwacwekyereza endembo zaabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:7">Ensi n'ebigirimu byona byahinduka amatongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:7">Ahabw'eiraka ry'okutsinda kwagwo.<verse eid="EZK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 19:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 12:13">Ezk 12:13</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 24:1">2 Bag 24:1</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 24:2">2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amahanga gaahurura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:8">Gaagutega emitego embaju zoona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:8">Gaagurengyezaho ekigoye kyago,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:8">Gwagwa omu busya bwago.<verse eid="EZK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 19:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 6:2">Ezk 6:2</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:6">2 Bus 36:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Gaagukwatisa amarobo, gaaguta omu kiju kyago,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:9">Gaagutwarira omugabe wa Babulooni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:9">Gaagutaasya omu kihome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:9">Ngu eiraka ryagwo ritagaruka kuhurirwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:9">Omu bibungo bya Israeli.<verse eid="EZK 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 19:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 15:6">Ezk 15:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 80:9">Zab 80:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nyoko akaba ari nk'omuzaabibu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:10">ogubyairwe omu musiri haihi n'amaizi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:10">Ogwabaire nigwera gye, gwine amataagi maingi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:10">Ahabw'okugira amaizi maingi.<verse eid="EZK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 19:11" />Eitaagi ryagwo eririkukiza agandi kuguma</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:11">Ryahinduka enkoni y'omutegyeki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:11">Ryayoga omu gandi mataagi mahango,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:11">Ryareebekyera ahaiguru</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:11">Riine amataagi maingi gakwataine.<verse eid="EZK 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 19:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 17:10">Ezk 17:10</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 13:15">Hos 13:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka ogwo muzaabibu gwarandurwa ahabw'ekiniga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:12">Gwanagwa ahansi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:12">Omuyaga gw'oburugwa-izooba gwagwomya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:12">Ebijuma byagwo byakonkoboka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:12">Empimbi yaagwo yaayoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:12">Omuriro gwagwotsya.<verse eid="EZK 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 19:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 24:12-16">2 Bag 24:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 2:3">Hos 2:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu gutwairwe omu ihamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:13">Gwabyarwa omu nsi eyomire, ekarangataine.<verse eid="EZK 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 19:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 9:15">Bar 9:15</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 24:20">2 Bag 24:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuriro gurugire omu mpimbi yaagwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:14">Gwayokyeza kimwe amataagi n'ebijuma byagwo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:14">N'ahabw'ekyo tigutsigaize mpimbi egumire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:14">N'obu yaakuba enkoni y'omutegyeki.<verse eid="EZK 19:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="EZK 20" />
  <para style="s1">Mukama okubaijutsya obugomi bwa baishenkurubo, n'okubahana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 20:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 14:1">Ezk 14:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima omu mwaka gwa mushanju, omu kwezi kwa kataano, aha kiro kyakwo kya ikumi, bamwe omu bakuru ba Israeli bakaija kwehanuuza ahari MUKAMA baashutama omu maisho gangye. <verse eid="EZK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 20:2" />Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 20:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 14:3">Ezk 14:3</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, gambira abakuru ba Israeli, obagire oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Mureetsirwe okunyehanuuzaho? Niinyerahira, tindikwikiriza ku muunyehanuuzaho; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira. <verse eid="EZK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 20:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 22:2">Ezk 22:2</ref>. </char></note> Ebyo noija kubacwera orubanja, Mwana w'omuntu? Noija kubacwera orubanja? Ku kiraabe kiri kityo, bamanyise ebihagaro bya baishenkurubo, <verse eid="EZK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 20:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:22">Kut 14:22</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 6:2">Kur 6:2</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 6:7">7</ref>. </char></note> obagire oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Aha izooba eri naatooraaniireho Israeli, nkarahira oruzaaro rw'enju ya Yakobo, obu naabeeyorekyera omu nsi ya Misri, ningira nti: Ndi MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu. <verse eid="EZK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 20:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:15">Ezk 20:15</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 3:8">Kur 3:8</ref>. </char></note> Ahari eryo izooba nibwo naabarahira ku ndibaiha omu nsi ya Misri, nkabatwara omu nsi ei naabasheruriire, ensi y'amate n'obwoki, ey'ekitiinisa okukira ezindi zoona. <verse eid="EZK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 20:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:2">Kur 20:2</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 18:3">Lev 18:3</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima naabagira nti: Mwena munagye hare ebirikunugwa, ebi buri muntu omuriimwe atuuzaho amaisho, kandi muteesiisisa ebishushani bya Misri ebirikuramibwa. Niinye MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu. <verse eid="EZK 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 20:8" />Kwonka bangomera, baayanga kumpurira. Boona tibaikiriza kunaga ebirikunugwa ebi baabaire batuuzaho amaisho, n'obu kwakuba okwimuura ebishushani bya Misri ebirikuramibwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 20:8">Bwanyima naateekateeka kubashukaho ekiniga kyangye, n'okukibamariraho bakiri omuri Misri. <verse eid="EZK 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 20:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 48:11">Isa 48:11</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka tinaatwaza ntyo, ahabw'okutenda kujumisa eiziina ryangye omu maisho g'amahanga agu baabaire batwiremu, agu naayeyorekire omu maisho gaago, obu naabaiha omu nsi ya Misri. <verse eid="EZK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 20:10" />Ntyo naabaiha omu nsi ya Misri, naabatwara omu ihamba. <verse eid="EZK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 20:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lev 18:5</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:13">Neh 9:13</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 9:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 10:5">Rom 10:5</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:12">Gal 3:12</ref>. </char></note> Naabaha ebiragiro byangye, naabamanyisa ebi naataireho, ebibaisaho omuntu orikubyorobera. <verse eid="EZK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 20:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:8-11">Kur 20:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:12-15">Bir 5:12-15</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:28">Ezk 37:28</ref>. </char></note> Kandi naabaha sabato zangye kuba akamanyiso ahagati yangye nabo, ngu babone kumanya ku nyowe MUKAMA, niinye mbeeza. <verse eid="EZK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 20:13" />Kwonka ab'enju ya Israeli bangomerera omu ihamba, tibaagyendera mu biragiro byangye, kureka baayanga ebi naataireho ebibaisaho orikubyorobera; na sabato zangye baazishiisha munonga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 20:13">Ekyarugiremu naateekateeka kubashukaho ekiniga kyangye bakiri omu ihamba, ngu mbamarireho kimwe. <verse eid="EZK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 20:14" />Kwonka tinaatwaza ntyo ahabw'okutenda kujumisa eiziina ryangye omu maisho g'amahanga agu naabaire naabaihire omu maisho gaago. <verse eid="EZK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 20:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:6">Ezk 20:6</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:28-30">Kub 14:28-30</ref>. </char></note> Kandi naabarahirira omu ihamba ku ntaribataasya mu nsi ei naabaire mbahaire, ensi ey'amate n'obwoki, ey'ekitiinisa okukira ezindi zoona, <verse eid="EZK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 20:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:24">Ezk 20:24</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 15:39">Kub 15:39</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:37">Zab 78:37</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okwanga ebi naataireho, batagyendere mu biragiro byangye, bakashiisha sabato zangye; ahabw'okuba emitima yaabo ekakuratira ebishushani byabo ebirikuramibwa. <verse eid="EZK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 20:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 11:13">Ezk 11:13</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka eriisho ryangye ryabasaasira, tinaabacwekyereza, n'obu kwakuba okubamaririraho kimwe omu ihamba.<verse eid="EZK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 20:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 24:14">Yos 24:14</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:18">1 Pet 1:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima naagambirira abaana baabo omu ihamba nti: Mutarigyendera omu biragiro bya baashoimwe, kandi mutaryorobera ebi baateireho, n'obu kwakuba okwesiisisa ebishushani byabo ebirikuramibwa. <verse eid="EZK 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 20:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:2">Kur 20:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:32">Bir 5:32</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 5:33">33</ref>. </char></note> Nyowe MUKAMA niinye Ruhanga waanyu; mugume mugyendere omu biragiro byangye, mute omutima aha kworobera ebi naataireho, <verse eid="EZK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 20:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:12">Ezk 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:22">Yer 17:22</ref>. </char></note> kandi mugume mweze sabato zangye, zibe akamanyiso ahagati yangye naimwe, mubone kumanya ku nyowe MUKAMA ndi Ruhanga waanyu. <verse eid="EZK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 20:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:8">Ezk 20:8</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 20:13">13</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 20:16">16</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 20:18">18</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka abaana baabo nabo bangomera, tibaagyendera mu biragiro byangye, tibaata mutima aha bi naataireho, ebibaisaho orikubyorobera; na sabato zangye baazishiisha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 20:21">Ekyarugiremu naateekateeka kubashukaho ekiniga kyangye, nkakibamaririraho omu ihamba. <verse eid="EZK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 20:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:9">Ezk 20:9</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 20:14">14</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka naazibira omukono gwangye, naatwaza ntyo ahabw'okutenda kujumisa iziina ryangye omu maisho g'amahanga, agu naabaire naabaihire omu maisho gaago. <verse eid="EZK 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 20:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:15">Ezk 20:15</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:33">Lev 26:33</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:64">Bir 28:64</ref>. </char></note> Kandi naabarahiririra omu ihamba ku ndibataataanisiza omu mahanga, nkabanaganaga omu nsi zaago, <verse eid="EZK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 20:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:13">Ezk 20:13</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 20:16">16</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba tibarakozire bi naataireho, kureka bakanga ebiragiro byangye, baashiisha sabato zangye, kandi amaisho gaabo baagahanga ebishushani bya baishenkurubo ebirikuramibwa. <verse eid="EZK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 20:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 81:12">Zab 81:12</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:42">Byak 7:42</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 1:24">Rom 1:24</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 1:28">28</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 2:11">2 Tes 2:11</ref>, <ref loc="2TH 2:12">12</ref>. </char></note> Kandi naabaha ebiragiro ebyabaire bitari birungi, n'ebyatairweho ebitarikubaasa kubahaisa magara, <verse eid="EZK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 20:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:20">Ezk 16:20</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 16:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:31">20:31</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:35">Yer 32:35</ref>. </char></note> naabasiisisa empongano zaabo, ahabw'okuba bakarabya abaana baabo b'emijigaijo omu muriro, ngu mbone kubahindura enshoberwa, bamanye ku ndi MUKAMA.<verse eid="EZK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 20:27" />N'ahabw'ekyo, Mwana w'omuntu, gambira ab'enju ya Israeli noobagira oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Kandi n'omuri eki baashwenkuriimwe bakandogotaho nibandyarya. <verse eid="EZK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 20:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 6:13">Ezk 6:13</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 8:17">8:17</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba ku naaherize kubataasya omu nsi ei naaragaine kubaha nindahira, okwiha obwo, ei baabaire bareeba ibara kibungo kiraingwa, nari ekiti kyona ekiyumbize, baaba niyo baatambira ebitambo byabo, bakareeta empongano zaabo ezirikungwisa kubi; kandi okwo niyo baabaire booterera emigaju yaabo, bakashukirayo empongano zaabo z'eby'okunywa. <verse eid="EZK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 20:29" />(Naababuuza nti: ogu mwanya mukuru ogu murikuzamu n'ogw'enki? Nikyo gwayeteirwe <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baama: amakuru gaakyo ngu, Omwanya mukuru gw'okuramizamu. </char></note>Baama n'okuhitsya hati.) <verse eid="EZK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 20:30" />N'ahabw'ekyo gira enju ya Israeli oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Nimwenda kweshiisha, nk'oku baashwenkuriimwe baagizire, n'okuhaba nimukuratira ebintu byabo ebirikunugwa? <verse eid="EZK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 20:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 14:3">Ezk 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:26">20:26</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba, ku muhonga empongano zaanyu, mwarabya abaana baanyu b'aboojo omu muriro, muba nimweshiisha n'ebishushani byanyu ebirikuramibwa n'okuhitsya hati. Imwe nju ya Israeli 'mwe, mbwenu mukaanyehanuuzaho? Niinyerahira, timuriinyehanuuzaho; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 20:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 11:5">Ezk 11:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:28">Bir 4:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebi murikuteekateekaho tibiriba kwo, ebi murikugira ngu, Turyaba nk'amahanga, n'enganda z'omuri ezo nsi, turamye ebiti n'amabaare.<verse eid="EZK 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 20:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:33, 34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 21:5">Ezk 21:5</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 31:8">31:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mukama RUHANGA naagira ati: Niinyerahira, buzimazima niinyija kuba mukama waanyu, nimbategyeka n'omukono gw'amaani ogubangire, kandi nyine ekiniga kingi. <verse eid="EZK 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 20:34" />Ndyabaiha omu mahanga, mbataaruure omu nsi ezi mwataataaniiremu n'omukono gw'amaani ogubangire, nyine ekiniga kingi; <verse eid="EZK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 20:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 17:20">Ezk 17:20</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 2:14">Hos 2:14</ref>. </char></note> bwanyima mbareete omu ihamba ry'amahanga; okwo niyo ndibatonganisiza nitureebana. <verse eid="EZK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 20:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:20-23">Kub 14:20-23</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 14:28-30">28-30</ref>. </char></note> Nk'oku naatonganiise baashwenkuriimwe omu ihamba ry'omu nsi ya Misri, naimwe nikwo ndibatonganisa; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira. <verse eid="EZK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 20:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:32">Lev 27:32</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:13">Yer 33:13</ref>. </char></note> Ndyabarabya ahansi y'enkoni ningibabarisa, mbarekye mutaahemu. <verse eid="EZK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 20:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 13:9">Ezk 13:9</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:17">34:17</ref>. </char></note> Ndyabaihamu abagomi n'abancumwireho, mbaihe omu nsi ei baashuuhuukiiremu; kandi tibaritaaha mu nsi ya Israeli. Obwo nibwo murimanya ku ndi MUKAMA.<verse eid="EZK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 20:39" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:39: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 20:25">Ezk 20:25</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 20:26">26</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 39:7">39:7</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 10:14">Bar 10:14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 44:25">Yer 44:25</ref>, <ref loc="JER 44:26">26</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 4:4">Amo 4:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe nju ya Israeli 'mwe, oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Nimwirooko, buri muntu weena omuriimwe aheereze ebishushani bye ebirikuramibwa! Kwonka bwanyima muryampurira, murekye kujumisa eiziina ryangye eririkwera ahabw'empongano zaanyu n'ebishushani byanyu ebirikuramibwa. <verse eid="EZK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 20:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 17:23">Ezk 17:23</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 39:25">39:25</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:7">Isa 60:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:4">Mal 3:4</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba Mukama RUHANGA naagira ati: Ab'enju ya Israeli boona oku baingana baryampeerereza aha rushozi rwangye orurikwera, aha mutwe gw'ekibungo kya Israeli omuri egyo nsi; okwo niyo ndibaakiirira, kandi niyo ndibaihiraho ebi mureetsire, n'emiganuro yaanyu n'empongano zaanyu zoona ezirikwera.<verse eid="EZK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 20:41" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:41: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 20:34">Ezk 20:34</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:23">36:23</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 39:27">39:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku ndibaiha omu mahanga, naabataaruura omu nsi ezi mwataataaniiremu, ndyabaakiira nk'ekisooroora ekirungi, kandi ndyayeyorekyera omuriimwe omu maisho g'amahanga, ku ndi Orikwera. <verse eid="EZK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 20:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:5">Ezk 20:5</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 20:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 24:7">Yer 24:7</ref>. </char></note> Ku ndibagarura omu nsi ya Israeli ei naaraganiise kuha baashwenkuriimwe nindahira, obwo muryamanya ku ndi MUKAMA. <verse eid="EZK 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 20:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 6:9">Ezk 6:9</ref>. </char></note> Okwo niyo muriijukira emitwarize yaanyu n'ebi mwakozire byona, ebi mwayesiisiise; kandi muryayetamwa ahabw'ebibi byona ebi mwakozire. <verse eid="EZK 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 20:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:22">Ezk 20:22</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 103:10">Zab 103:10</ref>. </char></note> Imwe nju ya Israeli 'mwe, ku ndibatwaza ntyo ahabw'eiziina ryangye, ntarikubatura mitwarize yaanyu emibi, nari ebihagaro ebi mwakozire, obwo nibwo murimanya ku ndi MUKAMA; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 20:45" />Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyagaruka kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 20:46" />Mwana w'omuntu, ta amaisho gaawe aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo, ohagambire noohahana, ohanuure ebiriba aha kibira ky'omu nsi ya Negebu, <verse eid="EZK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 20:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 21:4">Ezk 21:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 21:14">Yer 21:14</ref>. </char></note> ogambire ekyo kibira oti: Hurira ekigambo kya MUKAMA. Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, naaza kukutwekamu omuriro, gumarireho kimwe buri kiti kyona ekibisi n'ekyomire ekiri omuriiwe; omuriro ogurikubuguma tiguriraazibwa, kandi guryababura obuso bw'abantu boona okuruga aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho. <verse eid="EZK 20:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 20:48" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:48: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 30:33">Isa 30:33</ref>. </char></note> Abantu boona baryareeba ku nyowe MUKAMA, niinye ngutwekire; kandi tiguriraazibwa. <verse eid="EZK 20:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 20:49" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:49: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 17:2">Ezk 17:2</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima, naagira nti: Ai bambe, Mukama RUHANGA, nibangambaho bati: Beitu omuntu ogu t'omucwi w'enfumu?<verse eid="EZK 20:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="EZK 21" />
  <para style="s1">Ezekieli okusaasibwa ebifubiro ebiribabaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 21:1" />Bwanyima ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 21:2" />Mwana w'omuntu, ta amaisho gaawe ahari Yerusaalemu, ogambire emyanya erikwera noogihana; kandi ohanuure ebiriba aha nsi ya Israeli, <verse eid="EZK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 21:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:22">Yob 9:22</ref>; <ref loc="JER 47:6">Yer 47:6</ref>. </char></note> ogigire oti: oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, naaba omuzigu waanyu, kandi niinyija kusyora rurara yangye omu kyobati kyayo, nkumaremu abahikiriire n'abasiisi. <verse eid="EZK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 21:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:47">Ezk 20:47</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okwenda kukumariramu kimwe abahikiriire n'abasiisi nikyo rurara erisyorerwa omu kyobati kyayo kurwanisa abantu boona, okuruga aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo okuhika aha bwa-bumosho; <verse eid="EZK 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 21:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:48">Ezk 20:48</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 21:30">21:30</ref>. </char></note> kandi abantu boona baryamanya ku nyowe MUKAMA nsyoire rurara yangye omu kyobati kyayo; terigarukamu bundi. <verse eid="EZK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 21:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 12:3">Ezk 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 22:4">Isa 22:4</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo, Mwana w'omuntu, tsinda; otsindire omu maisho gaabo, oine obusaasi bukucwire omugongo, n'enkaku nyingi. <verse eid="EZK 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 21:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:5">Ezk 7:5</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 7:6">6</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 7:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 39:8">39:8</ref>. </char></note> Kandi abaraakubuuze bati: Ahabw'enki nootsinda? Obagire oti: N'ahabw'ebimpuriire. Ku biriija, emitima y'abantu boona eryahwerera, n'emikono ya boona eryahwa amaani, emyoyo ya boona eryagwa enshazi, kandi n'entegye za boona ziryabonda, zibe nk'amaizi. Reeba nibiija, kandi biryahikiirizibwa; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira. <verse eid="EZK 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 21:8" />Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyagaruka kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 21:9" />Mwana w'omuntu, hanuura noogira oti: Oku nikwo Mukama arikugamba naagira ati: Rurara, rurara etyarize kandi eyeziibwe, <verse eid="EZK 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 21:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 21:15">Ezk 21:15</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 21:28">28</ref>. </char></note> etyaziibwe kwita, yaayezibwa kumurinkana nk'omurabyo. Mbwenu aho nitwija kwogaho, tugire okushemererwa? Mwana wangye, ogayire enkoni n'ekintu kyona ekyetwa ekiti. <verse eid="EZK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 21:11" />Rurara egyo ehairweyo kwezibwa, ngu ebone kukoresibwa; etyaziibwe, yaayezibwa ngu ebone kuheebwa omwitsi. <verse eid="EZK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 21:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:19">Yer 31:19</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, rira oboroogye, ahabw'okuba n'ey'okurwanisa abantu bangye, n'ey'okurwanisa abanyiginya ba Israeli boona; bahairweyo ahari rurara hamwe n'abantu bangye. N'ahabw'ekyo yemaamaate, <verse eid="EZK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 21:13" />ahabw'okuba hariho ekigyezo; mbwenu enkoni erikugaya ku eraabe etakiriho, biryaba bita? Nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 21:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 23:13">Ezk 23:13</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 24:10">Kub 24:10</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 24:1">2 Bag 24:1</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 24:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 25:1">25:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo, Mwana w'omuntu, hanuura, kandi oteere omu ngaro nooragiira rurara kutema kabiri, eego kashatu, niyo rurara y'okwita abarikwija kwitwa; rurara egyo niyo y'okwita omukuru orikwija kuhutaazibwa obuhuta oburikwita, etaahire omu bishengye byabo, <verse eid="EZK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 21:15" />ngu emitima yaabo ehahaare, baingi bagwe omu marembo gaabo goona. Ayaayaaya! Neemurinkana nk'omurabyo, eyeziibwe ahabw'okwita. <verse eid="EZK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 21:16" />Temera kimwe aha rubaju rwa buryo n'orwa bumosho, ei obwogi bwawe burikureeba. <verse eid="EZK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 21:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:13">Ezk 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 17:24">17:24</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 21:14">21:14</ref>. </char></note> Naanye niinyija kuteera omu ngaro, nyemare ekiniga. Nyowe MUKAMA niinye naagamba.<verse eid="EZK 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 21:18" />Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyagaruka kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 21:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 21:21">Ezk 21:21</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, taho emihanda ebiri eraarabwemu rurara y'omugabe wa Babulooni; yombi erugye omu nsi emwe. Bwanyima okore ekyapa, okite ahu omuhanda, ogurikuza omu rurembo, gurikutandikira; <verse eid="EZK 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 21:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 25:1-5">Ezk 25:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:1-6">Yer 49:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:13-15">Amo 1:13-15</ref>. </char></note> oyorekye omuhanda ahabwa rurara erikuza Rabba ey'Abaamoni, n'ogundi ogurikuza Yuda na Yerusaalemu ey'ebigo bigumire. <verse eid="EZK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 21:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:19">Kut 31:19</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba omugabe wa Babulooni ayemereire omu ntaaniro z'emihanda, ahu egyo mihanda yombi erikutandikira, kuragura; naazongoza enyambi, naaraguza <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:21 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Terafimu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">n'ebishushani by'emandwa. </char></note>terafimu, naareeba ekitugu. <verse eid="EZK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 21:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 4:2">Ezk 4:2</ref>. </char></note> Omu mukono gwe gwa buryo endagu nizeerera Yerusaalemu kugiteera nibaashamya akanwa nibahiga, nibateera orwari, kugibyaraho ebiti by'okuhiguza amarembo, kurundaho eby'okutemberaho, kandi n'okugyombekaho ebigo by'okugigotesa. <verse eid="EZK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 21:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 17:13">Ezk 17:13</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 17:20">20</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Abaisraeli bo kiryabasusira endagu z'ebishuba; ahakuba bakarahira endahiro ehamire. Kwonka naabaijutsya orubanja rwabo ngu bakwatwe.<verse eid="EZK 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 21:24" />Nikyo Mukama RUHANGA arikugirira ati: Ahabw'okureetera orubanja rwanyu kwijukwa, mukashuuruura ebicumuro byanyu byona, kikareetera ebibi byanyu kureebwa butunu omu bi murikukora byona; ahabw'okwijukwa muryabikwatirwamu. <verse eid="EZK 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 21:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 17:19">Ezk 17:19</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 35:5">35:5</ref>. </char></note> Naiwe omugabe mubi owa Israeli, ou obunaku bwe buhikire, obunaku bw'ekifubiro kyawe ky'aha muheru, <verse eid="EZK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 21:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 17:24">Ezk 17:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:52">Luk 1:52</ref>. </char></note> oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Ihaho ekitambaara, ojuure ekirunga; ebintu tibirikwija kuguma nk'oku byabaire biri; ekiri ahansi okitunguure, kandi ekitunguukire okigarure ahansi. <verse eid="EZK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 21:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:10">Kut 49:10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 6:12">Zek 6:12</ref>, <ref loc="ZEC 6:13">13</ref>. </char></note> Ndyakijuumika, ndyakijuumika, ndyakijuumika; tikirigaruka kubaho, okuhitsya obu okiineho obushoboorozi ariija, nkaba niwe naakiha.<verse eid="EZK 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 21:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 21:10">Ezk 21:10</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 21:20">20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naiwe mwana w'omuntu, hanuura, noogira oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba aha Baamoni, n'aha kijumo kyabo; noogira oti: Rurara, rurara esyoirweyo, yaayezibwa kwita, n'okumurinkana nk'omurabyo, <verse eid="EZK 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 21:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 21:25">Ezk 21:25</ref>. </char></note> (ku barikuba nibakikureebera okworekwa okutari kw'amazima, nibakuragurira ebishuba) ngu oteebwe aha bitsya by'abantu babi, abahutaaziibwe obuhuta oburikwita; abu obunaku bwabo obw'ekifubiro ky'aha muheru buhikire. <verse eid="EZK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 21:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 21:5">Ezk 21:5</ref>. </char></note> Garura rurara egyo omu kyobati kyayo. Omu mwanya ogu waahangiirwemu, omu nsi ei waakomookiremu, nimwo ndikucwera orubanja. <verse eid="EZK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 21:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 22:20">Ezk 22:20</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 22:21">21</ref>. </char></note> Ndyakushukaho okuguubwa kubi kwangye, nkuhuuheho omuriro gw'ekiniga kyangye, nkuheyo omu mikono y'abantu abari nk'enyamaishwa, abaine obwengye bw'okucwekyereza. <verse eid="EZK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 21:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 25:10">Ezk 25:10</ref>. </char></note> Oryaba nk'enku z'okuhemba; eshagama yaawe eryasheeshwa ahagati y'ensi yaanyu; kandi toriijukwa bundi; ahabw'okuba nyowe MUKAMA niinye naakigamba.<verse eid="EZK 21:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="EZK 22" />
  <para style="s1">Ezekieli okugamba aha bibi bya Yerusaalemu n'abeebembezi baayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 22:1" />Kandi ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 22:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:2">Ezk 16:2</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:4">20:4</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 21:16">2 Bag 21:16</ref>. </char></note> Naiwe Mwana w'omuntu, nooyenda kucwa orubanja, kurucwera orurembo orurikusheesha eshagama? Mbwenu nu rumanyise ebihagaro byarwo byona, <verse eid="EZK 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 22:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 21:25">Ezk 21:25</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 23:37">23:37</ref>. </char></note> ogire oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, orurembo orusheesha eshagama ahagati yaarwo ngu obunaku bwarwo buhikye, kandi orwekorera ebishushani ebirikuramibwa kweshiisha! <verse eid="EZK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 22:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:14">Ezk 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:38">Zab 106:38</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:16">Dan 9:16</ref>. </char></note> Eshagama ei waaseesire ekureeteire kugiibwaho orubanja, n'ebishushani ebi waakozire byakushiisha. Oiriize haihi obunaku bwawe, kandi n'obunaku bw'emyaka yaawe eyaatairweho buhikire. Nikyo nkuhinduriire ekijumo aha mahanga n'eky'okugaaniiza omu nsi zaago zoona. <verse eid="EZK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 22:5" />Abakuri haihi n'abakuri hare baryakugaaniiza, iwe rurangaanwa oijwire okujagarara.<verse eid="EZK 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 22:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 22:27">Ezk 22:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, abanyiginya ba Israeli ab'omuriiwe, buri omwe aine omutima ogurikururuuhira okusheesha eshagama, nk'oku obushoboorozi bwe buri. <verse eid="EZK 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 22:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:21">Kur 22:21</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 22:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 27:16">Bir 27:16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:23">Isa 1:23</ref>. </char></note> Omuriiwe abazaire tibarikweteebwaho, nibagaywa; abashuuhuuki nibaitwa kubi, kandi efuuzi n'abafaakazi nibakorwa kubi. <verse eid="EZK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 22:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 22:26">Ezk 22:26</ref>. </char></note> Okagaya ebintu byangye ebirikwera, waashiisha sabato zangye. <verse eid="EZK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 22:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:43">Ezk 16:43</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 18:6">18:6</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:16">Lev 19:16</ref>. </char></note> Omuriiwe harimu abantu abarikubeiherera abandi ngu baitwe; mwine abandi abarikuriira aha nshozi, n'abandi abarikukorera omuriiwe eby'obushambani. <verse eid="EZK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 22:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:8">Lev 18:8</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 5:1">1 Kor 5:1</ref>. </char></note> Omuriiwe harimu abarikujweka busha baishebo, kandi omuriiwe harimu abarikuhamba abakazi bari omu kwezi. <verse eid="EZK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 22:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:9">Lev 18:9</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 18:15">15</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 18:20">20</ref>. </char></note> Omwe naakora ebihagaro na muka mutaahi we, ondiijo nashiisha omukaamwana, n'ondiijo naashiisha munyaanya owa ishe. <verse eid="EZK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 22:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:35">Ezk 23:35</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23:19">Bir 23:19</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 27:25">27:25</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:32">Yer 2:32</ref>. </char></note> Omuriiwe abantu nibarya enguzi kusheesha eshagama; nootwara ekiteebwamu n'enshaagi; otunga amagoba ahari bataahi baawe ahabw'okuhata; haza nyowe onyebwa; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 22:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 21:17">Ezk 21:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, nikyo ndikuteerera omu ngaro nintangaara ahabw'amagoba gaawe ag'obugobya agu waatungire, n'ahabw'eshagama eyaasheesheirwe omuriiwe. <verse eid="EZK 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 22:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 17:24">Ezk 17:24</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 21:7">21:7</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu omutima gwawe guryabaasa kugumisiriza, n'emikono yaawe egire amaani, aha izooba eri ndikutuririraho ebi waakozire? Nyowe MUKAMA niinye naakigamba, kandi ndyakikora. <verse eid="EZK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 22:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:10">Ezk 5:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 24:11">24:11</ref>. </char></note> Ndyabataataanisiza omu mahanga, mbanaganagye omu nsi zaago, kandi nkumaremu oburofa bwawe. <verse eid="EZK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 22:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:8">Ezk 5:8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 7:24">7:24</ref>. </char></note> Naanye ndyajumirwa omu maisho g'amahanga ahabwanyu, kandi muryamanya ku ndi MUKAMA.<verse eid="EZK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 22:17" />Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyagaruka kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 22:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 119:119">Zab 119:119</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:22">Isa 1:22</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 1:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="JER 6:28">Yer 6:28</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, enju ya Israeli empindukiire enkamba; boona bahindukire enkamba, bari omu iziiko nk'efeeza n'emiringa n'eibaati n'ekyoma na rusasi. <verse eid="EZK 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 22:19" />Nikyo Mukama RUHANGA, arikugirira ati: Ahabw'okuhinduka enkamba mwena, nikyo ndibateeranirira omuri Yerusaalemu ahagati. <verse eid="EZK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 22:20" />Nk'oku abantu bateeranira efeeza, emiringa, ebyoma, rusasi n'eibaati omu iziiko, bakabijugutirira omu muriro kubiyazya, naimwe nikwo ndibateeranira hamwe mbagwereirwe kubi, kandi mbainiire ekiniga, nkabata omu iziiko, nkabayazya. <verse eid="EZK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 22:21" />Eego ndyabateeranira hamwe, mbajugutiririreho omu muriro gw'ekiniga kyangye, muyagire ahagati yaaryo. <verse eid="EZK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 22:22" />Nk'oku efeeza eyagira ahagati y'eiziiko, naimwe nikwo muriyagira mutyo ahagati yaaryo; kandi muryamanya ku nyowe MUKAMA nshukire ekiniga kyangye ahariimwe.<verse eid="EZK 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 22:23" />Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyagaruka kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 22:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:35">1 Bag 8:35</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 8:36">36</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, gigambire oti: Ori ensi etashemeziibwe, kandi etakagwirwemu njura aha izooba ry'okugirirwa ekiniga. <verse eid="EZK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 22:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 11:9">Yer 11:9</ref>, <ref loc="JER 11:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 3:11">Mik 3:11</ref>. </char></note> Abanyiginya baayo abagirimu ni nk'entare erikutsinda, erikutaanyagura eki eitsire; bamizire amagara g'abantu, banyagire obutungi n'ebintu by'obuguzi bwingi, abakazi baingi omuriyo babagizire abafaakazi. <verse eid="EZK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 22:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 36:20">Ezk 36:20</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 10:10">Lev 10:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:21">Yer 17:21</ref>, <ref loc="JER 17:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 3:4">Zef 3:4</ref>. </char></note> Abanyamurwa baayo basiisire ebiragiro byangye n'eitima, baahagara ebintu byangye ebirikwera; tibataaniise birikwera n'ebitarikwera, tibeegyeise bantu kutaanisa ebitashemeire n'ebitshemeire, kandi na sabato zangye bakazeehuzya; ekirugiremu naagaywa omuribo. <verse eid="EZK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 22:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 22:13">Ezk 22:13</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 22:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 3:1">Mik 3:1</ref>, <ref loc="MIC 3:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 3:4">Zef 3:4</ref>. </char></note> Abategyeki baayo ni nk'emishega erikutaanyagura eki eitsire, nibasheesha eshagama, nibacwekyereza amagara g'abantu, ngu babone kutunga amagoba g'obugobya. <verse eid="EZK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 22:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 13:6">Ezk 13:6</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 13:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Baanabi baayo basiigiriize ebisiika ahabw'abo bategyeki n'obudongo obutanogire, nibareeba eby'okworekwa ebitari by'amazima, nibabaragurira ebishuba, nibagira bati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba, haza ataine ki agambire. <verse eid="EZK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 22:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 22:7">Ezk 22:7</ref>. </char></note> Kandi abantu b'omuri egyo nsi baitsire kubi abantu, baabanyaga; baahata abooro n'abakyene, baita kubi abashuuhuuki bataine ki bakoreirwe. <verse eid="EZK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 22:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 13:5">Ezk 13:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:23">Zab 106:23</ref>; <ref loc="JER 5:1">Yer 5:1</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima naasherura omuntu omuribo owaakuhunduuza orugo, akeemerera omu maisho gangye ahasheenyukire ahabw'ensi ngu ntagicwekyereza, kwonka yamburira. <verse eid="EZK 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 22:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 22:21">Ezk 22:21</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo mbashukiireho ekiniga kyangye kingi, nkabamaraho n'omuriro gw'okuguubwa kubi kwangye, nkabazimuurira ebi baakozire, nkabibarunda aha mutwe; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 22:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="EZK 23" />
  <para style="s1">Obwamaraaya bwa Ohola na Oholiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 23:1" />Kandi ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 23:2" />Mwana w'omuntu, hakaba hariho abakazi babiri enyineemwe; <verse eid="EZK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 23:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:15">Ezk 16:15</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 23:19">23:19</ref>. </char></note> baaraayira omuri Misri, baaraaya bakiri bato: okwo niyo amabeere gaabo gaabaire gakorerwaho, amabeere g'obuhangare bwabo gakakwatwakwatwaho. <verse eid="EZK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 23:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:8">Ezk 16:8</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 16:46">46</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 23:37">23:37</ref>. </char></note> Amaziina gaabo, omukuru akaba ari Ohola, n'omurumuna ari Oholiba. Bwanyima baahinduka abangye, baazaara aboojo n'abaishiki. Ago maziina gaabo Ohola niwe Samaria, na Oholiba niwe Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="EZK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 23:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 15:19">2 Bag 15:19</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 17:3">17:3</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 5:13">Hos 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 8:9">8:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Ohola, ku yaabaire akiri owangye, yaaraaya; yaakunda nkunzi ze Abaasirira, yaarengyesereza; <verse eid="EZK 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 23:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:23">Ezk 23:23</ref>. </char></note> Abaasiria bo bakaba bari abarwani, bajwaire ebijwaro bya bujwa, abategyeki n'abakuru b'engabo; boona bari abatsigazi abarikurigirwa nibagyendera aha mbaraasi. <verse eid="EZK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 23:7" />Atyo yaaraaya nabo; boona bakaba bari entoore za Asiria. Kandi yaayesiisia ebishushani ebirikuramibwa, byona eby'omuntu weena ou yaabaire arigira. <verse eid="EZK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 23:8" />Kandi tiyaareka bwamaraaya bwe obu yaagizire, okwiha obu yaabaire ari Misri; ahakuba omu buto bwe abashaija bakabyama nawe, baakorakora aha mabeere ge, baamukanyisaho obushambani bwabo. <verse eid="EZK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 23:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:29">2 Bag 15:29</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 17:4-6">17:4-6</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 17:23">23</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo naamuheereireyo omu mikono ya nkunzi ze Abaasiria abu yaakunzire akarengyesereza. <verse eid="EZK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 23:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:37">Ezk 16:37</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 16:41">41</ref>. </char></note> Abo baamujweka busha, baakwata batabani be na bahara be; kandi we baamwitsa rurara. Kandi ku baaherize kumuha ebifubiro, yaahinduka eky'okucweraho enfumu omu bakazi. <verse eid="EZK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 23:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:8">Yer 3:8</ref>, <ref loc="JER 3:11">11</ref>. </char></note> Murumuna we Oholiba yaakireeba; kwonka yaamukiza okusiisikara omu kurigira n'omu kuraaya; n'obwamaraaya bwe bwakira obwa mukuru we. <verse eid="EZK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 23:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:6">Ezk 23:6</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 16:7">2 Bag 16:7</ref>. </char></note> Yaarigira Abaasiria, abategyeki, abakuru b'engabo, abarwani abajwaire eby'okurwanisa byona, n'abarikugyendera aha mbaraasi; abo boona bakaba bari abatsigazi abarikurigirwa. <verse eid="EZK 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 23:13" />Ntyo naareeba ku asiisirwe; batyo bombi baatoora omuhanda gumwe. <verse eid="EZK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 23:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 8:10">Ezk 8:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 16:29">16:29</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka we yaakanyisa obwamaraaya bwe, ahabw'okuba akareeba ebishushani by'abashaija ebiteirwe aha kisiika, ebishushani by'Abakaludaaya, ebiteirwe n'erangi erikutukura, <verse eid="EZK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 23:15" />abeezirikire emyeko omu bwezirikiro bwabo, n'ebikwemba by'amabara aha mitwe yaabo, boona nibashusha abanyiginya b'Abababulooni, abaakomookire omu nsi ya Bukaludaaya. <verse eid="EZK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 23:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 20:12">2 Bag 20:12</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 20:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 24:1">24:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 57:9">Isa 57:9</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaabireebire, ahonaaho yaabirigira, yaatuma entumwa Bukaludaaya. <verse eid="EZK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 23:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:28">Ezk 23:28</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 57:8">Isa 57:8</ref>. </char></note> Batyo Abababulooni baija, baamushanga aha kitanda kye ky'obwamaraaya, baamushiisha n'obushambani bwabo. Ku baaherize kumushiisha, omutima gwe gwabatamwa. <verse eid="EZK 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 23:18" />Ku yaagumiizemu naashambana butunu, yaayejweka busha ataine nshoni, naanye omutima gwangye gwamutamwa, gwamurugaho, nk'oku gwarugire ahari mukuru we. <verse eid="EZK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 23:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:19, 21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:3">Ezk 23:3</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka n'obu kiraabe kyabaire kityo, yaagumizamu naakanyisa obwamaraaya bwe, obu yaabaire akorera omuri Misri, <verse eid="EZK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 23:20" />naarigira bashambane be, abu ebicweka byabo byabaire biri nk'eby'endogoya, n'ebirikubarugamu biri nk'eby'embaraasi. <verse eid="EZK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 23:21" />Okwo nikwo waijukize obwamaraaya bw'omu buto bwawe, obu Abanyamisri baabaire bakwatakwata amabeere gaawe, nibamiga amabeere g'obuhangare bwawe.<verse eid="EZK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 23:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 16:37">Ezk 16:37</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe Oholiba, nikyo Mukama RUHANGA arikugirira ati: Reeba, ndyaimutsya nkunzi zaawe ezi omutima gwawe gwatamirwe gukahararuka, zikureetwe embaju zoona zikurwanise; <verse eid="EZK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 23:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:12">Ezk 23:12</ref>. </char></note> aba Babulooni n'Abakaludaaya boona, Pekodi, Shoa na Koa, hamwe n'Abaasiria boona, abatsigazi abarikurigirwa, abategyeki n'abakuru b'engabo boona oku baingana, abatware n'abarwani, boona abarikugyendera aha mbaraasi. <verse eid="EZK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 23:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:6">2 Bag 25:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 39:5">Yer 39:5</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 3:2">Nah 3:2</ref>. </char></note> Baryakuteera nibaruga aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, baine eby'okurwanisa n'ebigaari n'eihe rihango ry'amahanga, bakutengyere orugamba, baine engabo enkye n'empango n'enkofiira z'ebyoma, bakureetwe embaju zoona; bwanyima mbahe obushoboorozi, bakucwere emanja nk'oku emicwere yaabo eri. <verse eid="EZK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 23:25" />Naanye ndyakureetaho ekiniga kyangye, abo bazigu bakurwanise bakwiniire ekiniga kingi, bakucweho enyindo n'amatu, n'abantu baawe abarihonokaho baitwe rurara. Baryakwata batabani baawe na bahara baawe, kandi abaawe abarihonokaho bamarweho omuriro. <verse eid="EZK 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 23:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:39">Ezk 16:39</ref>. </char></note> Kandi baryakujuura ebijwaro byawe, batware amahunde gaawe amarungi. <verse eid="EZK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 23:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:41">Ezk 16:41</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 23:3">23:3</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 23:19">19</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 23:48">48</ref>. </char></note> Okwo nikwo ndimaraho obushambani bwawe n'obwamaraaya bwawe, obu waihire omu nsi ya Misri, ngu orekye kugaruka kuhanga Abanyamisri amaisho, n'obu kwakuba okubaijuka obundi. <verse eid="EZK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 23:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:37">Ezk 16:37</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 23:17">23:17</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 23:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="JER 21:7">Yer 21:7</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, niinyija kukuhayo omu mikono y'abu orikwanga, abu waatamirwe okataana nabo; <verse eid="EZK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 23:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:39">Ezk 16:39</ref>. </char></note> nabo baryakurwanisa bakwiniire rwango, bakunyagye byona ebi waahendekyeire, bakutsigye ojwaire busha, ori entangaare, n'enjuuro y'obwamaraaya bwawe ereebwe butunu. <verse eid="EZK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 23:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:15">Kur 34:15</ref>. </char></note> Obushambani bwawe n'obwamaraaya bwawe nibwo bwakureeteire ebyo byona, ahabw'okuba okaraaya n'amahanga, waayesiisisa ebishushani byabo ebirikuramibwa. <verse eid="EZK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 23:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:9">Ezk 23:9</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 23:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:15">Yer 25:15</ref>. </char></note> Okuratsire mukuru waawe; nikyo ndikwija kuteera ekikopo kye omu ngaro zaawe. <verse eid="EZK 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 23:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 22:4">Ezk 22:4</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 22:5">5</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 23:32">Oryanywera aha kikopo kya mukuru waawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 23:32">Ekiraingwa kandi ekihango.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 23:32">Oryashekyererwa, oteererwa enaku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 23:32">Ahabw'okuba kirimu bingi.<verse eid="EZK 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 23:33" />Oryaijura esindo n'obujune.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 23:33">Ekikopo kya mukuru waawe Samaria</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 23:33">N'eky'okutiinisa kandi eky'okweshobera;<verse eid="EZK 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 23:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 75:8">Zab 75:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 51:17">Isa 51:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oryakinywa, okyeranguuze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 23:34">Oyemaanyure eishokye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 23:34">Kandi oyetaagataagure amabeere;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 23:34">ahabw'okuba niinye naakigamba; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira. <verse eid="EZK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 23:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:49">Ezk 23:49</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 14:9">1 Bag 14:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:32">Yer 2:32</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo Mukama RUHANGA arikugirira ati: Ahabw'okuunyebwa, okannaga enyima yaawe, irooko oyemere ebirugire omu bushambani bwawe n'obwamaraaya bwawe.<verse eid="EZK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 23:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:36: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 22:2">Ezk 22:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA yaagaruka yangira ati: Mwana w'omuntu, oryacwera Ohola na Oholiba orubanja? Mbwenu bamanyise ebihagaro byabo ebi baakozire. <verse eid="EZK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 23:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:20">Ezk 16:20</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 16:21">21</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 16:38">38</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba bakashambana, kandi eshagama ei baaseesire eri aha ngaro zaabo; baashambana n'ebishushani byabo ebirikuramibwa, kandi abaana baabo b'aboojo baabarabya omu muriro, ngu ebyo bishushani bibarye. <verse eid="EZK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 23:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:13">Ezk 20:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:30">Yer 7:30</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ebindi ebi baanyitsize nibyo ebi. Eizooba niryo rimwe baashiisha Omwanya gwangye ogurikwera, kandi bakashiisha na sabato zangye. <verse eid="EZK 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 23:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:37">Ezk 23:37</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 44:7">44:7</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 21:4">2 Bag 21:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:11">Yer 23:11</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba ku baaherize kwita abaana baabo nibabatambira ebishushani byabo ebirikuramibwa, eryo izooba baataaha omu Mwanya gwangye ogurikwera, baaguhagara. Tiwaareeba! Ebyo nibyo baakoreire omu nju yangye. <verse eid="EZK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 23:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:11">Ezk 16:11</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 16:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 23:16">23:16</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 9:30">2 Bag 9:30</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 57:9">Isa 57:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 4:30">Yer 4:30</ref>. </char></note> Kandi bakatuma entumwa kweta abashaija kuruga hare; batyo baija. Ahabw'okwija kwabo waayoga, waasiiga amaisho gaawe erangi, waajwara amahunde, <verse eid="EZK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 23:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:18">Ezk 16:18</ref>. </char></note> waashutama aha kitebe ky'ekitiinisa n'emeeza etebeekanisiibwe omu maisho gaakyo, ei waataireho obubaane bwangye n'amajuta gangye, <verse eid="EZK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 23:42" />Abantu baingi abataine ki beetaireho baaguma aha kigaaniiro bamushagatiire; haija abantu b'obutoosha hamwe n'abasinzi abarugire omu ihamba; baajweka abakazi enyerere aha mikono n'ebirunga birungi aha mitwe.<verse eid="EZK 23:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 23:43" />Bwanyima naagira nti: Abashaija ku baba nibaraaya nawe, obwo baba batashambaine? <verse eid="EZK 23:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 23:44" />Ahabw'okuba bakamuzaho, nk'oku baza ahari maraaya. Kandi okwo nikwo baagiire ahari Ohola na Oholiba kushambana nabo. <verse eid="EZK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 23:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:38">Ezk 16:38</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka abahikiriire baryabacwera orubanja ku bari abakazi enshambani, kandi abarikusheesha eshagama; ahakuba n'abakazi enshambani buzima, kandi eshagama ei baaseesire eri aha ngaro zaabo.<verse eid="EZK 23:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 23:46" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:46: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 16:40">Ezk 16:40</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:25">Bir 28:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Ndyabateeza eihe, mbareetere okubingirwa oku n'oku, n'okunyagwa. <verse eid="EZK 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 23:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:40">Ezk 16:40</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 16:41">41</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 24:21">24:21</ref>. </char></note> Ezo ngabo ziryabateera amabaare, zibaitse rurara, ziite batabani baabo na bahara baabo, kandi zootsye amaka gaabo. <verse eid="EZK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 23:48" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:48: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:27">Ezk 23:27</ref>. </char></note> Okwo niko ndimariraho kimwe obushambani omu nsi, abakazi boona bakakireeberaho, bakareka kushambana nkaimwe. <verse eid="EZK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 23:49" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:49: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:35">Ezk 23:35</ref>. </char></note> Kandi muryaturwa obushambani bwanyu, mwemere ekifubiro ky'ebibi byanyu by'okuramya ebishushani; bwanyima muryamanya ku ndi Mukama RUHANGA.<verse eid="EZK 23:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="EZK 24" />
  <para style="s1">Enfumu y'enyungu erikubira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 24:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 20:1">Ezk 20:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi omu mwaka gwa mwenda omu kwezi kwa ikumi aha kiro kyakwo kya ikumi, ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 24:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:1">2 Bag 25:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 39:1">Yer 39:1</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, handiika eiziina ry'eri izooba ryonka; ahakuba eri izooba omugabe wa Babulooni yaagota Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="EZK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 24:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 11:3">Ezk 11:3</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 11:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 17:2">17:2</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:49">20:49</ref>. </char></note> Cwera egyo nju engomi enfumu noogigira oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:3">Ta enyungu aha mahega, ogiteho gye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:3">Ogishukyemu amaizi,<verse eid="EZK 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 24:4" />Ogitemu entongo z'enyama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:4">Entongo nungi zoona, ez'ekivune ky'okuguru n'eky'omukono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:4">Ogiijuze amagufa marungi;<verse eid="EZK 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 24:5" />Otoorane omu busyo erikuhita ezindi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:5">Oteekyerane enku ahansi yaayo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:5">ogiteekye, ebire gye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:5">Amagufa agarimu gabone kusya.<verse eid="EZK 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 24:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 22:2">Ezk 22:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo Mukama RUHANGA arikugirira ati: Orurembo orusheesha eshagama ruryakareeba, enyungu erimu omukyereenyo, kandi ei omukyereenyo gutakahweiremu. Iha omuri egyo nyungu entongo emwe emwe, otarikutoorana; <verse eid="EZK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 24:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:13">Lev 17:13</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba eshagama ei rwaseesire ekiri ahagati yaarwo; rukagisheesha aha rukiri oruriho busha; tiruragishukire hansi kugishwekaho eitaka. <verse eid="EZK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 24:8" />Ahabw'okwenda kwimutsya ekiniga kyangye ngu mpoore enzigu, nkata eshagama ei rwaseesire aha rukiri oruriho busha, ngu erekye kushwekwa. <verse eid="EZK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 24:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:9, 10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 30:33">Isa 30:33</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 3:1">Nah 3:1</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo Mukama RUHANGA arikugirira ati: Orurembo orusheesha eshagama ruryakareeba! Ndyateekyera enku, ekikoomi kibe kihango. <verse eid="EZK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 24:10" />Yongyera enku, otemu omuriro, oteekye gye enyama, omaremu amaizi gaayo, amagufa gasiriire; <verse eid="EZK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 24:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 22:15">Ezk 22:15</ref>. </char></note> bwanyima ogite aha makara erimu busha, eyotsye, omuringa gwayo gusiriire, oburofa oburimu bubone kuyaga, omukyereenyo guhwemu. <verse eid="EZK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 24:12" />Nyeruhiize busha; omukyereenyo gwamwo omwingi tigurikumarwamu muriro. <verse eid="EZK 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 24:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:13">Ezk 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 22:14">Isa 22:14</ref>. </char></note> Omukyereenyo gwarwo n'obushambani bwawe obufiire. Nkaabaire naakushemeize, kwonka okanga kushemezibwa oburofa bwawe; n'ahabw'ekyo torigira bu oshemeziibwe, okuhitsya obu ndikumariraho ekiniga kyangye. <verse eid="EZK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 24:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:11">Ezk 5:11</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 17:24">17:24</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 23:19">Kub 23:19</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 15:29">1 Sam 15:29</ref>. </char></note> Nyowe MUKAMA niinye naagamba; kiryaba kwo; kandi niinye ndikikora. Tindigaruka nyima, tindisaasira, n'obu kwakuba okwefuuza. Ndyakucwera orubanja nk'emitwarize yaawe n'ebi orikukora oku biri; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba.<verse eid="EZK 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okufa kwa muka Ezekieli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 24:15" />Ekigambo kay MUKAMA kyagaruka kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 24:16" />Mwana w'omuntu, reeba, naaza kukwihaho eki otuuzaho amaisho ahonaaho; kwonka otacura n'obu kwakuba okurira, kandi amarira gatakufukunkuka omu maisho. <verse eid="EZK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 24:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:6">Lev 10:6</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 15:30">2 Sam 15:30</ref>; <ref loc="JER 16:5-7">Yer 16:5-7</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 9:4">Hos 9:4</ref>. </char></note> Tsinda, kwonka otahurirwa; otacurira ofiire; yezingirire ekitambaara, ojware enkaito, otashweka aha minwa n'obu kwakuba okurya eby'okurya nk'eby'abari omu rufu. <verse eid="EZK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 24:18" />Ntyo omu kasheeshe naagambira abantu, omu mwabazyo omukazi wangye yaafa. Ku bwaseesire, naatwaza nk'oku ndagiirwe.<verse eid="EZK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 24:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 17:12">Ezk 17:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima abantu bambuuza bati: Tokaatugambira ebintu ebi ebyakureetera kutwaza otyo, eki birikutumanyisa? <verse eid="EZK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 24:20" />Naanye nikwo kubagira nti: Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kinyizireho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 24:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:20">Ezk 7:20</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 7:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 23:47">23:47</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:12">Yer 7:12</ref>, <ref loc="JER 7:14">14</ref>. </char></note> Gambira enju ya Israeli oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, ndyashiisha Omwanya gwangye ogurikwera, ogurikubareetera amaryo, mukeemanya ku mwine amaani, ogu amaisho gaanyu gashemerererwa, kandi ogutuura gubatwaire emitima. Kandi batabani baanyu na bahara baanyu abu mwatsigireho baryaitwa rurara. <verse eid="EZK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 24:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:22, 23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 24:17">Ezk 24:17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:39">Lev 26:39</ref>. </char></note> Naimwe muryatwaza nk'oku ntwarize; timurishweka aha minwa, n'obu kwakuba okurya eby'okurya by'abari omu rufu; <verse eid="EZK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 24:23" />ebitambaara biryabaguma aha mitwe, n'enkaito zibagume omu bigyere; timuricura n'obu kwakuba okurira, kureka muryahwa aha magufa ahabw'eby'okutahikiirira byanyu, buri muntu atonzye na mugyenzi we. <verse eid="EZK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 24:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 4:3">Ezk 4:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 20:3">Isa 20:3</ref>. </char></note> Okwo nikwo Ezekieli aribabeera eky'okureeberaho; oku atwarize kwona, nikwo naimwe muritwaza. Ebyo ku biriba byabaireho, muryamanya ku ndi Mukama RUHANGA.<verse eid="EZK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 24:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 24:21">Ezk 24:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naiwe, Mwana w'omuntu, aha izooba eri ndibaihiraho orugo rwabo orugumire, orubahaisa okushemererwa n'ekitiinisa, oru batuuzaho amaisho, kandi orutuura rubatwaire emitima, kandi nkagaruka nkabaihaho batabani baabo na bahara baabo, <verse eid="EZK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 24:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:26, 27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 33:21">Ezk 33:21</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 33:22">22</ref>. </char></note> eryo izooba nibwo abarihonokaho bariija kukubikira. <verse eid="EZK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 24:27" />Ahari eryo izooba akanwa kaawe karyagamba n'abahonokireho, ogambe, orekye kugaruka kuba ekiteta. Okwo nikwo oribabeera eky'okureeberaho, kandi nabo baryamanya ku ndi MUKAMA.<verse eid="EZK 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="EZK 25" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okufubira amahanga ahabw'okumugaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 25:1" />Kandi ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 25:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 21:20">Ezk 21:20</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 21:28">28</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, ta amaisho aha Baamoni, obahanuurire ebiribabaho, <verse eid="EZK 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 25:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:22">Ezk 7:22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:2">26:2</ref>. </char></note> obagire oti: Muhurire ekigambo kay Mukama RUHANGA. Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Ahabw'okugira oti: Otyo! Nooyesiima ahabw'Omwanya gwangye ogurikwera kushiishwa, n'ensi ya Israeli kuhinduka amatongo, n'enju ya Yuda kutwarwa omu bukwatwa, <verse eid="EZK 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 25:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6:3">Bar 6:3</ref>. </char></note> nikyo ndikwija kubaheerayo omu mikono y'ab'oburugwa-izooba, bakabakubuura; kandi baryabateeramu ensiisira, babombekyemu amaka, barye ebijuma byanyu, banywe n'amate gaanyu. <verse eid="EZK 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 25:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEP 2:15">Zef 2:15</ref>. </char></note> Raba ndyahagira amariisizo g'engamira, n'endembo z'Abaamoni nzigire eizaagiriro ry'amasyo; haza obwo nibwo murimanya ku ndi MUKAMA. <verse eid="EZK 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 25:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 36:5">Ezk 36:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 55:12">Isa 55:12</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Ahabw'okuteera omu ngaro nimwesiima, nimwemurika mwine okushemererwa ahabw'eitima ryona eri mwiniire ensi ya Israeli omu mitima yaanyu, <verse eid="EZK 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 25:7" />n'ahabw'ekyo reeba, nkubangiire omukono, kandi niinyija kukuhayo omu mikono y'amahanga kuba eminyago yaabo; bwanyima ndyakucwa omu mahanga, nkucwekyereze omu nsi, nkumareho; haza obwo nibwo orimanya ku ndi MUKAMA.<verse eid="EZK 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 25:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 25:12">Ezk 25:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 15:1-9">Isa 15:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 48:1-47">Yer 48:1-47</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Ahabw'aba Moabu n'aba Seiri okugira bati: Reeba, enju ya Yuda eri nk'agandi mahanga goona, <verse eid="EZK 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 25:9" />nikyo ndiihiraho omwatano gw'ensi ya Moabu, okuruga aha ndembo zaagwo okuhika Besi-yeshimoosi, Baali-meoni na Kiryasaimu, ezirihaisa egyo nsi ekitiinisa. <verse eid="EZK 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 25:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 21:32">Ezk 21:32</ref>. </char></note> Egyo nsi ndyagiha ab'oburugwa-izooba hamwe n'Abaamoni kuba eyaabo, erekye kwijukwa omu mahanga obundi; <verse eid="EZK 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 25:11" />kandi Moabu egyo ndyagiha ebifubiro. Haza obwo nibwo barimanya ku ndi MUKAMA.<verse eid="EZK 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 25:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 28:17">2 Bus 28:17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 137:7">Zab 137:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:7-22">Yer 49:7-22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 35:2-6">Ezk 35:2-6</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:11">Amo 1:11</ref>, <ref loc="AMO 1:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="OBA 1:1-21">Oba 1-21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Ahabwa Edomu kukora kubi enju ya Yuda nibabahoora, kandi omu kuhoora kwabo bakacumura munonga, <verse eid="EZK 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 25:13" />nikyo Mukama RUHANGA arikugirira ati: Ndyabangira Edomu omukono, ngimariremu kimwe abantu n'amatungo, mpagire amatongo, baitwe rurara okuruga Temani okuhika Dedani. <verse eid="EZK 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 25:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:14">Isa 11:14</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 9:12">Amo 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="OBA 1:18">Oba 18</ref>. </char></note> Ndyahooresa Edomu abantu bangye Israeli, bakore omuri Edomu nk'oku ndikwenda nibahikiiriza ekiniga kyangye n'okuguubwa kubi kwangye. Kandi baryamanya okuhoora enzigu kwangye; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 25:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 14:29-31">Isa 14:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:12">Ezk 25:12</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:6-8">Amo 1:6-8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Ahabw'Abafilistia kukora eby'okuhoora enzigu, kandi bakagihoora n'eitima ry'omu mitima yaabo n'okuhwerekyereza baine rwango etarikuhwa, <verse eid="EZK 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 25:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEP 2:5">Zef 2:5</ref>. </char></note> nikyo Mukama RUHANGA arikugirira ati: Reeba, ndyabangira Abafilistia omukono, mmareho Abakeresi, kandi ncwekyereze abatwire aha nkungu z'enyanja abatsigaireho. <verse eid="EZK 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 25:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 6:7">Ezk 6:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:14">25:14</ref>. </char></note> Ndyabahoora okuhoora kw'amaani, mbahanise ekiniga kingi. Haza obwo, ku ndibahoora ntyo, nibwo barimanya ku ndi MUKAMA.<verse eid="EZK 25:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="EZK 26" />
  <para style="s1">Ekifubiro kya Tuuro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 26:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 24:1">Ezk 24:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu waka gwa ikumi na gumwe, aha kiro ky'okubanza ky'okwezi, ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 26:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 25:3">Ezk 25:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 23:1-18">Isa 23:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-6">Yoel 3:4-6</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9">Amo 1:9</ref>, <ref loc="AMO 1:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, ahabwa Tuuro okugamba ahari Yerusaalemu, neegira eti: Otyo nikyo kihena! Eirembo ry'amahanga risheenyukire, ryanyigukira; mbwenu, obu Yerusaalemu egizirwe amatongo, niinyija kutunga bingi; <verse eid="EZK 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 26:3" />nikyo Mukama RUHANGA arikugirira ati: Iwe Tuuro, reeba, naaba omuzigu waawe; niinyija kukuteeza amahanga maingi, nk'oku enyanja einamura ebingonzi byayo. <verse eid="EZK 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 26:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:14">Ezk 26:14</ref>. </char></note> Garyasheenya engo za Tuuro ez'amabaare, gakumbagaze eminaara yaayo; eitaka ryayo ndyariharagata, etsigare eri orukiri kwonka. <verse eid="EZK 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 26:5" />Eryahinduka embuga y'okwanikaho obutimba ahagati y'enyanja; ahabw'okuba nyowe MUKAMA niinye naakigamba; eryaba omunyago gw'amahanga, <verse eid="EZK 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 26:6" />na bahara baayo abariba bari omu ishwa baryaitwa rurara. Haza obwo nibwo barimanya ku ndi MUKAMA.<verse eid="EZK 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 26:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 29:18">Ezk 29:18</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 7:12">Ezr 7:12</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 2:37">Dan 2:37</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Iwe Tuuro, reeba, ndyakuteeza Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni, omugabe w'abagabe, arugye aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, aine embaraasi n'ebigaari, n'ab'aha mbaraasi n'eihe ry'engabo nyingi. <verse eid="EZK 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 26:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:8, 9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 21:22">Ezk 21:22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:6">26:6</ref>. </char></note> Bahara baawe abari omu ishwa aryabaitsa rurara, akwombekyeho eby'okutemberaho, akuteeze abaine engabo zikwataine ez'okukingira emitwe yaabo. <verse eid="EZK 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 26:9" />Engo zaawe z'amabaare aryazibyaraho ebiti by'okuzihiguza, n'eminaara yaawe agisheenyese empango. <verse eid="EZK 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 26:10" />Ahabw'embaraasi ze kuba nyingi ziryaimutsya omucuucu, gukushwekye; ku ariba naaraba omu marembo gaawe, nk'oku bataaha omu rurembo, oru engo zaarwo zisheenyirwe, engo zaawe ziryatengyetsibwa endigito y'ab'aha mbaraasi n'ey'enziga z'ebigaari by'orugamba. <verse eid="EZK 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 26:11" />Emihanda yaawe yoona aryagiribatiiriza ebyara by'embaraasi ze; abantu baawe aryabaitsa rurara; kandi enyomyo zaawe z'amaani ziryagwa ahansi. <verse eid="EZK 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 26:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:12-24">Ezk 27:12-24</ref>. </char></note> Obutungi bwawe baryabunyaga, n'eby'obushuubuzi byawe bibe eminyago; baryakumbagaza engo zaawe z'amabaare, bacwekyereze amaju gaawe agarikushemeza; kandi amabaare gaawe n'embaaho zaawe n'eitaka ryawe baryabinaga omu nyanja. <verse eid="EZK 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 26:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:16">Isa 23:16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 24:8">24:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:22">Kush 18:22</ref>. </char></note> Ndyahunamya amaraka g'abarikweshongora ebyeshongoro byawe; n'enanga zaawe tizirihurirwa bundi. <verse eid="EZK 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 26:14" />Ndyakugira orukiri oruriho busha, obe embuga y'okwanikaho obutimba; kandi torigaruka kwombekwa bundi, ahabw'okuba nyowe MUKAMA niinye naakigamba; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 26:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 27:35">Ezk 27:35</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 31:16">31:16</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:52">Yer 51:52</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Noogira ngu ebirwa tibiritengyeta ahabw'okuhurira okugwa kwawe, emputa ku ziritsinda, haabaho okwitwa kwingi omuriiwe? <verse eid="EZK 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 26:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 32:10">Ezk 32:10</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 2:13">Yob 2:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 23:8">Isa 23:8</ref>; <ref loc="JON 3:6">Yon 3:6</ref>. </char></note> Obwo nibwo abagabe boona ab'aha nyanja bariruga aha bitebe byabo, bakajuura bushuuti zaabo, n'ebijwaro byabo eby'amabara gacwereraine; baryajwara okutetema, bashutame ahansi nibatetema buri kaanya, nibakutangaarira. <verse eid="EZK 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 26:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 19:1">Ezk 19:1</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:23">32:23</ref>. </char></note> Baryakucurira nibakugira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:17">Ai bambe, iwe orurembo orwarangainwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:17">Orwabaire ruri rukuru aha nyanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:17">Iwe n'abaabaire bakutwiremu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:17">Abaabaire batiinisa abatwire omu nsi yoona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:17">K'ocwekyereire okahwa omu nyanja!<verse eid="EZK 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 26:18" />Mbwenu ebirwa nibitetema</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:18">Aha izooba ry'okugwa kwawe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:18">Eego, ebirwa by'omu nyanja bihahaize omutima</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:18">Ahabw'okuhwaho kwawe.<verse eid="EZK 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 26:19" />Ahakuba oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Ku ndikugira orurembo orusheenyirwe nk'endembo ezitakituurwamu bantu, naakurengyezaho amaizi g'enyanja, amaizi maingi gaakushweka, <verse eid="EZK 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 26:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 32:18">Ezk 32:18</ref>. </char></note> obwo ndyakuroha Okuzimu hamwe n'abarikushuumayo, oshangyeyo aba ira, nkutuuze omu nsi yaayo, ngu nyentsya otarituurwamu, n'obu kwakuba okugira omwanya omu nsi y'abahuriire. <verse eid="EZK 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 26:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:36">Ezk 27:36</ref>. </char></note> Ndyakwita kubi, nkumareho; torigaruka kubaho; kandi n'obu barikusherura bata, torigaruka kuboneka; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 26:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="EZK 27" />
  <para style="s1">Ezekieli okucurira Tuuro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 27:1" />Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyagaruka kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 27:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:17">Ezk 26:17</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu, Mwana w'omuntu, hati curira Tuuro, <verse eid="EZK 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 27:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:3, 4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 28:2">Ezk 28:2</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 28:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 23:3">Isa 23:3</ref>. </char></note> eri aha nyambukiro y'enyanja, omushuubuzi orikushuubura omu mahanga g'omu birwa bingi, nogigira oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:3">Iwe Tuuro, ogizire oti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:3">Ndi murungi, tiinyine kabara.<verse eid="EZK 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 27:4" />Emyatano yaawe eri ahagati y'enyanja;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:4">Abombeki baawe bakahikiiriza oburungi bwawe;<verse eid="EZK 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 27:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 3:9">Bir 3:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bakashara embaaho zaawe zoona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:5">Omu miberooshi y'omuri Seniiri;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:5">Baiha omwereezi omuri Lebanooni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:5">Baagukubaijeramu omurongooti;<verse eid="EZK 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 27:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 2:13">Isa 2:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Emyela y'omuri Bashani</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:6">Niyo baakubaiziiremu engahi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:6">Embaho ezaariire omu meeri bakazibaija omu miteyashuuri</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:6">Erikuruga omu birwa bya Kitimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:6">Bakazicwereranamu emiino y'enjojo.<verse eid="EZK 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 27:7" />Amatanga gaawe gakakorwa omuri bafuta ey'ebicwererane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:7">Eyaarugire Misri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:7">Ngu gabe orurango rwawe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:7">Emyenda ya bururu n'eya bujwa eyaarugire omu birwa bya Elisha,<verse eid="EZK 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 27:8" />Abatuuzi ba Sidoni na Aruvaada</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:8">Nibo baabaire bari abavugi b'amaato gaawe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:8">Abahangu ba Zeemeri abaabaire bari omuriiwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:8">Nibo baabaire bari abahabuzi b'emeeri zaawe.<verse eid="EZK 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 27:9" />Abakuru ba Gebali n'abahangu baayo abaabaire batwire omuriiwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:9">Nibo baabaire bari abahomeerezi b'emeeri zaawe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:9">Emeeri z'omu nyanja zoona n'abarimbi baazo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:9">Bikaba biri omuriiwe nibihingisa eby'obushuubuzi byawe.<verse eid="EZK 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 27:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 30:5">Ezk 30:5</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 38:5">38:5</ref>; <ref loc="SNG 4:4">Kyesh 4:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aba Peresi na Luudi na Puuti bakaba bari omu ihe ryawe, bari engabo zaawe; bakaba bakuhanikaho engabo n'enkofiira z'ebyoma, bakuha ekitiinisa. <verse eid="EZK 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 27:11" />Abashaija ba Aruvaadi n'aba Heleki bakaba bari aha mutwe gw'orugo rwawe orwabaire rukwehinguriririize, n'aba Gamedi bari omu minaara yaawe; nabo bakaba bahanika engabo zaabo aha bisiika byawe, bahikiiriza oburungi bwawe.<verse eid="EZK 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 27:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 10:22">1 Bag 10:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aba Tarushiishi bakaba bashuubura naiwe ahabw'obutungi bwawe bwingi obw'emiringo yoona; bareeta efeeza, ebyoma, amabaati na risasi, babihingisa ebyawe. <verse eid="EZK 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 27:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:6">Yoel 3:6</ref>. </char></note> Aba Yavani, Tubali na Mesheki bakaba bashuubura naiwe; bareeta abantu n'ebintu by'emiringa, babihingisa eby'obushuubuzi byawe. <verse eid="EZK 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 27:14" />Aba Besitogarama bareeta embaraasi, n'embaraasi z'engamba, n'enyumbu, bazihingisa eby'obushuubuzi byawe. <verse eid="EZK 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 27:15" />Aba Dedani bakaba bashuubura naiwe; obushuubuzi bw'omu birwa bingi bukaba buri omu bushoboorozi bwawe; bakaba bakureetera emiino y'enjojo n'embaaho z'emifunjo kubihingisa. <verse eid="EZK 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 27:16" />Aba Siria bakaba bashuubura naiwe ahabw'ebintu byawe kuba bingi munonga; eby'obushuubuzi byawe bakaba babihingisa simaragido, erangi ya bujwa, emyenda y'amabara agacwereraine, bafuta, korali na kalukedoni. <verse eid="EZK 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 27:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:25">Kut 37:25</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 5:9">1 Bag 5:9</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 5:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 12:20">Byak 12:20</ref>. </char></note> Aba Yuda n'ab'omu nsi ya Israeli bakaba bashuubura naiwe; eby'obushuubuzi byawe babihingisa engano, emizeituuni, emitiini, obwoki, amajuta n'emibazi y'okutamba obuhuta. <verse eid="EZK 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 27:18" />Aba Damasiko bakaba bashuubura naiwe ahabw'ebintu byawe kuba bingi munonga, n'obutungi bwawe kuba bwingi kandi obw'emiringo yoona; <verse eid="EZK 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 27:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:23">Kur 30:23</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 30:24">24</ref>. </char></note> eby'obushuubuzi byawe babihingisa viinyo ya Helebooni, ebyoya by'entaama ebirikwera, viinyo ya Uzali, ebyoma, kasiya na kaane. <verse eid="EZK 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 27:20" />Aba Dedani bakaba bahingisa naiwe emyenda y'amatandiiko g'aha mbaraasi. <verse eid="EZK 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 27:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:7">Isa 60:7</ref>. </char></note> Abaharabu n'abanyiginya ba Kedari boona nibo waabaire okunda kuguraho abaana b'entaama, empaya z'entaama, n'embuzi; ezo nizo baabaire bahingisa naiwe. <verse eid="EZK 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 27:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 72:15">Zab 72:15</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:6">Isa 60:6</ref>. </char></note> Abashuubuzi ba Sheeba na Raama bakaba bashuubura naiwe; eby'obushuubuzi byawe bakaba babihingisa emigaju y'emiringo yoona n'obubaane bwona obw'obuguzi bwingi, n'ezaabu. <verse eid="EZK 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 27:23" />Aba Harani, Kaana, Edeni, Ashuri na Kilumaadi, bakaba bashuubura naiwe. <verse eid="EZK 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 27:24" />Abo bo bakaba bakureetera emyenda mirungi munonga, emyenda ya bururu n'ey'amabara gacwereraine, n'ebirago by'ehuuzi z'amabara ebikomesiibwe emigoye eyogosire; ebyo nibyo baabaire bakuguza. <verse eid="EZK 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 27:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:4">Ezk 27:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 23:1">Isa 23:1</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 23:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 48:7">Zab 48:7</ref>. </char></note> Emeeri za Tarushiishi zikaba zibunzya ebintu byawe by'obushuubuzi. Otyo waatunga ebintu bingi, waagira ekitiinisa kingi ahagati y'enyanja.<verse eid="EZK 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 27:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 18:17">Yer 18:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu abavugi b'emeeri zaawe bakutwaire omu nyanja ahu amaizi maingi gari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:26">Omuyaga gw'oburugwa-izooba gwakuhendagurira ahagati yaayo.<verse eid="EZK 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 27:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 26:18">Ezk 26:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obutungi bwawe, ebintu byawe, eby'obushuubuzi byawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:27">Abarimbi baawe, abahabuzi b'emeeri zaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:27">Abahomeerezi baazo, abashuubuzi b'ebintu byawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:27">Engabo zaawe zoona eziri omuriiwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:27">N'abantu baawe boona bakurimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:27">Byona biryarohama ahagati y'enyanja</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:27">Aha izooba ry'okucwekyerezibwa kwawe.<verse eid="EZK 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 27:28" />Ensi yaawe eryatetemesibwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:28">Obwaku bw'okutaka kw'abahabuzi b'emeeri zaawe,<verse eid="EZK 27:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 27:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:29, 30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 6:26">Yer 6:26</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 2:10">Tonz 2:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:17">Kush 18:17</ref>, <ref loc="REV 18:18">18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abavugi baawe abakwata engahi boona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:29">Barugye omu meeri zaabo, batemburukye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:29">Abarimbi n'abahabuzi b'emeeri boona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:29">Baryayemerera aha nkungu,<verse eid="EZK 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 27:30" />Bakucurire nibaborooga munonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:30">Beeshukye omucuucu omu mitwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:30">Beekuringye omu iju rya kashenda,<verse eid="EZK 27:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 27:31" />Bamwe enkomborora ahabwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:31">Beezirikye ebiguniya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:31">Bakucurire baine obusaasi bwingi aha mutima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:31">Baine amaganya maingi.<verse eid="EZK 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 27:32" />Omu kucura kwabo baryatonzya munonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:32">Bakuririre nibaigira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:32">N'oha oracwekyerereire ahagati y'enyanja nka Tuuro?<verse eid="EZK 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 27:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 18:15">Kush 18:15</ref>, <ref loc="REV 18:19">19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eby'obushuubuzi byawe ku byabaire biija nibiruga omu nyanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:33">Okaba ohaazya amahanga maingi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:33">Otungisa abagabe b'omu nsi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:33">Obutungi bwawe bwingi kandi eby'obushuubuzi byawe.<verse eid="EZK 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 27:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 26:19">Ezk 26:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu hati ohendagwirwe ebingonzi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:34">Ori ahagati y'enyanja;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:34">Ebintu byawe by'obushuubuzi n'abarimbi baawe boona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:34">Baarohama naiwe.<verse eid="EZK 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 27:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 26:15">Ezk 26:15</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:10">32:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abatwire omu birwa boona nibakushamaarira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:35">N'abagabe baabo boona baine obwoba bwingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:35">Aha maisho gaabo hahinduriize.<verse eid="EZK 27:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 27:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:36: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 26:21">Ezk 26:21</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:11">Kush 18:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abashuubuzi b'omu mahanga nibakweshaanya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:36">Ofiire kubi; torigaruka kubaho ebiro byona.<verse eid="EZK 27:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="EZK 28" />
  <para style="s1">Okugarurwa ahansi kw'omugabe wa Tuuro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 28:1" />Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikagaruka kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 28:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 26:16">2 Bus 26:16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 31:3">Isa 31:3</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:7">Kush 18:7</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, gambira omugabe wa Tuuro oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:2">Ahabw'omutima gwawe kugira amaryo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:2">Okagira oti: Ndi ruhanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:2">Nshutama aha kitebe kya Ruhanga Nyamuhanga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:2">Ahagati y'enyanja;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:2">Kwonka ori omuntu, tori Ruhanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:2">N'obu oraabe noogira ngu oine obwengye nka Ruhanga,<verse eid="EZK 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 28:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:3-5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 1:17">Dan 1:17</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 5:11">5:11</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:2">Zek 9:2</ref>, <ref loc="ZEC 9:3">3</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ekya buzima nookiza Danieli obwengye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:3">Tihariho mubonano, ogu otarikumanya;<verse eid="EZK 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 28:4" />Obwengye bwawe n'okumanya kwawe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:4">Bikakureetera okwetungisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:4">Washanguruza ezaabu n'efeeza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:4">Waabita omu mabiikiro gaawe.<verse eid="EZK 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 28:5" />Ahabw'okugira obwengye bwingi omu kushuubura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:5">Okanyiise obutungi bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:5">Omutima gwawe gwabwehimbisizamu;<verse eid="EZK 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 28:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TH 2:4">2 Tes 2:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo Mukama RUHANGA arikukugirira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:6">Ahabw'okugira ngu oine obwengye nka Ruhanga,<verse eid="EZK 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 28:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 30:11">Ezk 30:11</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 31:12">31:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, nikyo ndikuteereza abanyamahanga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:7">B'omu mahanga agarikukiza agandi kutiinisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:7">Bakasyorayo zaarurara zaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:7">Bakarwanisa oburungi bw'obwengye bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:7">Bakashiisha ekitiinisa kyawe.<verse eid="EZK 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 28:8" />Baryakuroha omu Kiina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:8">Ofe orufu orw'abaitiirwe ahagati y'enyanja.<verse eid="EZK 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 28:9" />Ebyo oryaba nookigambira omu maisho g'abarikukwita,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:9">Oto: Ndi ruhanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:9">Haza omu maisho g'abarikukuhutaaza</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:9">Ori omuntu-buntu, otari Ruhanga?<verse eid="EZK 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 28:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 31:18">Ezk 31:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oryaitwa abanyamahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:10">Ofe orufu rw'abatashazirwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:10">Ahakuba niinye naakigamba.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 28:10">Nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 28:11" />Kandi ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyagaruka kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 28:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:3">Ezk 27:3</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, tongyeza omugabe wa Tuuro, oboroogye, noomugira oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:12">Iwe, okaba ori eky'okureeberaho ky'okuba ohikire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:12">Oijwire obwengye, ori murungi otaine kabara.<verse eid="EZK 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 28:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 27:16">Ezk 27:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 31:8">31:8</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 31:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 2:8">Kut 2:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okaba ori omuri Edeni ekibanja kya Ruhanga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:13">Ohunzirwe buri kabaare koona ak'obuguzi bwingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:13">Saradio, topazi, arimaasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:13">Berulo, shohamu, yasipi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:13">Safiro, samaragido, kabunkulo n'ezaabu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:13">Eby'okutamu obwo bubaare, n'ebisharwirwe byawe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:13">Bikozirwe omu zaabu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:13">Aha izooba eri waazaariirweho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:13">Ebyo byona bikaba bitebeekanisiibwe.<verse eid="EZK 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 28:14" />Nkakutamu hamwe na kerubi omurinzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:14">Owaashukirweho amajuta;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:14">Okaba ori aha rushozi rwa Ruhanga orurikwera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:14">Noogyendagyenda ahagati y'amabaare g'omuriro.<verse eid="EZK 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 28:15" />Okwiha obu waahangwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:15">Okaba otagira kamogo omu mitwarize yaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:15">Okuhitsya obu waareebirwemu okutahikiirira.<verse eid="EZK 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 28:16" />Omu bushuubuzi bwawe bwingi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:16">Okaijuriramu eitima, waacumura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:16">nkyo naakubingiire nk'ekintu kisiisikaire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:16">Nkakwiha aha rushozi rwa Ruhanga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:16">Kerubi ogwo omurungi akakubinga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:16">omuri ago mabaare g'omuriro.<verse eid="EZK 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 28:17" />Omutima gwawe gukeehimbisa ahabw'oburungi bwawe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:17">Waashiisha obwengye bwawe ahabw'ekitiinisa kyawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:17">Naakunaga ahansi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:17">Naakwanika omu maisho g'abagabe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:17">Ngu bakushamaarire.<verse eid="EZK 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 28:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 1:10">Amo 1:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:8">Kush 18:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'eby'okushiisha byawe bingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:18">Omu kutahikiirira kw'obushuubuzi bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:18">okajumisa emyanya yaawe erikwera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:18">Nikyo naihiire omuriro omuriiwe, gukakwotsya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:18">Nkakucwera eiju aha nsi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:18">Omu maisho g'abaakureebire boona.<verse eid="EZK 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 28:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 27:36">Ezk 27:36</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ab'omu mahanga boona abarikukumanya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:19">Nibakutangaarira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:19">Ofiire kubi: torigaruka kubaho ebiro byona.<verse eid="EZK 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 28:20" />Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyagaruka kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 28:21" />Mwana w'omuntu, ta amaisho gaawe ahari Sidoni, ogihanuurire ebirigibaho, noogira oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:21">Iwe Sidoni, reeba naaba omuzigu waawe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:21">Niinyija kworeka ekitiinisa kyangye omuriiwe.<verse eid="EZK 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 28:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 20:41">Ezk 20:41</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 39:13">39:13</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 14:4">Kur 14:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ku ndiheza kugireetamu ebifubiro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:22">N'okugyorekamu okwera kwangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:22">Obwo baryamanya ku ndi MUKAMA;<verse eid="EZK 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 28:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 38:22">Ezk 38:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba ndyagyoherereza orufu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:23">Nsheeshe eshagama omu nguuto zaayo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:23">Abariitwa baryagwa ahagati yaayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:23">Nibaitwa rurara erikugirwanisa embaju zoona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:23">Obwo nibwo barimanya ku ndi MUKAMA.<verse eid="EZK 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 28:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 16:57">Ezk 16:57</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 33:55">Kub 33:55</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi tiharibaho mikwatangwe erigaruka kucumita enju ya Israeli, n'obu gaakuba amahwa kugisaasa, okuruga omu babeehinguririize boona, abaabaire babatwaza kubi nibabagaya. Obwo nibwo barimanya ku ndi Mukama RUHANGA.<verse eid="EZK 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 28:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 11:17">Ezk 11:17</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:25">37:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Ku ndiheza kutaaruura ab'enju ya Israeli, naabaiha omu mahanga ei baataataaniire, naayeyoreka omuribo ku ndi orikwera omu maisho g'ago mahanga, obwo nibwo barituura omu nsi yaabo ey'obuzaarwa, ei naahaire omwiru wangye Yakobo. <verse eid="EZK 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 28:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:21">Isa 65:21</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 9:14">Amo 9:14</ref>. </char></note> Baryagituuramu buhooro, bagyombekyemu amaju, bahingyemu emisiri y'emizaabibu. Ku ndita ebifubiro aha bantu abarikubagaya, abariba babeehinguririize, bo baryaguma bari buhooro. Haza obwo nibwo barimanya ku ndi Mukama RUHANGA waabo.<verse eid="EZK 28:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="EZK 29" />
  <para style="s1">Ebifubiro ebi Abanyamisri bariheebwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 29:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 26:1">Ezk 26:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwa ikumi, omu kwezi kwa ikumi, aha kiro kyakwo kya ikumi na bibiri, ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 29:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 19:1">Isa 19:1</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, ta amaisho gaawe ahari Faraho omugabe wa Misri, omuhanuurire ebirimubaho, we na Misri yoona, <verse eid="EZK 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 29:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 32:2">Ezk 32:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 27:1">Isa 27:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 51:9">51:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 44:30">Yer 44:30</ref>. </char></note> noogira oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:3">Reeba, naaba omuzigu waawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:3">Iwe Faraho omugabe wa Misri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:3">Ekijoka ekituura omu migyera yaayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:3">Ekirikugira kiti: Omugyera Nailo n'ogwangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:3">Kandi niinye naaguhangire.<verse eid="EZK 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 29:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 38:4">Ezk 38:4</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 19:28">2 Bag 19:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Niinyija kukukwatsa amarobo omu itama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:4">Ndeetere eby'enyanja by'omu migyera yaawe kukwatira aha ngamba zaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:4">Nkukuure omu mingyera yaawe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:4">Hamwe n'eby'enyanja byamwo byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:4">Ebiriba bikwatiire aha ngamba zaawe.<verse eid="EZK 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 29:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 32:4">Ezk 32:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:33">Yer 7:33</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyakunaga omu ihamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:5">Iwe n'eby'enyanja by'omu migyera yaawe byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:5">Ogwe omu bwerere, obure ow'okukurundarunda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:5">N'obu yaakuba ow'okukuziika;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:5">Ahabw'okuba nkakuhayo kuba eby'okurya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:5">By'enyamaishwa z'omu ishwa n'amahungu g'omu mwanya.<verse eid="EZK 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 29:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 18:21">2 Bag 18:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Haza obwo nibwo abatuuzi ba Misri boona barimanya ku ndi MUKAMA; ahakuba okaba orubango rw'ekibingo aha nju ya Israeli; <verse eid="EZK 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 29:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 17:17">Ezk 17:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:3">Isa 30:3</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 30:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 37:5-8">Yer 37:5-8</ref>. </char></note> ku baakukwatsireho, waashatuka, waataagura amabega gaabo goona; kandi ku baakwegamiire, waahendeka, waareetera enyugunyu zaabo zoona kutetema; <verse eid="EZK 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 29:8" />nikyo Mukama RUHANGA arikugirira ati: Reeba, ndyakuteeza rurara, nkumaremu abantu n'amatungo; <verse eid="EZK 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 29:9" />kandi ensi ya Misri yoona eryaba amatongo, ebi eihamba; obwo nibwo barimanya ku ndi MUKAMA.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 29:9">Ahabw'okugira oti: Omugyera Nailo n'ogwangye, niinye naaguhangire, <verse eid="EZK 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 29:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 30:12">Ezk 30:12</ref>. </char></note> n'ahabw'ekyo reeba, naaba omuzigu waawe; n'ensi ya Misri ndyagihindurira kimwe amatongo, ngigire eihamaba, okuruga ahari Migidooli okuhika Syene, n'okuhika aha mwatano gwa Esiopia. <verse eid="EZK 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 29:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 32:13">Ezk 32:13</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 35:7">35:7</ref>. </char></note> Terirabwamu kigyere ky'omuntu, n'obu kyakuba eky'enyamaishwa; eryamara emyaka makumi ana etatwirwemu. <verse eid="EZK 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 29:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 30:7">Ezk 30:7</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 30:23">23</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 30:26">26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 46:19">Yer 46:19</ref>. </char></note> Kandi egyo nsi ya Misri ndyagigira amatongo ahagati y'ezindi nsi ezaahindukire amatongo; n'endembo zaayo zimare emyaka makumi ana ziri amatongo omu zaacwekyerereziibwe. Kandi ndyataataanisiza Abanyamisri omu mahanga, mbanaganagye omu nsi zaago.<verse eid="EZK 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 29:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 46:26">Yer 46:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Egyo myaka makumi ana ku erihwaho, ndyataaruura Abanyamisri, mbaihe omu mahanga, ei baataataaniire; <verse eid="EZK 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 29:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 17:14">Ezk 17:14</ref>. </char></note> kandi ndyagarura Abanyamisri abatwairwe bari enkwatwa, mbareete omu nsi Patiroosi, ensi ei baakomookiremu; okwo niyo barihindukira obugabe obutaine kitiinisa. <verse eid="EZK 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 29:15" />Kandi baryakira obundi bugabe bwona okutagira kitiinisa; tiburigaruka kutegyeka gandi mahanga. <verse eid="EZK 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 29:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 30:2">Isa 30:2</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 30:3">3</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 4:17">Tonz 4:17</ref>. </char></note> Tiburigaruka kuba bwesigye bw'enju ya Israeli, okwijutsya ekicumuro kyabo ky'omu bunaku, obu baabaire babahindukira ngu babahe emikono. Haza obwo nibwo barimanya ku ndi Mukama RUHANGA.<verse eid="EZK 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 29:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 29:1">Ezk 29:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima omu mwaka gwa makumi abiri na mushanju, omu kwezi kw'okubanza, aha kiro kyakwo ky'okubanza, ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 29:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:7">Ezk 26:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 27:6">Yer 27:6</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni akakoresa eihe rye n'amaani kurwanisa Tuuro, omutwe gwa buri muntu gwaba oruhara, n'amabega gaabo gaahonoka; kwonka taine ki yaihireyo, we n'eihe rye, ahabw'okufa kubi kwe obu yaagiteera. <verse eid="EZK 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 29:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 32:11">Ezk 32:11</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 32:12">12</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo Mukama RUHANGA arikugirira ati: Reeba, ensi ya Misri ndyagiha Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni, atware abantu baayo, aginyagye, kandi ebi arinyaga bibe ebihembo by'engabo ze. <verse eid="EZK 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 29:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:9">Yer 25:9</ref>. </char></note> Mmuhaire ensi ya Misri kuba ebihembo by'ebi yaahendekyeire, ahabw'okuba niinye baakoreire; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 29:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 24:27">Ezk 24:27</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 132:17">Zab 132:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:69">Luk 1:69</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eryo izooba ndyamereza enju ya Israeli eihembe, kandi ndyayashamya akanwa kaawe omuribo. Haza obwo nibwo barimanya ku ndi MUKAMA.<verse eid="EZK 29:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="EZK 30" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 30:1" />Kandi ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyagaruka kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 30:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:12">Ezk 34:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 13:6">Isa 13:6</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:1">Yoel 2:1</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, hanuura ogire oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:2">Muboroogye nimugira muti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:2">Eshi eryo izooba riryagwerwa kagwe!<verse eid="EZK 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 30:3" />Ahabw'okuba eryo izooba riri haihi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:3">Eizooba rya MUKAMA riri haihi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:3">Riryaba eizooba ry'ekibunda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:3">Bube obunaku bw'ekifubiro ky'amahanga.<verse eid="EZK 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 30:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 29:8">Ezk 29:8</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 29:19">19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Rurara eryateera Misri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:4">Kandi obusaasi buryaba omuri Esiopia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:4">Abaitsirwe ku barigwa omuri Misri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:4">Obutungi bwayo bwanyagwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:4">N'emisingi yaayo yaasheenywa.<verse eid="EZK 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 30:5" />Esiopia, Puuti, Luudi, Buharabu yoona, Libya, n'abantu b'omuri egyo nsi abariba baragaine endagaano y'okukwatanisa, baryaitirwa hamwe rurara.<verse eid="EZK 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 30:6" />Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:6">Abantu abarikuhwera Misri baryagwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:6">Kandi amaani agu erikwehimbisizaho garyaikaikana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:6">Abantu baayo baryaitwa rurara</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:6">Okuruga Migidooli okuhika Syene;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:6">Nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 30:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 29:12">Ezk 29:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eryahindurwa amatongo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:7">Ahagati y'ezindi nsi ezaahindwirwe amatongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:7">N'endembo zaayo ziryaba ahagati y'ezaacwekyereziibwe.<verse eid="EZK 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 30:8" />Ku ndiba naatwekire omuriro omuri Misri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:8">N'abahwezi baayo boona baahendekire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:8">Obwo baryamanya ku ndi MUKAMA.<verse eid="EZK 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 30:9" />Eryo izooba entumwa z'amaguru ziryandugaho, zize kutiinisa Abanyesiopia abataine ki beetaireho, bagire obusaasi aha izooba eri Misri eritungiraho ekifubiro kandi reeba, eryo izooba ryaza kwija.<verse eid="EZK 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 30:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 29:19">Ezk 29:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:10">Ndyamaraho obutungi bwa Misri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:10">Bumarweho Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni.<verse eid="EZK 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 30:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 28:7">Ezk 28:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 29:8">29:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> We n'engabo ze ezi ariba aine,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:11">Ezikukiza amahanga goona kutiinisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:11">Ziryahuruzibwa kucwekyereza ensi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:11">Zisyoreyo zaarurara zaazo kurwanisa Misri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:11">N'okugiijuza emitumbi.<verse eid="EZK 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 30:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 29:10">Ezk 29:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 19:4-6">Isa 19:4-6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyayomya emigyera yaamwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:12">Egyo nsi ngiguze abantu ababi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:12">Kandi ndyareeta abanyamahanga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:12">Bagihindure amatongo n'ebigirimu byona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:12">Nyowe MUKAMA niinye naakigamba.<verse eid="EZK 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 30:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 19:16">Isa 19:16</ref>; <ref loc="JER 43:12">Yer 43:12</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 10:11">Zek 10:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:13">Ndyacwekyereza ebishushani ebirikuramibwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:13">Mmareho ebishushani omuri Noofu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:13">Omuri Misri tiharigaruka kubamu mugabe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:13">Ntyo ngireetemu okutiina.<verse eid="EZK 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 30:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 28:18">Ezk 28:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Patiroosi ndyagihindura amatongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:14">Zoani ngitwekyemu omuriro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:14">Na Tebesi ngihe ebifubiro.<verse eid="EZK 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 30:15" />Kandi ndyashuka ekiniga kyangye ahari Siini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:15">Ekigo kya Misri ekigumire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:15">N'enyanja y'abantu b'omuri Tebesi mbamareho.<verse eid="EZK 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 30:16" />Ndyatweka omuriro omuri Misri;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:16">Siini eryagira obusaasi bwingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:16">Tebesi baryagisheenya bagitaahemu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:16">Engo zaayo zoona zikumbagazibwe.<verse eid="EZK 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 30:17" />Abatsigazi b'omuri Aveeni na Pibeseeti baryaitwa rurara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:17">N'abakazi baamwo batwarwe bari enkwatwa.<verse eid="EZK 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 30:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 30:6">Ezk 30:6</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 8:9">Amo 8:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku ndimara omuri Tehapaneheesi obutegyeki bwa Misri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:18">N'amaani g'amaryo gaayo gaahweraho kimwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:18">Omushana guryahinduka omwirima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:18">Eshwekwe ebicu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:18">N'abaishiki baayo batwarwe bari enkwatwa.<verse eid="EZK 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 30:19" />Okwo nikwo ndiha Misri ebifubiro;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:19">Haza obwo nibwo barimanya ku ndi MUKAMA.<verse eid="EZK 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 30:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 26:1">Ezk 26:1</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 29:17">29:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima omu mwaka gwa ikumi na gumwe, omu kwezi kw'okubanza, aha kiro kyakwo kya mushanju, ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 30:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 30:13">Yer 30:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 48:25">48:25</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, mpenzire omukono gwa Faraho omugabe wa Misri; kandi tigukabungirwe n'obu kwakuba okugushemba kugutambira, ngu gubone kugira amaani g'okukwata rurara. <verse eid="EZK 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 30:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:7">2 Bag 24:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 37:17">Zab 37:17</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo Mukama RUHANGA arikugirira ati: Reeba, naaba omuzigu wa Faraho; kandi ndyamuhenda emikono yombi, oguhuriire n'ogwahendekire, mmunagise rurara ei akwaitse. <verse eid="EZK 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 30:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 29:12">Ezk 29:12</ref>. </char></note> Ndyataataanisiza Abanyamisri omu mahanga, mbanaganagye omu nsi zaago. <verse eid="EZK 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 30:24" />Ndyaha emikono y'omugabe wa Babulooni amaani, mmute rurara yangye omu ngaro; kwonka Faraho we ndyamuhenda emikono, atsindire omu maisho ge, nk'ohutaire obuhuta obw'okumwita. <verse eid="EZK 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 30:25" />Emikono y'omugabe wa Babulooni ndyagihamya, kwonka eya Faraho eryagwa; aho niho barimanyira ku ndi MUKAMA. Ku ndikwatsa omugabe wa Babulooni rurara yangye, aryabangira ensi ya Misri omukono kugirwanisa; <verse eid="EZK 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 30:26" />ndyataataanisiza Abanyamisri omu mahanga, mbanaganagye omu nsi zaago. Haza obwo nibwo barimanya ku ndi MUKAMA.<verse eid="EZK 30:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="EZK 31" />
  <para style="s1">Faraho okutiinisibwa ebyabaire aha Baasiria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 31:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 30:20">Ezk 30:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwa ikumi na gumwe omu kwezi kwa kashatu, aha kiro kyakwo ky'okubanza, ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 31:2" />Mwana w'omuntu, gambira Faraho omugabe wa Misri n'enyanja ye y'abantu, omugire oti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:2">Omu bukuru bwawe nooshushana n'oha?<verse eid="EZK 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 31:3" />Reeba, ninkushushanisa n'omwereezi gw'omuri Lebanooni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:3">Ogwine amataagi marungi n'ekicuucu kihango,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:3">Omuraingwa munonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:3">Ogu omutwe gwagwo guhikire omu bicu.<verse eid="EZK 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 31:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 17:7">Ezk 17:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Gukanywaisibwa amaizi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:4">amaizi maingi gaagukuza, gwanyeeta;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:4">Emigyera yaagwo yaaguma neeguhimintika</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:4">Embaju zooba ahu gwabairwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:4">Gwahabura emikura yaagwo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:4">Okwitirirwa emiti y'omu kibira yoona.<verse eid="EZK 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 31:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 17:5">Ezk 17:5</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 4:11">Dan 4:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo kyagureeteire kuba muraingwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:5">Okukira emiti y'omu kibira yoona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:5">Amataagi gaagwo gakakura, gakahanguha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:5">N'amakye gakagaara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:5">Gakakuzibwa amaizi maingi agu gwanyweire.<verse eid="EZK 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 31:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 17:23">Ezk 17:23</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 4:12">Dan 4:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amahungu goona ag'omu mwanya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:6">Gaayarika omu mataagi gaagwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:6">Enyamaishwa z'omu ishwa zoona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:6">Zaaguma nizizaarira ahansi y'ago mataagi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:6">N'amahanga makuru goona gaatuura omu kicuucu kyagwo.<verse eid="EZK 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 31:7" />Okwo nikwo gwabaire murungi omu buhango bwagwo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:7">N'omu buraingwa bw'amataagi gaagwo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:7">Ahabw'okuba gukaba gutsimbire emizi okuzimu omu maizi maingi.<verse eid="EZK 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 31:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 28:13">Ezk 28:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Enyereezi y'omu kibanja kiri ekya Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:8">Terabaasize kugushereka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:8">N'emiberooshi ekaba etarikwingana n'amataagi gaagwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:8">Emyalamooni ekaba eri busha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:8">Omu kugigyeragyeranisa n'otutaagi twagwo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:8">Omu kibanja kya Ruhanga hakaba hatarimu muti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:8">Ogwine oburungi nk'obw'ogwo.<verse eid="EZK 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 31:9" />Nkagugira murungi ahabw'amataagi gaagwo maingi munonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:9">Kyareetera emiti y'omuri Edeni omu kibanja kya Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:9">Kugugirira eihari.<verse eid="EZK 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 31:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 5:20">Dan 5:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo Mukama RUHANGA arikugirira ati: Ahabw'okunyeeta, gukahika ahaiguru, omutwe gwagwo gukahika omu bicu, omutima gwagwo gukeeshimbisa ahagw'oburaingwa bwagwo, <verse eid="EZK 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 31:11" />ndyaguhayo omu mukono gw'omunyaihanga ow'amaani, agugire nk'oku arikwenda, ahakuba nkagubinga ningutura obubi bwagwo. <verse eid="EZK 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 31:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 28:7">Ezk 28:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:5">32:5</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 4:14">Dan 4:14</ref>. </char></note> Abanyamahanga agarikukira agandi okutiinisa baryagutema, bagutsigyeho; amataagi gaagwo garyagwa aha bibungo n'omu mpanga zoona, kandi amahango garyagwa omu mikura y'amaizi yoona ey'omu nsi, gagume gahendekire, n'amahanga goona ag'omu nsi garyaruga omu kicuucu kyagwo, gagutsigyeho. <verse eid="EZK 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 31:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 32:4">Ezk 32:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 18:6">Isa 18:6</ref>. </char></note> Amahungu g'omu mwanya goona garyagutuuramu ahu gwagwire, n'enyamaishwa z'omu ishwa zoona zituure omu mataagi gaagwo. <verse eid="EZK 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 31:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:20">Ezk 26:20</ref>. </char></note> Ebyo byona biryabaho ngu hatarigira emiti yoona eri aha rubaju rw'amaizi, eyaanyeeta ekahika ahaiguru, emitwe yaayo ekahika omu bicu; kandi ngu hatarigira omuti gwona, ogunywa amaizi, ogwaingana gutyo oburaingwa; ahabw'okuba yoona ehairweyo kufa, okushuuma Okuzimu owa Nyamuteza, n'okushangayo abantu abafa bakashuuma omu Kiina.<verse eid="EZK 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 31:15" />Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Aha izooba eri gwashuumiireho Okuzimu, nkareetera amaizi g'enyanja kugucurira, naazibira emigyera yaayo kugyenda, naacungira amaizi maingi; naareetera Lebanooni kugucurira, n'emiti yoona ey'omu ishwa kuhwa amaani ahabwagwo. <verse eid="EZK 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 31:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:15">Ezk 26:15</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:31">32:31</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 14:8">Isa 14:8</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 14:15">15</ref>. </char></note> Ku naagunagire Okuzimu hamwe n'abarikushuuma omu Kiina, naareetera amahanga kutetema ahabw'okuhurira omutsindo gw'okugwa kwagwo. N'ahabw'ekyo emiti yoona ey'omuri Edeni, eyaatoorainwe kandi erikukira oburungi omuri Lebanooni, yaahuumurizibwa ahu yaabaire eri Okuzimu owa Nyamuteza. <verse eid="EZK 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 31:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 31:6">Ezk 31:6</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:20">32:20</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 4:20">Tonz 4:20</ref>. </char></note> Nayo yaagyenda nagwo Okuzimu, yaashangayo abaitsirwe rurara; eego n'abaabaire batwire omu kicuucu kyagwo baahwerekyerera. <verse eid="EZK 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 31:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 31:2">Ezk 31:2</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:19">32:19</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 32:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:23">Mat 11:23</ref>. </char></note> Omu miti y'omuri Edeni ni muti ki ogurikwinganisa naiwe ekitiinisa n'obukuru? Kwonka oryagarurwa ahansi hamwe n'emiti y'omuri Edeni, ohikye Okuzimu owa Nyamuteza, obyame ahagati y'abatashazirwe hamwe n'abaitsirwe rurara.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 31:18">Ogwo muti ni Faraho n'enyanja y'abantu be boona; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 31:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="EZK 32" />
  <para style="s1">Okucurira Faraho na Misri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 32:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 31:1">Ezk 31:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwa ikumi n'ebiri, omu kwezi kwa ikumi n'abiri, aha kiro kyakwo ky'okubanza, ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 32:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 29:2">Ezk 29:2</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 29:3">3</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:18">34:18</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, tongyeza Faraho omugabe wa Misri, oboroogye, noomugira oti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:2">Nooyeteekateekaho ngu ori omugunju gw'entare omu mahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:2">Kwonka ori nk'ekijoka ekiri omu nyanja;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:2">Otimbiire okuzimu y'amaizi g'emigyera yaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:2">Waatabangura amaizi n'ebigyere byawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:2">Kandi n'emigyera yaago waagishiisha.<verse eid="EZK 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 32:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 12:13">Ezk 12:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:3">Ndyakurengyezaho akatimba kangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:3">Ntume eihe ry'amahanga maingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:3">Gakukurure, gakwiheyo ori omu katimba kangye.<verse eid="EZK 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 32:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 29:5">Ezk 29:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyakunaga aha nkungu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:4">Nkunaganagye omu bwerere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:4">Ndeetere amahungu goona ag'omu mwanya kukugwaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:4">N'enyamaishwa z'omu nsi yoona nzikugaburire, zibwegabwegye.<verse eid="EZK 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 32:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 31:12">Ezk 31:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ndyanaganaga enyama yaawe aha bibungo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:5">N'omutumbi gwawe ngwijuze empanga.<verse eid="EZK 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 32:6" />Ndyajengajenzya ensi n'eshagama yaawe erikusheesheka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:6">Ehikye naaha nshozi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:6">Oijure n'emigyera.<verse eid="EZK 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 32:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isa 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 8:9">Amo 8:9</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:29">Mat 24:29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24">Mak 13:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku ndiraaza okwaka kwawe, ndyashweka eiguru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:7">Enyonyoozi zaaryo nziraaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:7">Eizooba ndishwekye ekicu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:7">N'okwezi kurekye kujwa.<verse eid="EZK 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 32:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:30">Isa 5:30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebirikwakira omu iguru byona ndyabikuraarizaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:8">N'ensi yaawe ngishwekye omwirima;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 32:8">Nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 32:9" />Ku ndikutwara omu mahanga ori enkwatwa, naakuhitsya omu nsi ezi otakamanyaga, ndyahahaaza emitima y'amahanga maingi. <verse eid="EZK 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 32:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:16">Ezk 26:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 27:35">27:35</ref>. </char></note> Ku nditigitira rurara yangye omu maisho gaabo, ndyareetera amahanga maingi kukushamaarira, n'abagabe baago kutetema ahabwawe. Aha izooba ry'okugwa kwawe baryatetema buri kaanya, buri muntu naatetemera amagara ge. <verse eid="EZK 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 32:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 46:26">Yer 46:26</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Rurara y'omugabe wa Babulooni eryakuhikaho. <verse eid="EZK 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 32:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 28:7">Ezk 28:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 29:19">29:19</ref>. </char></note> Ndyareetera enyanja yaawe y'abantu kwitwa zaarurara z'amamanzi agarikukira agandi goona omu mahanga kutiinisa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:12">Amaryo ga Misri baryagacwa busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:12">N'enyanja y'abantu baamwo boona eryacwekyerezibwa.<verse eid="EZK 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 32:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 29:11">Ezk 29:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyamaraho amatungo gaayo goona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:13">Agari aha rubaju rw'amaizi maingi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:13">Ekigyere ky'omuntu weena tikirigaruka kugatabangura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:13">N'obu kyakuba ekyara ky'ekitungirwe kyona.<verse eid="EZK 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 32:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 32:2">Ezk 32:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwo nibwo ndishemeza amaizi gaayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:14">Nkareetera emigyera yaayo kuhimintika nk'amajuta;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 32:14">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 32:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 6:6">Ezk 6:6</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 6:7">7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku ndihindura ensi ya Misri amatongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:15">Yaamarwamu ebiijwiremu byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:15">N'abagirwiremu boona baabacwekyereza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:15">Obwo nibwo barimanya ku ndi MUKAMA.<verse eid="EZK 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 32:16" />Okwo nikwo kutonzya oku baritonzya; abaishiki b'amahanga nikwo baritonzya, nibatongyeza Misri n'enyanja y'abantu baayo boona; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 32:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 32:1">Ezk 32:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwa ikumi n'ebiri, omu kwezi kw'okubanza, aha kiro kyakwo kya ikumi na bitaano, ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 32:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:20">Ezk 26:20</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 31:16">31:16</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, curira enyanja y'abantu ba Misri, obanagye Okuzimu owa Nyamuteza, bo n'abaishiki b'amahanga ag'ekitiinisa, bashangyeyo abashuuma omu Kiina, noogira oti:<verse eid="EZK 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 32:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 31:2">Ezk 31:2</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 31:18">18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ou orikuhita n'oha?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:19">Shuuma, obyame n'abatashazirwe.<verse eid="EZK 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 32:20" />Baryagwa ahagati y'abaitsirwe rurara, kandi enyanja y'abantu be boona eryabyama nawe. <verse eid="EZK 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 32:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 30:6">Ezk 30:6</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 30:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 14:9">Isa 14:9</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 14:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Ahagati Okuzimu niho abategyeki b'amaani baribagambiraho baine abahwezi baabo, nibagira bati: Abatashazirwe bashuumireyo, niyo babyami batarikuteeza, baitsirwe rurara.<verse eid="EZK 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 32:22" />Okwo niyo Asiria eri, n'engabo zaayo zoona, eyahinguririziibwe ebituuro byayo, abo boona baitsirwe rurara, zaabagwisaho; <verse eid="EZK 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 32:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:15">Isa 14:15</ref>. </char></note> abu ebituuro byabo biri aha muheru gw'Ekiina, n'engabo zaayo zikiikiize ekituuro kyayo; boona baitsirwe, baitwe rurara.<verse eid="EZK 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 32:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 49:34-39">Yer 49:34-39</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okwo niyo Elamu eri, n'enyanja y'abantu baayo boona, bakiikiize ekituuro kyayo, boona abaitsirwe rurara, ekabagwisaho, bakashuuma Okuzimu owa Nyamuteza, bakabuzya okutiina omu nsi y'abahuriire, bakeemera enshoni zaabo hamwe n'abashuuma omu Kiina. <verse eid="EZK 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 32:25" />Bamwariire ekitabo ahagati y'abaitsirwe hamwe n'enyanja y'abantu baayo boona, abu ebituuro byayo bigyehinguririize, abo boona n'abatashazirwe abaitsirwe rurara; ahabw'okuba okutiinisa kwabo kukabuga omu nsi y'abahuriire, kandi baayemera enshoni zaabo hamwe n'abashuuma omu Kiina, baateebwa ahagati y'abaitsirwe.<verse eid="EZK 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 32:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 27:13">Ezk 27:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okwo niyo Mesheki na Tubali n'enyanja y'abantu baabo boona bari, beehinguririziibwe ebituuro byabo, boona abatashazirwe baitsirwe rurara; ahabw'okuba bakabuzya okutiinisa kwabo omu nsi y'abahuriire. <verse eid="EZK 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 32:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:18">Isa 14:18</ref>. </char></note> Kandi tibabyami n'amamanzi ga ira agaagwire, gakashuuma Okuzimu n'eby'okurwanisa byago by'orugamba, gakeeshegura zaarurara zaago, n'engabo zaago zikatungamira amagufa gaago; ahabw'okuba okutiinisa kwago kukaba kuri omu nsi y'abahuriire. <verse eid="EZK 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 32:28" />Nikwo naimwe murihendeka, mukabyama n'abatashazirwe abaitsirwe rurara.<verse eid="EZK 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 32:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 25:12-14">Ezk 25:12-14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okwo niyo Edomu eri, abagabe baayo n'abanyiginya baayo boona ababyami n'abaitsirwe rurara, n'obu baraabe bari ab'amaani; babyami n'abatashazirwe abashuuma omu Kiina.<verse eid="EZK 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 32:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 28:21-23">Ezk 28:21-23</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 38:6">38:6</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 38:15">15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okwo niyo abagabe b'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho boona bari, n'Abasidoni boona, abaashumire baine enshoni hamwe n'abaitsirwe, ahabw'okutiinisa kwona oku bareetsire ahabw'amaani gaabo; babyami batashazirwe hamwe n'abaitsirwe rurara, kandi nibeemera enshoni zaabo hamwe n'abashuuma omu Kiina.<verse eid="EZK 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 32:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 31:2">Ezk 31:2</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 31:16">16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Faraho, ku aribareeba, aryayebwa enkau ezi yaagizire ahabw'okufeerwa enyanja y'abantu be boona n'eihe rye ryona, eryaitsirwe rurara; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira; <verse eid="EZK 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 32:32" />ahabw'okuba akabuzya okutiina omu nsi y'abahuriire; n'ahabw'ekyo aryabyama omu batashazirwe hamwe n'abaitsirwe rurara, we n'enyanja y'abantu be boona; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 32:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="EZK 33" />
  <para style="s1">Omurimo gw'omurinzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 33:1" />Bwanyima ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 33:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:11">Ezk 3:11</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, gambira abantu baawe, obagire oti: Ku ndireeta rurara omu nsi, abantu b'egyo nsi baayeihamu omuntu, baamugira omurinzi waabo; <verse eid="EZK 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 33:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 3:6">Amo 3:6</ref>. </char></note> ku arireeba rurara neija omu nsi, yaateera enzamba, yaagambira abantu; <verse eid="EZK 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 33:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:13">Ezk 18:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 18:6">Byak 18:6</ref>. </char></note> obwo omuntu weena ku arihurira eiraka ry'enzamba, ataayeta hari okwo kubuura, rurara yaija, yaamwita, eshagama ye niwe eribarirwa; <verse eid="EZK 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 33:5" />ahakuba akahurira eiraka ry'enzamba, tiyaaryetaho; eshagama ye eryamubarirwa. Ahabw'okuba kuri yaaryetaireho, akaajunire amagara ge. <verse eid="EZK 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 33:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:18">Ezk 3:18</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka omurinzi, ku arireeba rurara neija, ataateera nzamba kugambira abantu, rurara yaija, yaabaitamu omuntu, omuntu ogwo aryaitirwa omu by'okushiisha bye; kwonka eshagama ye ndyagibuuza ogwo murinzi.<verse eid="EZK 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 33:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 3:17">Ezk 3:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naiwe Mwana w'omuntu, nkutaireho kuba omurinzi w'enju ya Israeli; n'ahabw'ekyo hurira ekigambo ekirikuruga omu kanwa kangye, obampanire. <verse eid="EZK 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 33:8" />Ku ndigira omubi nti: Iwe mubi 'we, buzimazima oryafa, naiwe otaagamba, okahana ogwo mubi ngu arekye omuhanda gwe omubi, omubi ogwo aryafeera omu by'okushiisha bye, kwonka eshagama ye niiwe ndigibuuza. <verse eid="EZK 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 33:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:19">Ezk 3:19</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 4:16">1 Tim 4:16</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ku orihana omubi ngu arekye omuhanda gwe omubi, yaayanga kugureka, aryafeera omu by'okushiisha bye, kwonka iwe oryaba okirize amagara gaawe.<verse eid="EZK 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 33:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 4:17">Ezk 4:17</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:11">37:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi, Mwana w'omuntu, gambira enju ya Israeli oti: Imwe nimugira muti: Ebicumuro byaitu n'ebibi byaitu bituriho, bitureeteire okuhwa aha magufa. Mbwenu nitubaasa tuta kugumaho? <verse eid="EZK 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 33:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:23">Ezk 18:23</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 18:31">31</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 55:7">Isa 55:7</ref>. </char></note> Bagire oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Niinyerahira, tinshemerererwa kufa kw'omubi, kureka omubi okureka omuhanda gwe, akaba ohuriire; muhindukye, muhindukye murekye emihanda yaanyu emibi. Mbwenu nimwendera ki kufa, imwe nju ya Israeli 'mwe? <verse eid="EZK 33:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 33:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:24">Ezk 18:24</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 7:14">2 Bus 7:14</ref>. </char></note> Kandi iwe, Mwana w'omuntu, gambira abantu baawe oti: Ohikiriire, ku arishiisha, okuhikiirira kwe tikurimukiza; kandi omubi, ku arihinduka yaareka obubi bwe, obwo bubi bwe buryaba butakimwita; kandi ohikiriire, ku arishiisha, taribaasa kubaisibwaho okuhikiirira kwe. <verse eid="EZK 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 33:13" />N'obu naakugambira ohikiriire nti: Buzimazima oryaba ohuriire, kwonka ku aryesiga okuhikiirira kwe, yaakora eby'okushiisha, tihariho na kimwe omu by'okuhikiirira bye ekiriijukwa; kureka aryafeera omu by'okushiisha bye ebi akozire. <verse eid="EZK 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 33:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:27">Ezk 18:27</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ekindi, n'obu naakugambira omubi nti: Buzimazima oryafa, kwonka ku arihinduka, yaareka ekibi kye, kyaakora eby'ebiragiro kandi ebihikire, <verse eid="EZK 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 33:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:7">Ezk 18:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:11">20:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:8">Luk 19:8</ref>. </char></note> ogwo muntu yaagarura eki akwatiriziibwe, kandi yaagaruraho eki anyagire, yaagyendera omu biragiro ebirikuhaisa amagara, ataakora by'okushiisha, buzimazima aryagumaho, tarifa. <verse eid="EZK 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 33:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:22">Ezk 18:22</ref>. </char></note> Tihariho kibi na kimwe omu bi yaakozire ekirimwijukwaho; ahakuba akozire eby'ebiragiro kandi ebihikire, buzimazima aryagumaho.<verse eid="EZK 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 33:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:17-19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 18:25-27">Ezk 18:25-27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka abantu baawe nibagira bati: Emitwarize ya MUKAMA tehikire; haza eyaabo niyo etahikire. <verse eid="EZK 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 33:18" />Ohikiriire ku arihinduka, yaareka okuhikiirira kwe, yaakora eky'okushiisha, aryafa abizire. <verse eid="EZK 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 33:19" />Kandi omubi ku arihinduka, yaareka obubi bwe, yaakora eby'ebiragiro kandi ebihikire, biryamubaisaho. <verse eid="EZK 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 33:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:30">Ezk 18:30</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka nimugira muti: Emitwarize ya MUKAMA tehikire. Imwe nju ya Israeli 'mwe, ndyabacwera orubanja, buri muntu nk'oku emitwarize ye eri.<verse eid="EZK 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 33:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 24:26">Ezk 24:26</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:17">32:17</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 25:4">2 Bag 25:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima ku twabaaire tumazire emyaka ikumi n'ebiri turi omu bukwatwa, omu kwezi kwa ikumi aha kiro kyakwo kya kataano, haija omushaija ocwire naaruga Yerusaalemu, yampikaho, yaagira ati: Orurembo rukwatsirwe. <verse eid="EZK 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 33:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:3">Ezk 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 24:27">24:27</ref>. </char></note> Omukono gwa MUKAMA gukaba guraire guunyizireho omu mwabazyo, ogwo mushaija ocwire atakaizire; kandi MUKAMA akaba yaayashamize akanwa kangye, obu ogwo mushaija yampikaho omu kasheeshe; ntyo naagamba, tinaaguma ndi ekiteta.<verse eid="EZK 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 33:23" />Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 33:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 36:4">Ezk 36:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 51:2">Isa 51:2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:9">Mat 3:9</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:5">Byak 7:5</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, abatwire omu myanya y'omu nsi ya Israeli eyaatsigirweho batuura nibagira bati: Abrahamu akaba ari omuntu omwe wenka, kwonka yaakubuura ensi; mbwenu itwe turi baingi; buzimazima egi nsi tugihairwe kuba eyaitu. <verse eid="EZK 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 33:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:6">Ezk 18:6</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 22:3">22:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 9:4">Kut 9:4</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo obagire oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Murya enyama n'eshagama, mwimukiza amaisho gaanyu ebishushani ebirikuramibwa, kandi musheesha eshagama. Mbwenu ebyo muryakubuura egyo nsi? <verse eid="EZK 33:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 33:26" />Nimwesiga rurara, mukora ebihagaro, kandi buri muntu ashiisha muka mutaahi we. Mbwenu ebyo muryakubuura egyo nsi? <verse eid="EZK 33:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 33:27" />Okwo nikwo oraabagire oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Niinyerahira, buzimazima abatwire omuri egyo myanya eyaatsigirweho baryaitwa rurara; ori omu ishwa ndyamurekurira enyamaishwa, zimutaanyaguze, n'abari omu bigo bigumire n'omu maaya baitwe orufu. <verse eid="EZK 33:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 33:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 30:6">Ezk 30:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 44:22">Yer 44:22</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ensi ndyagihindura amatongo, ebe eihamba, amaani g'amaryo gaayo gahwereho kimwe; n'ebibungo bya Israeli bibeere kimwe amatongo, harekye kugira owaarabamu. <verse eid="EZK 33:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 33:29" />Ku ndi heza kuhindura ensi amatongo, yaaba eihamba nimbatura ebihagaro byabo byona ebi baakozire, nibwo barimanya ku ndi MUKAMA.<verse eid="EZK 33:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 33:30" />Naiwe Mwana w'omuntu, abantu baawe abarikukugambaho aha rubaju rw'engo n'aha miryango y'amaju, nibagambirana buri muntu na mwene ishe, nibagira bati: Nimwije tuhurire oku ekigambo kiri ekirikuruga omu kanwa ka MUKAMA. <verse eid="EZK 33:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 33:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:1">Ezk 20:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:36">Zab 78:36</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:13">Isa 29:13</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:18">1 Yoh 3:18</ref>. </char></note> Batyo bakwijaho nk'oku abantu baija, bashutama omu maisho gaawe nk'abantu bangye, bahurira ebi orikugamba, kwonka batarikwija kubikora; ahabw'okuba booreka okukunda kwingi n'eminwa yaabo, kwonka emitima yaabo eraramiire amagoba gaabo. <verse eid="EZK 33:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 33:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:26">Mat 7:26</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 7:27">27</ref>. </char></note> Kandi reeba, iwe aharibo ori nk'orikweshongora ekyeshongoro kirungi n'eiraka rirungi naateera gye enanga; ahabw'okuba nibahurira ebi orikugamba, kwonka batarikwija kubikora. <verse eid="EZK 33:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 33:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:5">Ezk 2:5</ref>. </char></note> Ebyo ku biriija, kandi kwo biryaija, obwo nibwo barimanya ku nabi abaire abarimu.<verse eid="EZK 33:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="EZK 34" />
  <para style="s1">Mukama okuhana abariisa ba Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 34:1" />Kandi ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 34:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:1">Yer 23:1</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 12:14">2 Kor 12:14</ref>; <ref loc="JUD 1:12">Yud 12</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, hanuura ebiriba aha bariisa ba Israeli; obahanuurire noobagira oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugambira abariisa ba Israeli, naagira ati: Imwe bariisa ba Israeli 'mwe, abarikweriisa mwenka, omuriisa tashemereire kuriisa entaama? <verse eid="EZK 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 34:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 11:4">Ezk 11:4</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 11:5">5</ref>. </char></note> Nimurya ebishaju, mujwara eby'ebyoya, mubaaga ezigomokire, haza mutarikuziriisa. <verse eid="EZK 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 34:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 11:16">Zek 11:16</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:12">Mat 18:12</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 5:3">1 Pet 5:3</ref>. </char></note> Ezitaine maani timurikuzigaruramu maani; ezirwaire timurikuzitambira; ezihendekire timurikuzibunga; ezirazire timurikuzitaaruura; ezibuzire timurikuzisherura, kureka nimuzitegyekyesa amaani n'omwaga. <verse eid="EZK 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 34:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 50:6">Yer 50:6</ref>, <ref loc="JER 50:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:36">Mat 9:36</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo zaataataaniire, ahabw'okubura omuriisa, zikaba ez'okuriibwa enyamaishwa zoona ez'omu ishwa. <verse eid="EZK 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 34:6" />Entaama zikataataana, zaazengyerera omu nshozi zoona n'omu bibungo biraingwa byona; entaama zangye zikataataanira omu nsi yoona, zaabura ow'okuzisherura, n'obu yaakuba ow'okuzibuuririza.<verse eid="EZK 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 34:7" />N'ahabw'ekyo imwe bariisa 'mwe, nimuhurire ekigambo kya MUKAMA. <verse eid="EZK 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 34:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:9">Isa 56:9</ref>. </char></note> Mukama RUHANGA naayerahira naagira ati: Nimumanya ku entaama zangye zibaire eky'okwitwa, kandi zikaba ez'okuriibwa enyamaishwa zoona ez'omu ishwa ahabw'okutagira muriisa, n'abariisa kwanga kuzisherura, kureka bakaba ab'okweriisa bonka batariise ntaama zangye; <verse eid="EZK 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 34:9" />n'ahabw'ekyo, imwe bariisa 'mwe, nimuhurire ekigambo kya MUKAMA. <verse eid="EZK 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 34:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:18">Ezk 3:18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 13:21">13:21</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 10:3">Zek 10:3</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, naaba omuzigu w'abariisa; ndyababuuza entaama zangye, mbacwe aha kuziriisa; kandi abo bariisa tibarigaruka kweriisa. Ndyaiha entaama zangye omu kanwa kaabo, zirekye kugaruka kuba eby'okurya byabo.<verse eid="EZK 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 34:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 19:10">Luk 19:10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:11">Yoh 10:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, nyowe, nyowe nyenka, naaza kwesherurira entaama zangye, nzibuuririze. <verse eid="EZK 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 34:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 30:3">Ezk 30:3</ref>. </char></note> Nk'oku omuriisa ashanga zimwe aha ntaama ze zitaataine, akazisherura kuzigarura omu busyo, naanye nkwo ndisherura entaama zangye, nkaziiha ei zaataataaniire yoona aha izooba ry'ekibunda n'omwirima ndindindi. <verse eid="EZK 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 34:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 11:17">Ezk 11:17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:3">Yer 23:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ndyazireeta ninziiha omu mahanga, nzitaaruure omu nsi zoona, nzigarure omu nsi yaazo, nziriisize omu nshozi za Israeli, aha mbaju z'emigyera n'omu myanya yoona ey'omu nsi etwirwemu abantu. <verse eid="EZK 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 34:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:14, 15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 23:2">Zab 23:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 32:18">Isa 32:18</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 40:11">40:11</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:12">Yer 33:12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:9">Yoh 10:9</ref>. </char></note> Ndyaziriisiza omu mariisizo marungi, amariisizo gaazo gabe aha bibungo biraingwa bya Israeli; okwo omu mariisizo marungi niyo ziribyama, zikariira omu mariisizo ga Israeli ag'obunyaatsi bwingi. <verse eid="EZK 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 34:15" />Nyowe nyenka niinye ndiba omuriisa w'entaama zangye, <verse eid="EZK 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 34:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 4:6">Mik 4:6</ref>. </char></note> nkazizaagiza; ndyasherura ezibuzire, ngarure ezirazire, mbungye ezihendekire; ezitaine maani, nzigagaruremu, ezigomokire n'ez'amaani nzirinde; kandi zoona ndyaziriisa omu bwinganisa; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 34:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 20:38">Ezk 20:38</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 10:3">Zek 10:3</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:32">Mat 25:32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Mbwenu imwe busyo bwangye 'mwe, reeba, nincwa orubanja rw'entaama na ngyenzi zaazo, n'orw'empaya z'entaama n'ez'embuzi. <verse eid="EZK 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 34:18" />Nimugira ntu n'ekintu kikye, imwe kuheza kurya obunyaatsi bw'omu mariisizo marungi, haza mukaribatiirira obwatsigaraho, n'okunywa amaizi marungi, haza mukatabangura n'ebigyere byanyu agaatsigaraho? <verse eid="EZK 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 34:19" />Entaama zangye zishemereire kurya obunyaatsi obu muribatiriire, kandi zikanywa amaizi agu mutabangwire? <verse eid="EZK 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 34:20" />Nikyo Mukama RUHANGA arikubagirira ati: Reeba, nyowe, nyowe nyenka, ndyacwa orubanja rw'entaama ezigomokire n'ezihururukire. <verse eid="EZK 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 34:21" />Mutsikanisa embaju n'amabega, ezitaine maani muzicumitisa amahembe, okuhitsya obu muzitaataanisa zikaza hare; <verse eid="EZK 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 34:22" />nikyo ndijunira obusyo bwangye, butagarukye kuba eky'okwitwa, nkacwa orubanja rw'entaama na ngyenzi zaazo. <verse eid="EZK 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 34:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 37:24">Ezk 37:24</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:70-72">Zab 78:70-72</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:4">Yer 23:4</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 5:4">Mik 5:4</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima ndyaziteeraho omuriisa omwe, omwiru wangye Daudi aziriise; niwe ariziriisa, akaba omuriisa waazo. <verse eid="EZK 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 34:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 37:25">Ezk 37:25</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 37:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="JER 30:9">Yer 30:9</ref>. </char></note> Kandi nyowe MUKAMA ndyaba Ruhanga waazo, n'omwiru wangye Daudi abe omugabe omurizo. Nyowe MUKAMA niinye naakigamba.<verse eid="EZK 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 34:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 37:26">Ezk 37:26</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 38:8">38:8</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:6">Lev 26:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 54:10">Isa 54:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyaragaana nazo endagaano y'obusingye, mmare enyamaishwa mbi omu nsi, zibone kuguma omu ihamba ziri buhooro, ziraare omu bishaka. <verse eid="EZK 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 34:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:4">Lev 26:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 19:24">Isa 19:24</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 8:1">Zek 8:1</ref>, <ref loc="ZEC 8:3">3</ref>. </char></note> Ezo ntaama zangye n'emyanya eyehinguririize orushozi rwangye byona, ndyabihindura ebirikuhaisa omugisha, ngwise enjura omu bunaku bwayo, ebe enjura y'omugisha. <verse eid="EZK 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 34:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 36:30">Ezk 36:30</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 85:12">Zab 85:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 30:8">Yer 30:8</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ebiti by'omu ishwa biryayera ebijuma byabyo, n'eitaka ryeze emyaka yaaryo; zigume omu nsi yaazo ziri buhooro; kandi ku ndihenda omugamba gw'obuhuuku bwazo, naazijuna ninziiha omu mikono y'abarikuzigira abahuuku, obwo nibwo zirimanya ku ndi MUKAMA. <verse eid="EZK 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 34:28" />Tizirigaruka kuba minyago y'amahanga, nari kuriibwa enyamaishwa z'omu ihamba; kureka ziryaguma ziri buhooro, kandi tihaine orizitiinisa. <verse eid="EZK 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 34:29" />Ndyazimereza obunyaatsi oburikutangaaza, zirekye kugaruka kwitirwa enjara omuri egyo nsi, n'obu kwakuba okujumwa abanyamahanga. <verse eid="EZK 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 34:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:30, 31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 100:3">Zab 100:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ziryamanya ku nyowe Mukama RUHANGA waazo ya Israeli, ku nibo bantu bangye; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba. <verse eid="EZK 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 34:31" />Naimwe muri entaama zangye, entaama z'omu iriisizo ryangye, naanye ndi Ruhanga waanyu; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 34:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="EZK 35" />
  <para style="s1">Orubanja rwa Seiri ahabw'okwanga Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 35:1" />Kandi ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 35:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 25:12">Ezk 25:12</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, ta amaisho gaawe aha rushozi Seire, oruhanuurire ebirirubaho, <verse eid="EZK 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 35:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 33:28">Ezk 33:28</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:17">Yer 49:17</ref>. </char></note> noogira oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Iwe orushozi Seiri, reeba, naaba omuzigu waawe, kandi naaza kukubangira omukono, nkuhindure amatongo, obe eihamba. <verse eid="EZK 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 35:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:11">Isa 6:11</ref>. </char></note> Endembo zaawe ndyazihindura amahamba, iwe ohindukye amatongo, omanye ku ndi MUKAMA. <verse eid="EZK 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 35:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 21:25">Ezk 21:25</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 137:7">Zab 137:7</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:11">Amo 1:11</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okugira enzigu etarihwa, okahayo Abaisraeli kwitwa rurara omu biro by'enaku zaabo, n'omu bunaku bw'okufubirwa kwabo kw'aha muheru, <verse eid="EZK 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 35:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 109:17">Zab 109:17</ref>. </char></note> n'ahabw'ekyo niinyerahira, nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira, ndyakuteekateekyera okujwisibwa eshagama, kandi eryakuhiiga ahabw'okusingwa orubanja rw'eshagama, nikyo erikuhiigira. <verse eid="EZK 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 35:7" />Ndyahindura orushozi Seiri eihamba, rube amatongo, ndumaremu boona abarikurwijamu n'abarikururugamu. <verse eid="EZK 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 35:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 31:12">Ezk 31:12</ref>. </char></note> Orushozi rwawe ndyarwijuza emitumbi, abarikwitwa rurara bagwe omu bubungo byawe n'omu mpanga zaawe n'omu binonko byawe byona. <verse eid="EZK 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 35:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 1:3">Mal 1:3</ref>, <ref loc="MAL 1:4">4</ref>. </char></note> Ndyakuhindura amatongo g'ebiro byona, n'endembo zaawe tizirituurwamu. Haza obwo nibwo orimanya ku ndi MUKAMA.<verse eid="EZK 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 35:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 36:2">Ezk 36:2</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 36:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:22">37:22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 48:35">48:35</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okugira oti: Amahanga ago gombi n'ensi ezo zombi biryaba ebyangye, tubikubuure (n'obu MUKAMA araabe yaabaire atwireyo); <verse eid="EZK 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 35:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 35:15">Ezk 35:15</ref>. </char></note> nikyo nyowe MUKAMA ndikwerahirira ningira nti: Ndyakutwaza nk'ekiniga n'eihari ebi waayorekire oku biri, ninkutura rwango ei waabagiriire, kandi ndyayemanyisa omuriimwe omu bunaku obu ndibacwereramu emanja. <verse eid="EZK 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 35:12" />Ekirirugamu oryamanya ku nyowe MUKAMA naahuriire ebijumo byawe byona, ebi waajumire ebibungo bya Israeli noogira oti: Bihindwirwe amatongo, byatuheebwa kubirya. <verse eid="EZK 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 35:13" />Kandi mukanyekuzaho, orurimi rwanyu rwankanyisaho ebigambo, naabihurira. <verse eid="EZK 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 35:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:13">Isa 65:13</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 65:14">14</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Ndyakuhindura amatongo, ensi yoona ebone kwesiima. <verse eid="EZK 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 35:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 36:5">Ezk 36:5</ref>. </char></note> Nk'oku waayesiimire ahabw'obuhunguzi bw'enju ya Israeli kuba amatongo, naiwe nikwo ndikugira, okaba amatongo. Iwe rushozi Seiri na Edomu yoona ahu erikugarukira, muryaba amatongo. Haza obwo nibwo barimanya ku ndi MUKAMA.<verse eid="EZK 35:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="EZK 36" />
  <para style="s1">Mukama okuragaanisa abantu be omutima musya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 36:1" />Mbwenu, Mwana w'omuntu, hanuurira ebibungo bya Israeli noobigira oti: Imwe bibungo bya Israeli 'mwe, nimuhurire ekigambo kya MUKAMA. <verse eid="EZK 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 36:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 35:10">Ezk 35:10</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamaba naagira ati: Ahabw'omuzigu kukugambaho ati: Otyo, nikyo kihena! Kandi ati: Ebibungo byabo bya ira tubikubwire, byaba ebyaitu; <verse eid="EZK 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 36:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 2:15">Tonz 2:15</ref>, <ref loc="LAM 2:16">16</ref>. </char></note> n'ahabw'ekyo hanuura noogira oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Ahakuba, eego, ahakuba bakuhindwire amatongo, baakusingyera nibakuturuka embaju zoona, mwahinduka ensi erikukubuurwa agandi mahanga agaatsigaireho, mwaba ekigaaniiro ky'okugambwaho kubi abantu, <verse eid="EZK 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 36:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 6:3">Ezk 6:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 79:4">Zab 79:4</ref>. </char></note> n'ahabw'ekyo, imwe bibungo bya Israeli 'mwe, muhurire ekigambo kya Mukama RUHANGA. Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira enshozi, ebibungo, ebinonko n'empanga, amatongo n'amahamba, n'endembo ezihwiremu abantu, zikahinduka eminyago n'eky'okushekyererwa amahanga agatsigaireho agabyehinguririize, naagira ati: <verse eid="EZK 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 36:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 25:6">Ezk 25:6</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 35:10">35:10</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 35:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:24">Bir 4:24</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo Mukama RUHANGA arikugirira ati: Ngambire n'eihato eririkwaka nk'omuriro, nimpana amahanga agatsigaireho na Edomu yoona, abeehaire ensi yangye kuba eyaabo, baine okwesiima kwingi munonga omu mitima, n'okugaya kwingi, ahabw'okugikubuura n'okuginyaga. <verse eid="EZK 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 36:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 32:24">Ezk 32:24</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:29">34:29</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo ohanuure ebiriba aha nsi ya Israeli, ogambire enshozi, ebibungo, ebinonko, n'empanga oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, ningambisa ekiniga n'eihato, ningira nti: Ahabw'okwemera kuhemurwa amahanga, <verse eid="EZK 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 36:7" />nikyo ndikwerahirira nti: Buzimazima amahanga agabeehinguririize nago garyahemurwa; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 36:8" />Kwonka mwe bibungo bya Israeli 'mwe, muryatooka amataagi, mwanire abantu bangye Israeli ebijuma, ahabw'okuba bari haihi kugaruka. <verse eid="EZK 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 36:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">Hos 2:23</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba reeba, ndi aha rubaju rwanyu, niinyija kubagarukira, mubone kuhingwa n'okubibwamu. <verse eid="EZK 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 36:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:4">Isa 61:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 30:19">Yer 30:19</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 9:14">Amo 9:14</ref>. </char></note> Ndyabakanyisamu abantu, ab'enju ya Israeli yoona; endembo ziryatuurwamu, n'amatongo gagarukye gombekwemu; <verse eid="EZK 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 36:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:55">Ezk 16:55</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:27">Yer 31:27</ref>. </char></note> ndyabakanyisamu abantu n'amatungo, nabyo bizaare, bikanye; kandi ndyabareetera kutuurwamu nk'omu biro byanyu ebya ira, mbagire gye okukira oku naabagizire omu kubanza. Haza obwo nibwo murimanya ku ndi MUKAMA. <verse eid="EZK 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 36:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:7">Yer 15:7</ref>; <ref loc="OBA 1:17">Oba 17</ref>. </char></note> Buzimazima ndyareka abantu bangye Abaisraeli babagyendagyendeho; baryabakubuura, mube obuhunguzi bwabo, kandi timurigaruka kubaitira baana obundi. <verse eid="EZK 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 36:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:17">Ezk 5:17</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 13:32">Kub 13:32</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Ahabw'abantu kubagira ngu, muri ebibungo ebirikwita abantu, kandi eihanga ryanyu mukarimaramu abaana, <verse eid="EZK 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 36:14" />nikyo mutarigarukira kwita bantu bundi, omu ihanga ryanyu; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira. <verse eid="EZK 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 36:15" />Kandi tindikwenda ku mugaruka kuhurira okujuma oku abanyamahanga barikubajuma, n'obu kwakuba okwemera okuhemura kwabo; n'eihanga ryanyu timurigaruka kuriteeza ntsibo; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 36:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 36:16" />Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyagaruka kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 36:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 15:19">Lev 15:19</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 18:25">18:25</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, obu ab'enju ya Israeli baabaire batwire omu nsi yaabo y'obuzaarwa bakagisiisisa emitwarize yaabo ekansusira nk'okutashemera kw'omukazi ori omu kwezi. <verse eid="EZK 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 36:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 22:3">Ezk 22:3</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo naabashukiireho ekiniga kyangye, nimbatura eshagama ei baaseesire omu nsi, kandi n'ebishushani byabo ebirikuramibwa ebi baagisiisiise. <verse eid="EZK 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 36:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:30">Ezk 18:30</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 22:15">22:15</ref>. </char></note> Ntyo naabataataanisiza omu mahanga, baanaganagwa omu nsi zaago, naabacwera orubanja orushemereire emitwarize yaabo n'ebi barikukora. <verse eid="EZK 36:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 36:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:5">Isa 52:5</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:24">Rom 2:24</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ku baahikire omuri ago mahanga ei baabaire baza yoona, baashiisha eiziina ryangye eririkwera; ahabw'okuba abantu bakabagambaho bati: Aba n'abantu ba MUKAMA; kwonka bakabingwa omu nsi ye. <verse eid="EZK 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 36:21" />Kwonka naasaasibwa eiziina ryangye eririkwera, eri enju ya Israeli yaajumiise omu mahanga agu baagiiremu.<verse eid="EZK 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 36:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 9:5">Bir 9:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:8">Zab 106:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu gambira enju ya Israeli oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Imwe nju ya Israeli 'mwe, niinyija kukora, kwonka ti habwanyu kureka ahabw'eiziina ryangye eririkwera, eri mwajumiise omu mahanga agu mwagiiremu. <verse eid="EZK 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 36:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:41">Ezk 20:41</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 38:23">38:23</ref>. </char></note> Ndyahimbisisa eiziina ryangye erikuru eryajumisiibwe omu mahanga, kandi eri mwagajumiisemu, gaikirize ku riri eririkwera; bwanyima ku ndiheza kwehimbisisa omuriimwe omu maisho g'ago mahanga ku ndi Orikwera, garyamanya ku ndi MUKAMA; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira. <verse eid="EZK 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 36:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:13">Ezk 34:13</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba ndyabaiha omu mahanga, mbataaruure omu nsi zoona, mbagarure omu nsi yaanyu ey'obuzaarwa. <verse eid="EZK 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 36:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 37:23">Ezk 37:23</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 4:4">Isa 4:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:8">Yer 33:8</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:22">Heb 10:22</ref>. </char></note> Ndyabashukyeera amaizi maingi, mushemezibweho oburofa bwanyu bwona, mbamaremu ebishushani byanyu byona ebirikuramibwa, mushemere. <verse eid="EZK 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 36:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 11:19">Ezk 11:19</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 3:3">2 Kor 3:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ndyabaha omutima musya, mbatemu omwoyo musya; ndyabaihamu omutima gw'eibaare, mbatemu ogworobi. <verse eid="EZK 36:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 36:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 11:20">Ezk 11:20</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:14">37:14</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 37:24">24</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ndyata omwoyo gwangye omuriimwe, mbagyendeseze omu biragiro byangye, mubone kurinda ebi naataireho n'okubikora. <verse eid="EZK 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 36:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 28:25">Ezk 28:25</ref>; <ref loc="JER 30:22">Yer 30:22</ref>. </char></note> Kandi muryatuura omu nsi ei naahaire baashwenkuriimwe; muryaba abantu bangye, naanye mbe Ruhanga waanyu. <verse eid="EZK 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 36:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:29">Ezk 34:29</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:23">37:23</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:19">Yoel 2:19</ref>. </char></note> Ndyabaiha omu burofa bwanyu bwona; ndyabamereza engano, nzikanyise, kandi tindibaitsa njara. <verse eid="EZK 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 36:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:27">Ezk 34:27</ref>. </char></note> Ndyakanyisa ebijuma n'ebirikushaaruurwa omu misiri, murekye kugarukwaho ekijumo ky'enjara omu mahanga. <verse eid="EZK 36:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 36:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 6:9">Ezk 6:9</ref>. </char></note> Haza obwo nibwo muriijuka emitwarize yaanyu emibi, n'ebi mwabaire mukora ebitari birungi, mukeetamwa ahabw'okutahikiirira kwanyu n'ebihangaro byanyu. <verse eid="EZK 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 36:32" />Tindibikora habwanyu, nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira. Ekyo mukimanye. Imwe b'enju ya Israeli 'mwe, mugire enshoni, mubwerabwere ahabw'emitwarize yaanyu.<verse eid="EZK 36:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 36:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 36:10">Ezk 36:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Aha izooba eri ndibashemerezaho eby'okutahikiirira byanyu byona, ndyareetera endembo kutuurwamu abantu, n'amatongo kwombekwamu. <verse eid="EZK 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 36:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 36:9">Ezk 36:9</ref>. </char></note> Ensi eyaabaire eri eihamba eryahingwa, erekye kuba amatongo nk'oku yaabaire eri omu maisho g'abahinguzi boona. <verse eid="EZK 36:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 36:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 51:3">Isa 51:3</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima baryagira bati: Ensi egi ekaba eri amatongo, mbwenu ebaire nk'ekibanja kya Edeni; n'endembo ezaabaire zirugirwemu abantu zisheenyirwe, zihindukire amatongo, mbwenu zitwirwemu abantu, kandi zeehinguririziibwe engo z'amabaare. <verse eid="EZK 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 36:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 17:24">Ezk 17:24</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 126:2">Zab 126:2</ref>. </char></note> Obwo amahanga agariba gabeehinguririize garyamanya ku nyowe MUKAMA niinye nyombekire emyanya eyaabaire esheenyirwe, nkahinga ahaabaire hari endaara. Nyowe MUKAMA niinye naakigamba, kandi ndyakikora.<verse eid="EZK 36:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 36:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:37, 38: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 14:3">Ezk 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:31">34:31</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:10">36:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Kandi eki nakyo ndyaikiriza ab'enju ya Israeli kukinshaba ngu nkibakorere, nikwo kubakanyisiza abantu nk'obusyo. <verse eid="EZK 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 36:38" />Endembo ezaabaire zisheenyirwe ziryaijuramu obureetwa kutambirwa omuri Yerusaalemu aha magyenyi gaayo agatairweho. Haza obwo nibwo barimanya ku ndi MUKAMA.<verse eid="EZK 36:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="EZK 37" />
  <para style="s1">Oruhita rw'amagufa goomire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 37:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 1:3">Ezk 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 3:12">3:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omukono gwa MUKAMA gukaba guri ahariinye, yanshohoza ndi omu Myoyo wa MUKAMA, yantwara, yanta ahansi ahagati omu ruhita, kandi orwo ruhita rukaba rwijwire amagufa. <verse eid="EZK 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 37:2" />Yanyebembera, yaagyenda naagandabyamu; reeba, gakaba gari maingi munonga omuri orwo ruhita, kandi goomire, gakarangataine. <verse eid="EZK 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 37:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:39">Bir 32:39</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:35">1 Kor 15:35</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima yangira ati: Mwana w'omuntu, ebo aga magufa gakaabaasa kuba agahuriire? Naamugarukamu nti: Mukama RUHANGA, niiwe orikukimanya. <verse eid="EZK 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 37:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 6:2">Ezk 6:2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 5:28">Yoh 5:28</ref>. </char></note> Yaagaruka yangira ati: Hanuurira aga magufa, ogagire oti: Imwe magufa goomire 'mwe, muhurire ekigambo kya MUKAMA. <verse eid="EZK 37:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 37:5" />Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugambira aga magufa naagira ati: Reeba, naaza kubatamu omwitsyo, mube abahuriire. <verse eid="EZK 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 37:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 6:7">Ezk 6:7</ref>. </char></note> Naaza kubataho emitsi, mbagarureho enyama, mbashwekyeho oruhu, mbatemu omwitsyo, mube abahuriire; haza mumanye ku ndi MUKAMA.<verse eid="EZK 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 37:7" />Ntyo naahanuura nk'oku naaragiirwa; ku naabaire ninkihanuura, naahurira okukomangana, amagufa gaateerana, eigufa ryakwatana na ringyenzi ryaryo. <verse eid="EZK 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 37:8" />Ku naagiire kugira nti, naareeba gaagiibwaho emitsi n'enyama, byashwekwa oruhu, kwonka bitaabamu omwitsyo. <verse eid="EZK 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 37:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 33:4">Yob 33:4</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima yangira ati: Mwana w'omuntu, hanuurira omwitsyo, ogugire oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: iwe mwitsyo 'we, ruga omu mbaju ina ei emiyaga ereetwa, ohuuhe ahari egi mitumbi y'abaitsirwe, babe abahuriire. <verse eid="EZK 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 37:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:11">Kush 11:11</ref>. </char></note> Ntyo naahanuura nk'oku yandagiira, omwitsyo gwabazamu, baaba abahuriire, baayemerera eihe rihango munonga.<verse eid="EZK 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 37:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 33:10">Ezk 33:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:14">Isa 49:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima yangira ati: Mwana w'omuntu, aga magufa n'enju yoona eya Israeli. Reeba, nibagira bati: Amagufa gaitu goomire, titukiine matsiko; tubeereire kimwe encuubwa. <verse eid="EZK 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 37:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 36:24">Ezk 36:24</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 26:19">Isa 26:19</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 13:14">Hos 13:14</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo obahanuurire, obagire oti: Oku nikwo Mukama Ruhanga arikugamba naagira ati: Imwe bantu bangye 'mwe, reeba, ndyaigura ebituuro byanyu mbaihemu, mbagarure omu nsi ya Israeli. <verse eid="EZK 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 37:13" />Kandi ku ndiheza kwigura ebituuro byanyu, naabaihamu, muryamanya ku ndi MUKAMA, Bantu bangye 'mwe. <verse eid="EZK 37:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 37:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 36:27">Ezk 36:27</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 36:28">28</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ndyabatamu Omwoyo wangye, mube abahuriire, mbate omu nsi yaanyu y'obuzaarwa; haza obwo nibwo murimanya ku nyowe MUKAMA niinye naakigambire kandi nkakikora; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 37:15" />Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyagaruka kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 37:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 48:13">Kut 48:13</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 48:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 17:2">Kub 17:2</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 11:12-16">2 Bus 11:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 10:6">Zek 10:6</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, kwata enkoni, ogihandiikyeho oti: N'eya Yuda n'abaana ba Israeli bagyenzi be; bwanyima okwate endiijo nkoni, ogihandiikyeho oti: N'eya Yosefu (enkoni ya Efuraimu), n'ab'enju ya Israeli boona bagyenzi be; <verse eid="EZK 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 37:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:13">Isa 11:13</ref>. </char></note> bwanyima oziteerane zibe enkoni emwe omu ngaro zaawe. <verse eid="EZK 37:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 37:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 24:19">Ezk 24:19</ref>. </char></note> Kandi abantu baawe, ku baraakugire bati: Tokaatushoboororera amakuru g'ebyo? <verse eid="EZK 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 37:19" />Obagire oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, ndyatwara enkoni ya Yosefu eri omu ngaro za Efuraimu, n'enganda z'Abaisraeli bagyenzi be, ngiteerane n'eya Yuda, mbahindure enkoni emwe, babe bamwe omu ngaro zangye. <verse eid="EZK 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 37:20" />Ezo nkoni zi orikuhandiikaho, ku ziraabe ziri omu ngaro zaawe nibakureeba, <verse eid="EZK 37:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 37:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 36:24">Ezk 36:24</ref>. </char></note> obagire oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, ndyaiha Abaisraeli omu mahanga agu baagiiremu, mbataaruure nimbaiha embaju zoona, mbareete omu nsi yaabo y'obuzaarwa. <verse eid="EZK 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 37:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:24">Ezk 34:24</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 35:10">35:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 3:18">Yer 3:18</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 1:11">Hos 1:11</ref>. </char></note> Ndyabahindura eihanga rimwe omu nsi y'ebibungo bya Israeli; kandi omugabe omwe niwe aribategyeka boona; tibarigaruka kuba mahanga abiri, n'obu kwakuba okucuubwamu obugabe bubiri. <verse eid="EZK 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 37:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 14:11">Ezk 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:25">36:25</ref>. </char></note> Tibarigaruka kwesiisisa bishushani byabo ebirikuramibwa nari ebihagaro byabo nainga ebicumuro byabo byona; kureka ndyabajuna, mbatambire okugaruka enyima kwona, oku baacumuriiremu, mbashemeze; babe abantu bangye, naanye mbe Ruhanga waabo.<verse eid="EZK 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 37:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 34:23">Ezk 34:23</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:27">36:27</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:70">Zab 78:70</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 78:71">71</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:5">Yer 23:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi omwiru wangye Daudi aryaba omugabe waabo, boona baryagira omuriisa omwe, bagyendere omu biragiro banyagye, bate omutima aha bi naataireho, babikore. <verse eid="EZK 37:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 37:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 28:25">Ezk 28:25</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:24">34:24</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:21">Isa 60:21</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:20">Yoel 3:20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:34">Yoh 12:34</ref>. </char></note> Baryatuura omu nsi ei naahaire omwiru wangye Yakobo, ei baashwenkuriimwe baabaire batwiremu; okwo niyo bariguma, bo n'abaana baabo na baijukuru baabo ebiro byona; kandi omwiru wangye Daudi niwe ariba omugabe waabo ebiro byona. <verse eid="EZK 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 37:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:25">Ezk 34:25</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:10">36:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 43:7">43:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 55:3">Isa 55:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ndyaragaana nabo endagaano y'obusingye, ebe endagaano ei ndagaine nabo ey'ebiro byona; ndyabaha omugisha, mbakanyise nte Omwanya gwangye ogurikwera ahagati yaabo, gube ogw'obutwire bwona. <verse eid="EZK 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 37:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:11">Lev 26:11</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 6:16">2 Kor 6:16</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:3">Kush 21:3</ref>. </char></note> Obutaaho bwangye buryaba omuribo, mbe Ruhanga waabo nabo babe abantu bangye. <verse eid="EZK 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 37:28" />Omwanya gwangye ogurikwera ku guriguma ahagati yaabo ebiro byona, obwo nibwo amahanga garimanya ku nyowe MUKAMA niinye nyeza Israeli.<verse eid="EZK 37:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="EZK 38" />
  <para style="s1">Ezekieli okuhanuura aha bya Googi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 38:1" />Kandi ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="EZK 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 38:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 20:8">Kush 20:8</ref>. </char></note> Mwana w'omuntu, ta amaisho gaawe ahari Googi omu nsi ya Magoogi, omugabe wa Rooshi, Mesheki na Tubali, omuhanuurire ebirimubaho, <verse eid="EZK 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 38:3" />noogira oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Iwe Googi, omugabe wa Rooshi, Mesheki na Tubali, reeba, naaba omuzigu waawe; <verse eid="EZK 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 38:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 29:4">Ezk 29:4</ref>. </char></note> ndyakuhindura, nkute amarobo omu matama, nkureete n'eihe ryawe ryona, embaraasi n'abarikuzigyenderaho, boona bajwaire eby'okurwanisa ebihikire, omutwe muhango munonga, boona baine engabo enkye n'empango, bakwaitse zaarurara, <verse eid="EZK 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 38:5" />aba Peresi Kuushi na Puuti bari hamwe nabo, baine engabo n'enkofiira z'ebyoma; <verse eid="EZK 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 38:6" />Gomeri n'amahe ge goona, na Besi-togaruma owaarugire omu bicweka by'aha muheru gw'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, amahanga amaingi gari hamwe naiwe.<verse eid="EZK 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 38:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:9">Isa 8:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yeteekateekye, kandi ogume oyeteekateekire, iwe n'amahe goona agahurwire kandi agakwehinguririize, obe omurinzi waago. <verse eid="EZK 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 38:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:13">Ezk 34:13</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 34:28">28</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 24:22">Isa 24:22</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima y'ebiro bingi oryahuruzibwa; omu myaka ey'aha muheru oryahurura, oteere egyo nsi eyaabaire ecwekyereziibwe rurara, bwanyima ekagarurwa omu buteeka, ekatuurwamu abantu abataarwirwe omu mahanga maingi, bakaza omu bibungo bya Israeli ebyabaire biri amatongo; abo bantu bakaihwa omu mahanga, mbwenu batwire buhooro boona oku baingana. <verse eid="EZK 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 38:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:2">Isa 28:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 4:13">Yer 4:13</ref>. </char></note> Oryainamuka, oije ori nk'eihunga; oryaba nk'ekicu ekishwekire ensi, iwe n'amahe gaawe goona n'amahanga maingi agariba gari hamwe naiwe.<verse eid="EZK 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 38:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 11:5">Ezk 11:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Eryo izooba oryaizirwa ebiteekateeko, ogire enaama mbi, <verse eid="EZK 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 38:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:31">Yer 49:31</ref>. </char></note> ogire oti: Naaza kwinamuka, nteere ensi y'ebirorero ebitaine ngo z'amabaare, ngwe aha bantu abagaramisiriize, abatwire buhooro, boona batwire ahataine ngo z'amabaare, n'obu gaakuba amarembo againe enyigi ezirikukingwa empimbi, <verse eid="EZK 38:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 38:12" />kunyaga eminyago n'okugitwara, okuteera emyanya eyaabaire eri amatongo, mbwenu etwirwemu, n'okuteera abantu abaataarwirwe omu mahanga bakeetungira ente n'ebintu, bakatuura ahagati y'ensi. <verse eid="EZK 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 38:13" />Aba Sheeba na Dedani n'abashuubuzi ba Tarushiishi n'ebirorero byabyo byona baryakubuuza nibagira bati: Beitu oizire kunyaga? Ohurwize engabo zaawe kwija kunyaga, kutwara efeeza n'ezaabu, amatungo n'ebintu, kukukumbura eminyago mingi?<verse eid="EZK 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 38:14" />N'ahabw'ekyo, Mwana w'omuntu, hanuurira Googi, noomugira oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Eryo izooba abantu bangye Abaisraeli ku bariba batwire buhooro, oryayehuruza, <verse eid="EZK 38:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 38:15" />orugye omu mwanya gwawe gw'omu bicweka by'aha muheru gw'obukiizi-bwa-bumosho, iwe n'amahanga maingi agari hamwe naiwe, boona bari aha mbaraasi, eihe rihango kandi ry'amaani, <verse eid="EZK 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 38:16" />oteere abantu bangye Israeli, ori nk'ekicu ekishwekire ensi. Omu biro by'aha muheru ndyakuteeza ensi yangye, amahanga gabone kummanya, ku ndiba naakweyorekyeiremu, ku ndi Orikwera, iwe Googi.<verse eid="EZK 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 38:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 6:22">Yer 6:22</ref>, <ref loc="JER 6:23">23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Niiwe ou naagambireho ira nindaba omu bairu bangye baanabi ba Israeli, abaamazire emyaka mingi nibahanuura omu bunaku obwo, ku niiwe ndyohereza kubateera? <verse eid="EZK 38:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 38:18" />Kwonka eryo izooba eri Googi ariteereraho ensi ya Israeli, ekiniga kyangye kiryaimuka; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira. <verse eid="EZK 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 38:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:13">Ezk 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="HAG 2:6">Hag 2:6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:18">Kush 16:18</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba ningambisa eihato n'ekiniga ekirikubuguma, ningira nti: Buzimazima eryo izooba haryabaho okutengatenga kw'amaani omu nsi ya Israeli, <verse eid="EZK 38:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 38:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:24">Yer 4:24</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 4:3">Hos 4:3</ref>. </char></note> okurireetera eby'enyanja, amahungu g'omu mwanya, enyamaishwa z'omu ishwa, ebirikwekurura ahansi byona n'abantu ab'omu nsi boona, kutetemera omu maisho gangye, enshozi zikakumbagazibwa, ebibaare bikahiguka, n'engo z'amabaare zoona zikakumbagara ahansi. <verse eid="EZK 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 38:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 7:22">Bar 7:22</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:29">Yer 25:29</ref>. </char></note> Ndyayeta ebirikutiinisa eby'emiringo yoona kurwanisa Googi, buri muntu aitise mugyenzi we rurara; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira. <verse eid="EZK 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 38:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 13:11">Ezk 13:11</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 14:19">14:19</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 17:20">17:20</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 11:6">Zab 11:6</ref>. </char></note> Ndyamucwera orubanja, mmuteho ekifubiro ky'oruru n'eky'okusheesha eshagama ye; kandi we n'amahe ge n'amahanga maingi, agu ariba aine, ndyabateeza omutsindansi gw'enjura, n'emengo z'orubaare, n'omuriro, n'obuganga bw'ekibiriiti; <verse eid="EZK 38:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 38:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 36:23">Ezk 36:23</ref>. </char></note> ntyo nyorekye obukuru bwangye n'okwera kwangye, kandi nyemanyise omu maisho g'amahanga maingi. Haza obwo nibwo barimanya ku ndi MUKAMA.<verse eid="EZK 38:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="EZK 39" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 39:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">39:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 38:2">Ezk 38:2</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 38:3">3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi iwe, Mwana w'omuntu, hanuurira Googi ebirimubaho, noogira oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Iwe Googi omugabe wa Rooshi, Mesheki na Tubali, reeba, naaba omuzigu waawe; <verse eid="EZK 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 39:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 38:4">Ezk 38:4</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 38:6">6</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 38:15">15</ref>. </char></note> ndyakuhindura, nkwebembeze, nkwihe omu bicweka by'aha muheru gw'obukiizi-bwa-bumosho, nkwinamure, nkuhitsye omu bibungo bya Israeli; <verse eid="EZK 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 39:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 76:3">Zab 76:3</ref>. </char></note> ku orihikayo, ndyateera obuta bwawe oburi omu mukono gwawe gwa bumosho, mbukunagise, n'emyambi yaawe eri omu mukono gwawe gwa buryo ngigwise ahansi. <verse eid="EZK 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 39:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:4, 5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 32:4">Ezk 32:4</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 38:21">38:21</ref>. </char></note> Oryagwa aha bibungo bya Israeli, iwe n'amahe gaawe n'amahanga agu oriba oine, nkugaburire amahungu g'emiringo yoona n'enyamaishwa mbi, bikugaashe, <verse eid="EZK 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 39:5" />ogwe omu bwerere; ahabw'okuba niinye naakigamba; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira. <verse eid="EZK 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 39:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 38:2">Ezk 38:2</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:4">Amo 1:4</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ndyayohereza omuriro, gwotsye Magoogi n'abantu abatwire buhooro omu birwa, bamanye ku ndi MUKAMA.<verse eid="EZK 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 39:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">39:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 20:39">Ezk 20:39</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:23">36:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima ndyamanyisa eiziina ryangye eririkwera omu bantu bangye Israeli; tindireka iziina ryangye kugaruka kujumwa; kandi amahanga garyamanya ku ndi MUKAMA Orikwera omuri Israeli. <verse eid="EZK 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 39:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 21:7">Ezk 21:7</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, nibiija, kandi biryabaho; eryo niryo izooba eri naagambire; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 39:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">39:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 46:9">Zab 46:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwo abariba batwire omu ndembo za Israeli baryashohora, bahembe eby'okurwanisa, bisye, engabo enkye n'empango, amata n'emyambi, ebikoni n'amacumu, bamare emyaka mushanju nibabyotsya; <verse eid="EZK 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 39:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 33:1">Isa 33:1</ref>. </char></note> tibaryetenga kusheenya omu ishwa, n'obu kwakuba okukonda ebiti omu kibira; ahabw'okuba baryahemba eby'okurwanisa byabo; baryatwara ebintu by'abaatwaire ebyabo, banyagye abaabanyagire; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'okuziika Googi n'engabo ze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 39:11" />Eryo izooba ndyaha Googi ah'okuziikwa omuri Israeli, omu ruhita rw'abahinguzi aha bukiizi bw'enyanja bw'oburugwa-izooba; okwo niyo bariziika Googi n'enyanja y'abantu be boona, omuhanda gw'abagyenzi gukafa; kandi haryayetwa Oruhita rwa Hamoni-googi. <verse eid="EZK 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 39:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:23">Bir 21:23</ref>. </char></note> Ab'enju ya Israeli baryamara ameezi mushanju nibabaziika, babone kushemeza ensi. <verse eid="EZK 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 39:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 28:22">Ezk 28:22</ref>. </char></note> Abantu boona ab'omuri egyo nsi baryabaziika; kandi aha izooba eri ndihimbisizibwaho, kiryabahaisa ekitiinisa; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira. <verse eid="EZK 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 39:14" />Bwanyima baryatoorana abantu b'okuguma nibaraba omu nsi nibaziika emitumbi eriba etsigaire omu nsi, ngu ensi eshemere; ago meezi mushanju ku garihwaho baryasherura. <verse eid="EZK 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 39:15" />Abo basheruzi ku bariraba omu nsi, omwe omuribo yaagwa aha igufa ry'omuntu, aryarita akamanyiso aha rubaju, okuhitsya obu abaziiki baririziika omu ruhanga rwa Hamoni-googi. <verse eid="EZK 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 39:16" />(Kandi aho niho hariba orurembo orurikwetwa Hamona). Okwo nikwo barishemeza egyo nsi.<verse eid="EZK 39:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 39:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">39:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 39:4">Ezk 39:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 12:9">Yer 12:9</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 1:7">Zef 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:17">Kush 19:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu iwe, Mwana w'omuntu, oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Gambira amahungu g'emiringo yoona n'enyamaishwa zoona ez'omu ishwa oti: Muteerane, murugye embaju zoona, mwije aha bugyenyi bw'ebitambo obu ndikubatebeekanisiza, obugyenyi bukuru bw'ebitambo aha bibungo bya Israeli, murye enyama kandi munywe eshagama. <verse eid="EZK 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 39:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:18, 20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 19:18">Kush 19:18</ref>. </char></note> Nimwija kurya enyama z'amamanzi, munywe eshagama y'abagabe b'omu nsi; murye enyama z'empaya z'entaama, ez'abaana baazo, ez'embuzi, n'ez'enimi zoona ez'ebishaju eza Bashani; <verse eid="EZK 39:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 39:19" />nimwija kurya ebishaju, okuhitsya obu muraigute, munywe eshagama okuhitsya obu muraasinde aha bugyenyi bw'ebitambo, obu ndikubatebeekanisiza. <verse eid="EZK 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 39:20" />Kandi nimwija kwigutira aha meeza yangye embaraasi n'abarikuzigyenderaho hamwe n'amamanzi n'abarwani b'emiringo yoona; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 39:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 39:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">39:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 36:23">Ezk 36:23</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 7:4">Kur 7:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima ndyata ekitiinisa kyangye ahagati y'amahanga, amahanga goona gareebe ekifubiro eki mbahaire, ekirugire omu rubanja oru ncwire, gareebe n'omukono gwangye ogu mbabangiire. <verse eid="EZK 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 39:22" />Batyo ab'enju ya Israeli baryamanya ku ndi MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo, okutandikira ahari eryo izooba n'okugumizamu. <verse eid="EZK 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 39:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:25">Lev 26:25</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 29:24-28">Bir 29:24-28</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 31:17">31:17</ref>. </char></note> Kandi amahanga garyamanya ku ab'enju ya Israeli baatwairwe bari enkwatwa nibaturwa eby'okushiisha byabo, ahabw'okuba bakancumuraho, kyandeetera kubaihaho amaisho, n'okubahayo omu mikono y'abazigu baabo; boona baitwa rurara. <verse eid="EZK 39:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 39:24" />Nkabatwaza nk'okutahikiirira kwabo n'ebicumuro byabo oku byabaire biri, naabaima amaisho.<verse eid="EZK 39:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'okugarurwa kw'Abaisraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 39:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">39:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 20:9">Ezk 20:9</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 20:40">40</ref>; <ref loc="JER 30:3">Yer 30:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo Mukama RUHANGA arikugirira ati: Mbwenu niinyija kugarura aba Yakobo abaatwairwe bari enkwatwa, ngirire embabazi enju ya Israeli yoona ahabw'okusaasibwa eiziina ryangye eririkwera. <verse eid="EZK 39:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 39:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:28">Ezk 34:28</ref>. </char></note> Ku bariba batwire buhooro bataine orikubatiinisa, baryayebwa enshoni zaabo ahabw'ebicumuro byona ebi bancumwireho. <verse eid="EZK 39:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 39:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:27, 28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:41">Ezk 20:41</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 28:25">28:25</ref>. </char></note> Ku ndi heza kubaiha omu mahanga, naabagarura, naabataaruura omu nsi z'abazigu baabo, naayorekyera okwera kwangye omuribo omu maisho g'amahanga, <verse eid="EZK 39:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 39:28" />obwo nibwo barimanya ku ndi MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo, ahabw'okuba nkabareetera kutwarwa omu mahanga bari enkwatwa, bwanyima naabataaruura, naabagarura omu nsi yaabo ey'obuzaarwa. Tindigira n'omwe ou naatsiga omu mahanga obundi; <verse eid="EZK 39:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 39:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:8">Isa 54:8</ref>. </char></note> Kandi, ku ndishuka Omwoyo wangye aha nju ya Israeli, tindigaruka kubaima maisho bundi; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 39:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="EZK 40" />
  <para style="s1">Ezekieli okworekwa ebya hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 40:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 1:3">Ezk 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 33:21">33:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku twabaire tumazire emyaka makumi abiri n'etaano omu bukwatwa, aha kutandika kw'omwaka, aha kiro kya ikumi ky'okwezi kw'okubanza, orurembo rumazire emyaka ikumi n'ena rukwatsirwe, ahari eryo izooba omukono gwa MUKAMA gukampikaho, <verse eid="EZK 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 40:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 8:3">Ezk 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:10">Kush 21:10</ref>. </char></note> gwantwarira omu kworekwa omu nsi ya Israeli, gwanta aha kibungo kiraingwa munonga, ekyabaire kiriho ekintu ekirikushusha orurembo kishungaine naanye. <verse eid="EZK 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 40:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:7">Ezk 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 2:1">Zek 2:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:1">Kush 11:1</ref>. </char></note> Ku yampikizeyo, reeba, hakaba hariyo omuntu orikushusha omuringa, aine omurunga gwa furakisi omu ngaro n'ekibingo ky'okugyeresa, ayemereire omu irembo. <verse eid="EZK 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 40:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 43:10">Ezk 43:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 44:5">44:5</ref>. </char></note> Ogwo mushaija yangira ati: Mwana w'omuntu, ta amaisho aha bi naaza kukworeka, obitegye amatu, kandi obiteho omutima, ahabw'okuba ekikureetsire aha n'okubikworeka; ebi oraareebe byona, obigambire enju ya Israeli.<verse eid="EZK 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 40:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 41:8">Ezk 41:8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 42:20">42:20</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 43:13">43:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, hakaba hariho orugo orwehinguririize ekibuga kya hekalu, kandi oburaingwa bw'ekyo kibingo ky'okugyeresa ekyabaire kiri omu ngaro z'ogwo mushaija bukaba buri mikono mukaaga emiraingwa, buri mukono gwine oburaingwa bwa mukono gumwe n'ekita; atyo yaagyera omuzimba gw'orugo, gwaingana ekibingo kimwe, kandi obwemi bwarwo bwaba ekibingo kimwe. <verse eid="EZK 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 40:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 10:19">Ezk 10:19</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 40:22">40:22</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima yaahika aha irembo eririkureeba oburugwa-izooba; ku yaatembire aha matembero gaaryo, yaagyera ekisasi kyaryo eky'aheeru, haaba ekibingo kimwe; <verse eid="EZK 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 40:7" />buri kishengye eky'aha mbaju kyaba ekibingo kimwe oburaingwa kandi ekibingo kimwe obukiika; ahagati y'ebyo bishengye haabaho omwanya gwa mikono etaano; ekisasi ky'eirembo eky'omunda haihi naryo aharikureebana n'enju, naho haaba ekibingo kimwe. <verse eid="EZK 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 40:8" />Bwanyima yaagyera ekisasi eky'omunda kyaba mikono munaana. <verse eid="EZK 40:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 40:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 41:3">Ezk 41:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi yaagyera ebiti by'eirembo, byaba mikono ebiri; ekyo kisasi ky'eirembo kikaba kishungaine n'enju. <verse eid="EZK 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 40:10" />Kandi aha rubaju rw'eirembo ry'oburugwa-izooba hakaba hariho ebishengye bishatu ahari buri rubaju; byona biri orugyero rumwe, n'ebiti by'eirembo ahari buri rubaju nabyo biri orugyero rumwe. <verse eid="EZK 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 40:11" />Okuruga aho yaagyera obuhango bw'eirembo, bwaba mikono ikimi, n'obukiika bwaryo bwaba mikono ikumi n'eshatu. <verse eid="EZK 40:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 40:12" />Omu maisho g'ebishengye by'aha mbaju haabamu omwanya gwa mukono gumwe ahari buri rubaju, kandi ebyo bishengye by'ahari buri rubaju bikaba biri mikono mukaaga. <verse eid="EZK 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 40:13" />Bwanyima yaagyera eirembo, naiha enyima y'ekishengye kimwe okuhitsya enyima y'ekindi; obukiika obwo bwaba mikono makumi abiri n'etaano, okuruga aha rwigi okuhika aha rundi. <verse eid="EZK 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 40:14" />Yaagyera n'omu kisasi, haaba mikono makumi abiri; okwehinguririza ekyo kisasi ky'eirembo kyaba ekibuga. <verse eid="EZK 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 40:15" />Okuruga omu maisho g'eirembo okuhika ah'orikutaahira nooza omu kisasi ky'omunda aha muheru gwakyo haaba mikono makumi ataano. <verse eid="EZK 40:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 40:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:4">1 Bag 6:4</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ebishengye by'eirembo bikaba biine amadirisa okubyehinguririza, gafunzire omunda aharikureeba ebiti byago omu bishengye by'omunda; kandi n'ekisasi kikaba kiine amadirisa omunda okukyehinguririza; ebiti by'ago madirisa bikaba biriho emikindo.<verse eid="EZK 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 40:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 42:1">Ezk 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:2">Kush 11:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima yantwara omu kibuga ky'enyima; reeba, hakaba hariyo ebishengye n'ekicweka ekyariirwe amabaare okwehinguririza ekibuga; omu maisho g'ekyo kicweka kyariirwe amabaare harimu ebishengye makumi ashatu. <verse eid="EZK 40:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 40:18" />Omwanya ogwo ogwariirwe gukaba gugyenzire aha rubaju rw'amarembo, nigwingana nago omu buraingwa; ekyo nikyo kyabaire kiri ekicweka kyariire ekya ifo. <verse eid="EZK 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 40:19" />Yaagaruka yaagyera naiha omu kicweka ky'omunda eky'omu maisho g'eirembo rya ifo okuhika aha rubaju rw'aheeru orw'ekibuga ky'omunda, kyaba mikono igana.<verse eid="EZK 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 40:20" />Bwanyima yaanyebembera, naatoora aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, reeba hakaba hariyo eirembo eryabaire nirireebayo ery'ekibuga ky'enyima; yaagyera oburaingwa bwakyo n'obukiika bwakyo. <verse eid="EZK 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 40:21" />Ebishengye byaryo eby'aha rubaju, bishatu aha rubaju rumwe, na bishatu aha rundi, ebiti byaryo, n'ekisasi kyaryo, byona bikaba biri orugyero rumwe n'eby'eirembo ery'okubanza; oburaingwa bwaryo bukaba buri mikono makumi ataano, n'obukiika bwaryo buri mikono makumi abiri n'etaano. <verse eid="EZK 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 40:22" />Amadirisa gaaryo, ekisasi kyaryo, n'ebiti byaryo by'enkindo bikaba biri eby'orugyero rumwe n'eirembo eririkureeba oburugwa-izooba; kandi amatembero agaabaire nigarihikaho gakaba gari mushanju, n'ekisasi kyaryo kikaba kiri omunda. <verse eid="EZK 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 40:23" />Ahashungaine n'eirembo ery'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho hakaba hariho eirembo eririkutaaha omu kibuga ky'omunda, nk'oku kiri aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba. Yaagyera okuruga aha irembo okuhika aha rindi, haaba mikono igana.<verse eid="EZK 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 40:24" />Bwanyima yaanyebembera yantwara nantooza aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo; reeba, n'ahari orwo rubaju hakaba hariho eirembo; yaagyera ebiti byaryo n'ekisasi kyaryo; byaba eby'orugyero rumwe n'ebindi. <verse eid="EZK 40:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 40:25" />Omunda yaaryo n'omu kisasi kyaryo hakaba heehinguririziibwe amadirisa agarikwingana n'ag'omu gandi marembo; oburaingwa bwaryo buri mikono makumi ataano, n'obukiika bwaryo mikono makumi abiri n'etaano. <verse eid="EZK 40:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 40:26" />Kandi amatembero agaabire nigarihikaho gakaba gari mushanju, n'ekisasi kyaryo kiri omunda; kandi ebiti byaryo bikaba biriho emikindo, gumwe aha rubaju rumwe, n'ogundi aha rundi. <verse eid="EZK 40:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 40:27" />Kandi aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo obw'ekibuga eky'omunda hakaba hariho eirembo; yaagyera okuruga aha irembo okuhika aha rindi ery'aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo, haaba mikono igana.<verse eid="EZK 40:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 40:28" />Bwanyima yandyabya omu irembo ry'aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo, yantaasya omuri ekyo kibuga ky'omunda, yaagyera eryo irembo, ryaba ery'orugyero rumwe n'agandi. <verse eid="EZK 40:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 40:29" />Ebishengye by'aha mbaju zaaryo, n'ebiti byaryo, n'ekisasi kyaryo, bikaba biri eby'orugyero rumwe n'ebindi; kandi omuri eryo irembo n'omu kisasi kyaryo hakaba harimu amadirisa agarikwingana n'agandi okwehinguririza; oburaingwa bwaryo bwaba mikono makumi ataano, n'obukiika bwaryo mikono makumi abiri n'etaano. <verse eid="EZK 40:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 40:30" />Kandi hakaba hariho ebisasi okwehinguririza, oburaingwa bwabyo buri mikono makumi abiri n'etaano, n'obukiika bwabyo mikono etaano. <verse eid="EZK 40:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 40:31" />Ekisasi kyaryo kikaba nikireeba ekibuga ky'aheeru, n'amatembero agarikurihikaho gari munaana.<verse eid="EZK 40:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 40:32" />Yaagaruka yantaasya omu kibuga ky'omunda aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba, yaagyera eirembo ry'aho, ryaba ery'orugyero rumwe n'agandi. <verse eid="EZK 40:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 40:33" />Ebishengye byaryo eby'omu mbaju, ebiti byaryo, n'ekisasi kyaryo, byaba eby'orugyero rumwe n'ebindi; omuri eryo irembo n'omu kisasi kyaryo hakiikizemu amadirisa; oburaingwa bwaryo buri mikono makumi ataano, n'obukiika bwaryo mikono makumi abiri n'etaano. <verse eid="EZK 40:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 40:34" />Ekisasi kyaryo kikaba nikireeba ekibuga ky'aheeru, ebiti byaryo biriho emikindo, gumwe aha rubaju rumwe n'ogundi aha rundi; n'amatembero agarikurihikaho gari munaana.<verse eid="EZK 40:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 40:35" />Bwanyima yantwara aha irembo ery'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, yaarigyera; ryaba ery'orugyero rumwe n'agandi; <verse eid="EZK 40:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 40:36" />ebishengye byaryo eby'omu mbaju n'ebiti byaryo, n'ekisasi kyaryo, byaba eby'orugyero rumwe n'ebindi; rikiikiiziibwemu amadirisa; oburaingwa bwaryo buri mikono makumi ataano, n'obukiika bwaryo mikono makumi abiri n'etaano. <verse eid="EZK 40:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 40:37" />Ekisasi kyaryo kikaba nikireeba ekibuga ky'aheeru; ebiti byaryo bikaba biriho emikindo, gumwe aha rubaju rumwe n'ogundi aha rundi; n'amatembero agarikurihikaho gari munaana.<verse eid="EZK 40:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 40:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:38: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 1:9">Lev 1:9</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 4:6">2 Bus 4:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hakaba hariho ekishengye, eki omuryango gwakyo gwabaire nigureeba omu kisasi ky'eirembo, omu baabaire boogyeza ekitambo ky'okwotsya; <verse eid="EZK 40:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 40:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 1:3-5">Lev 1:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 4:2-4">4:2-4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 5:1-6">5:1-6</ref>. </char></note> kandi omuri ekyo kisasi ky'eirembo hakaba harimu emeeza ibiri aha rubaju rumwe n'ezindi ebiri aha rundi rubaju, ez'okwitiraho ebitambo by'okwotsya, empongano y'ekibi, n'ey'okwihaho orubanja rw'ekibi. <verse eid="EZK 40:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 40:40" />Kandi aheeru y'ekisasi y'ah'orikutaahira nooza omu irembo ery'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho hakaba hariyo emeeza ibiri, n'aha rundi rubaju ezindi ibiri. <verse eid="EZK 40:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 40:41" />Aha rubaju rw'omunda orw'eryo irembo hariho emeeza ina, n'aha rubaju rwaryo orw'aheeru ezindi ina, zoona munaana ziri ez'okwitiraho ebitambo. <verse eid="EZK 40:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 40:42" />Hakaba hariho n'ezindi meeza ina ezibaizirwe omu mabaare, ez'okutaho ebitambo by'okwotsya, oburaingwa bwazo mukono gumwe n'ekicweka, obukiika bwazo mukono gumwe n'ekicweka, n'obwemi bwazo mukono gumwe, ezaabaire ziteebwaho eby'okwitsa ebitambo by'okwotsya n'ebindi bitambo. <verse eid="EZK 40:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 40:43" />Kandi omuri ekyo kisasi hakaba hateereiremu ebyoma by'okuhanikaho eby'oburaingwa bw'ekita kimwe, bikiikiize omunda. Ahari ezo meeza niho haabaire haba ah'okuta enyama z'empongano.<verse eid="EZK 40:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 40:44" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:44: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 6:31">1 Bus 6:31</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 6:32">32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima yaanyiha aheeru, yantaasya omu kibuga ky'omunda, kandi reeba, omuri ekyo kibuga ky'omunda hakaba harimu ebishengye, ekimwe aha rubaju rw'eirembo ry'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho nikireeba aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo, n'ekindi aha rubaju rw'eirembo ry'aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo nikireeba aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho. <verse eid="EZK 40:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 40:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 44:14">Ezk 44:14</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 3:7">Kub 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 9:23">1 Bus 9:23</ref>. </char></note> Yangira ati: Eki kishengye ekirikureeba aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo n'eky'abanyamurwa abareeberera hekalu; <verse eid="EZK 40:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 40:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 45:4">Ezk 45:4</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 3:31">Kub 3:31</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 18:5">18:5</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 2:35">1 Bag 2:35</ref>. </char></note> n'ekishengye ekirikureeba aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho n'eky'abanyamurwa abareeberera eitambiro; abo nibo beene Zadoki ab'omu ruganda rwa Leevi abarikwikirizibwa bonka kwirira haihi MUKAMA kumuheereza. <verse eid="EZK 40:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 40:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 40:29">Kur 40:29</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:35">Mat 23:35</ref>. </char></note> Yaagyera ekyo kibuga, kyaba mikono igana oburaingwa, na mikono igana obukiika, embaju zoona oku ziri ina zaingana; kandi eitambiro rikaba riri omu maisho ga hekalu.<verse eid="EZK 40:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 40:48" />Bwanyima yantwara aha kisasi kya hekalu, yaagyera enyomyo zaakyo zombi, ey'aha rubaju rumwe yaaba mikono etaano, n'ey'aha rubaju rundi nayo mikono etaano; obuhango bw'eirembo bwaba mikono ikumi n'ena, n'ebisiika by'omu rubaju rw'eirembo byaba mikono eshatu buri rubaju. <verse eid="EZK 40:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 40:49" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:49: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:3">1 Bag 6:3</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 7:21">7:21</ref>. </char></note> Oburaingwa bw'ekyo kisasi bwaba mikono ikumi n'ebiri; amatembero agarikukihikaho gari ikumi; kandi aha rubaju rw'ebiti by'eirembo hakaba hariho enyomyo emwe aha rubaju rumwe n'endi aha rundi.<verse eid="EZK 40:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="EZK 41" />
  <para style="s1">Okugyera obuhangao bwa hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 41:1" />Bwanyima yantwara omuri hekalu, yaagyera ebiti byayo by'emiryango; ahari buri rubaju obukiika bwabyo bwaba mikono mukaaga. <verse eid="EZK 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 41:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:2">1 Bag 6:2</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 17">17</ref>. </char></note> Obuhango bw'omuryango gwayo bwaba mikono ikumi; ebisiika by'omuryango orubaju n'orubaju byaba mikono etaano; yaagaruka yaagyera oburaingwa bwayo, bwaba mikono makumi ana oburaingwa, n'obukiika mikono makumi abiri. <verse eid="EZK 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 41:3" />Banyima yaataaha omu kishengye ky'omunda, yaagyera ebiti by'omuryango gwakyo, byaba mikono ebiri; obuhango bw'omuryango bwaba mikono mukaaga, n'ebisiika byagwo orubaju n'orubaju byaba mikono mushanju. <verse eid="EZK 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 41:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:16">1 Bag 6:16</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 6:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 3:8">2 Bus 3:8</ref>. </char></note> Yaagyera oburaingwa bw'ekyo kishengye, bwaba mikono makumi abiri, n'obukiika bwakyo mikono makumi abiri omu maisho g'ekishengye kya rwagati. Yaagaruka yangira ati: Aha n'Omwanya ogurikwera munonga. <verse eid="EZK 41:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 41:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:5-9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:17">Ezk 40:17</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 6:5">1 Bag 6:5</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 6:6">6</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 6:8">8</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima yaagyera ekisiika kya hekalu, omuzimba gwakyo gwaba mikono mukaaga, n'obukiika bw'ebishengye byona ebikiikiize omu mbaju za hekalu bwaba mikono ena. <verse eid="EZK 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 41:6" />Ebyo bishengye by'omu mbaju za hekalu bikaba biri kaanyina-ishatu bitungamiraine; omuri buri mushorongo harimu ebishengye makumi ashatu. Okwehinguririza ekisiika kya hekalu hakaba hariho ah'okutaahiza ebishengye by'omu mbaju omuri ekyo kisiika kuhamiramu, kwonka bitarikwoga mu kisiika kya hekalu. <verse eid="EZK 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 41:7" />Ebyo bishengye by'omu mbaju byagyenda nibiba bihango, nk'oku bigyenzire nibitembekyerana okuza ahaiguru, nk'obuhango bw'okutaaha omu kisiika okwa buri mushorongo oku buri; aha rubaju rwa hekalu hakaba hariho amatembero g'okutemberaho; kandi omuntu ku yaabaire aruga omu kishengye ky'ahansi, naaza omu kya kaanyina-ishatu, araba omu kya kaanyina-ibiri. <verse eid="EZK 41:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 41:8" />Kandi naareeba hekalu eyehinguririziibwe ekicweka ky'omusingi ekitunguukire; emisingi y'ebishengye by'omu mbaju ekaba eri ey'orugyero rw'ekibingo kimwe kya mikono mukaaga emiraingwa. <verse eid="EZK 41:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 41:9" />Omuzimba gw'ebisiika by'aheeru eby'ebishengye ebikiikiize hekalu guri mikono etaano, kandi ekicweka ky'omusingi ekyatsigariire aho nakyo kiri mikono etaano. <verse eid="EZK 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 41:10" />Okuruga aha muheru gw'ekyo kicweka ky'omusingi okuhika aha bishengye by'omu kibuga ekaba eri mikono makumi abiri okwehinguririza hekalu embaju zoona. <verse eid="EZK 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 41:11" />Emiryango y'ebyo bishengye ebikiikiize hekalu ekaba neereeba ahari ekyo kicweka ky'omusingi ekyatsigariire aho, ogumwe nigureeba aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, ogundi aha bwa-buryo; kandi obukiika bw'ekyo kicweka ky'omusingi ekyatsigariire aho embaju zoona bukaba buri mikono etaano.<verse eid="EZK 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 41:12" />Ekyombeko ekyabaire nikireeba omu kibuga kya hekalu aha rubaju rw'oburengyerwa-izooba kikaba kiri mukono makumi mushanju obukiika; kandi omuzimba gw'ekisiika ky'ekyo kyombeko gukaba guri mikono etaano embaju zoona n'oburaingwa bwakyo mikono makumi mwenda. <verse eid="EZK 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 41:13" />Bwanyima yaagyera hekalu, oburaingwa bwayo bwaba mikono igana; ekibuga kyayo n'ekyombeko hamwe n'ebisiika byayo, oburaingwa bwabyo bwaba mikono igana; <verse eid="EZK 41:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 41:14" />kandi obukiika bw'omu maisho ga hekalu aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba hamwe n'ekibuga kyaho bwaba mikono igana.<verse eid="EZK 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 41:15" />Bwanyima yaagyera oburaingwa bw'ekyombeko ekirikureeba omu kibuga, eky'aha rubaju rw'oburengyerwa-izooba, hamwe n'ebisiika byakyo orubaju n'orubaju, bwaba mikono igana. <verse eid="EZK 41:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 41:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 42:5">Ezk 42:5</ref>. </char></note> Ebisiika by'ekishengye kya hekalu ekya rwagati, n'eby'eky'omunda, n'eby'ekisasi ky'aheeru, bikaba bishekirwe embaaho; byonshatu bikaba biine amadirisa agataahire omu kisiika embaju zoona. Ahashungaine n'ekisasi, ekisiika kya hekalu nakyo kikaba kishwekirwe embaaho, okuruga ahansi okuhika aha madirisa; (kandi ago madirisa gakaba gashwekire), <verse eid="EZK 41:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 41:17" />n'okuhika aha mwanya ogw'ahaiguru y'omuryango, kandi n'okuhika aha kishengye ky'omunda n'aheeru. <verse eid="EZK 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 41:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:29">1 Bag 6:29</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ebisiika byona eby'ekishengye eky'omunda n'eby'ekya rwagati, bikaba bisharwirweho ebishushani bya baakerubi n'eby'emikindo, ahagati y'ekishushani kya kerubi n'ekindi ekishushani ky'omukindo. <verse eid="EZK 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 41:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:10">Ezk 1:10</ref>. </char></note> Buri kerubi akaba aine ahamaisho habiri, ahamaisho h'omuntu nihareeba omukindo aha rubaju rumwe, n'ahamaisho h'entare nihareeba ogundi mukindo aha rundi rubaju. <verse eid="EZK 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 41:20" />Okwo nikwo byabaire bisharwirwe ahari hekalu yoona embaju zoona; okuruga ahansi okuhika ahaiguru y'omuryango hakaba hasharwirweho baakerubi n'emikindo.<verse eid="EZK 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 41:21" />Ebiti by'omuryango by'ekishengye ekya rwagati bikaba biine embaju ina ezirikwingaingana. <verse eid="EZK 41:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 41:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:1">Kur 30:1</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 7:48">1 Bag 7:48</ref>; <ref loc="REV 8:3">Kush 8:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omu maisho g'Omwanya ogurikwera hakaba harimu ekirikushusha eitambiro ry'embaaho, obwemi bwakyo mikono eshatu, oburaingwa bwakyo mikono ebiri, n'obukiika bwakyo mikono ebiri; enshonda zaakyo n'ekitebe kyakyo, n'embaju zaakyo, biri eby'embaaho. Yangira ati: Egi niyo meeza etairwe omu maisho ga MUKAMA. <verse eid="EZK 41:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 41:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:23, 24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:31-34">1 Bag 6:31-34</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ekyo kishengye ekya rwagati n'ogwo Mwanya ogurikwera bikaba biine enyigi z'embari ibiri buri kimwe; <verse eid="EZK 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 41:24" />kandi ezo mbari zikaba ziine ebishate bibiri ebirikukubwa buri emwe. <verse eid="EZK 41:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 41:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:29">1 Bag 6:29</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 6:35">35</ref>. </char></note> Aha nyigi ez'ekishengye ekya rwagati hakaba hasharwirweho ebishushani bya baakerubi n'emikindo, nk'ebyababire bisharwirwe aha bisiika; kandi omu maisho g'ekisasi ky'aheeru hakaba hariho ekisanga ky'embaaho. <verse eid="EZK 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 41:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:48">Ezk 40:48</ref>. </char></note> Kandi aha bisiika by'aha rubaju rw'ekisaski hakaba hariho amadirisa agataahire omu kisiika hamwe n'emikindo orubaju n'orubaju.<verse eid="EZK 41:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="EZK 42" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'ebishengye by'omu kikaari kya hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 42:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 40:17">Ezk 40:17</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 40:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 41:12">41:12</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 41:13">13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima yantwara omu kibuga ky'omunda aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, yampitsya aha bishengye ebirikureebana n'ekibuga kya hekalu, kandi ekishungaine n'ekyombeko eky'aha rubaju rwa bumosho. <verse eid="EZK 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 42:2" />Oburaingwa bw'ekyo kyombeko ky'aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-bumosho bukaba buri mikono igana, n'obukiika bwakyo mikono makumi ataano. <verse eid="EZK 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 42:3" />Kandi hakaba hariho amabaraza ga kaanyina-ishatu gatungamiraine, gahereraine n'omwanya gwa mikono makumi abiri ogw'ekibuga ky'omunda, kandi nigareebana n'ekicweka ekyariirwe amabaare. <verse eid="EZK 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 42:4" />Omu maisho g'ebyo bishengye ahagati hakaba hariho omwanya gw'okurabamu gwa mikono ikumi obukiika, na mikono igana oburaingwa; n'emiryango y'ebyo bishengye neereeba aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho. <verse eid="EZK 42:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 42:5" />Ebishengye by'ahaiguru bikaba bifunzire okukira eby'ahagati n'eby'ahansi, ahabw'okuba ago mabaraza gakaba gabifundize okukira ebindi. <verse eid="EZK 42:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 42:6" />Ahakuba bikaba biri ebya kaanyina-ishatu, kandi bitaine nyomyo nk'ez'omu kibuga ky'aheeru; n'ahabw'ekyo ebishengye by'ahaiguru bikaba biri bikye okukira eby'ahagati n'eby'ahansi. <verse eid="EZK 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 42:7" />Kandi enyima y'ebyo bishengye hakaba hariyo ekisiika kiringaaniire nabyo, kandi kishungaine nabyo aha rubaju rw'ekibuga ky'aheeru, oburaingwa bwakyo mikono makumi ataano. <verse eid="EZK 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 42:8" />Ahakuba oburaingwa bw'ebishengye by'omu kibuga ky'aheeru bukaba buri mikono makumi ataano, kwonka obw'ebishungaine na hekalu buri mikono igana. <verse eid="EZK 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 42:9" />Ahansi y'ebyo bishengye hakaba hariho omuryango aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba, ogwabaire gutaahirwamu abarikuruga omu kibuga ky'enyima, <verse eid="EZK 42:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 42:10" />ahu orugo rw'aheeru rwabaire nirutandikira. Kandi aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo, ahashungaine n'ekibuga kandi n'ekyo kyombeko, hakaba hariho ebishengye ebiine omuhanda gw'okurabamu omu maisho; <verse eid="EZK 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 42:11" />bikaba nibishushana n'eby'aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-bumosho, biri eby'orugyero rumwe oburaingwa n'obukiika, kandi nibishushanisa nabyo aharikushohorerwa, emyombekyere, n'emiryango. <verse eid="EZK 42:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 42:12" />Kandi ahansi y'ebyo bishengye by'aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo, aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba, hakaba hariho omuryango ogurikutaaha omu muhanda gw'ahagati gw'okurabamu; kandi ahashungaine nagwo hariho ekisiika ekirikubitaanisa.<verse eid="EZK 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 42:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 40:46">Ezk 40:46</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 6:16">Lev 6:16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:9">24:9</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 18:9">Kub 18:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima yangira ati: Ebyo bishengye by'aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-bumosho n'orwa buryo ebishungaine n'ekibuga n'ebishengye ebirikwera, omu abanyamurwa abahika MUKAMA baririira empongano ezirikwera munonga; okwo niyo bariguma nibata empongano ezirikwera munonga, empongano z'esaano, empongano y'ekibi, n'empongano y'okwihaho orubanja rw'ekibi, ahabw'okuba ogwo mwanya n'ogurikwera. <verse eid="EZK 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 42:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 44:19">Ezk 44:19</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 6:11">Lev 6:11</ref>. </char></note> Abanyamurwa ku bariguma baataaha omu Mwanya ogurikwera, tibarishohora kuza omu kibuga ky'aheeru, batabandize kujuura bijwaro ebi bajwara nibaheereza, bakabibiika, ahabw'okuba n'ebirikwera. Kandi ku bariba batakahikire mpongano z'abantu, bajware ebindi bijwaro.<verse eid="EZK 42:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 42:15" />Ku yaaherize kugyera ekibuga kya hekalu omunda, yantwara yandabya omu irembo ry'oburugwa-izooba, yaagyera omwanya gwa hekalu embaju zoona. <verse eid="EZK 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 42:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:3">Ezk 40:3</ref>. </char></note> Yaagyeresa ekyo kibingo orubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba, byaba ebibingo magana ataano; <verse eid="EZK 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 42:17" />yaahinduka yaakigyeresa orubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-bumosho, byaba ebibingo magana ataano. <verse eid="EZK 42:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 42:18" />Yaahinduka yaakigyeresa orubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo, byaba ebibingo magana ataano; <verse eid="EZK 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 42:19" />kandi yaahindukira orubaju rw'oburengyerwa-izooba, yaarukigyeresa, rwaba ebibingo magana ataano. <verse eid="EZK 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 42:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 22:26">Ezk 22:26</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 40:5">40:5</ref>. </char></note> Yaagyera embaju zaakyo ina, yaashanga kyehinguririziibwe orugo rwa mikono magana ataano oburaingwa na magana ataano obukiika, okutaanisa aharikwera n'ahatari harikwera.<verse eid="EZK 42:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="EZK 43" />
  <para style="s1">Ekitiinisa kya Mukama okwijura hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 43:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 40:6">Ezk 40:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima yantwara aha irembo eririkureeba oburugwa-izooba, <verse eid="EZK 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 43:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:24">Ezk 1:24</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 10:4">10:4</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 10:18">18</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 10:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:15">Kush 1:15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:1">18:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:11">21:11</ref>. </char></note> kandi reeba, ekitiinisa kya Ruhanga wa Israeli kyareetwa oburugwa-izooba; okuhoorera kw'okwija kwe kwaba nk'okw'amaizi maingi, kandi ensi yaayakwamu ekitiinisa kye. <verse eid="EZK 43:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 43:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:3-28">Ezk 1:3-28</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 8:4">8:4</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 9:1">9:1</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 9:2">2</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 9:5">5</ref>. </char></note> Okworekwa oku naareebire kwaba nka kuri oku naareebire, obu yaija kucwekyereza orurembo, kandi nk'okworekwa oku naareebire aha mugyera Kebari; naagwa ahansi njuumaire. <verse eid="EZK 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 43:4" />Ekitiinisa kya MUKAMA ku kyabaire nikitaaha omuri hekalu, nikireetwa omu irembo ery'oburugwa-izooba, <verse eid="EZK 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 43:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:12">Ezk 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 10:4">10:4</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 8:11">1 Bag 8:11</ref>. </char></note> Omwoyo yankiriza, yantaasya omu kibuga ky'omunda; kandi reeba, ekitiinisa kya MUKAMA kyaijura hekalu.<verse eid="EZK 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 43:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 40:3">Ezk 40:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ogwo mushaija, ku yaabaire akiinyemereire aha rubaju, naahurira orikugamba naanye naayema omuri hekalu; <verse eid="EZK 43:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 43:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:7-9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:39">Ezk 20:39</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:26">37:26</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 37:28">28</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 99:5">Zab 99:5</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 28:2">1 Bus 28:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:13">Isa 60:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 16:18">Yer 16:18</ref>. </char></note> yangira ati: Mwana w'omuntu, ogu nigwo mwanya gw'ekitebe kyangye ky'obukama, kandi ahu nta ebigyere byangye, ahu ndituura ahagati y'abantu ba Israeli ebiro byona. Kandi ab'enju ya Israeli n'abagabe baabo tibarigaruka kusiisisa eiziina ryangye eririkwera obwamaraaya bwabo, nari emitumbi y'abagabe baabo, <verse eid="EZK 43:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 43:8" />n'obu kwakuba okuhikaanisa ekisasi kyabo n'ekyangye, n'enyomyo zaabo n'ezangye; ahagati yangye nabo hakabaho ekisiika kyonka. Ahabw'okuba bakasiisisa eiziina ryangye eririkwera ebihagaro byabo ebi baakozire; nikyo naabamariireho, mbainiire ekiniga. <verse eid="EZK 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 43:9" />Mbwenu hati baanyihe omu maisho okuramya ebishushani kwabo n'emitumbi y'abagabe baabo, babite hare, mbone kuguma omuribo ebiro byona.<verse eid="EZK 43:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 43:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 40:4">Ezk 40:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi iwe, Mwana w'omuntu, shoboororera ab'enju ya Israeli hekalu egi oku erikushusha n'oku egyezirwe, bakwatwe enshoni ahabw'eby'okutahikiirira byabo. <verse eid="EZK 43:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 43:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 44:5">Ezk 44:5</ref>. </char></note> Ku baraakwatwe enshoni ahabw'ebyo byona ebi baakozire, oboorekye enyombekyere ya hekalu, obushohorero bwayo n'obutaahiro bwayo n'oku eyemi kwona; obamanyise emigyenzo yaayo yoona, n'ebiragiro byayo byona; kandi obihandiikye nibakureeba, babone kurinda n'okuhitsya ebiragiro byayo byona, n'emigyenzo yaayo yoona. <verse eid="EZK 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 43:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:2">Ezk 40:2</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 42:15-20">42:15-20</ref>. </char></note> Eki nikyo kiragiro kya hekalu. Omwanya gwona ogw'aha mutwe gw'orushozi embaju zoona guryaba ogurikwera munonga. Reeba, ekyo nikyo kiragiro kya hekalu.<verse eid="EZK 43:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 43:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:13, 16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 40:5">Ezk 40:5</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 40:47">47</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 41:8">41:8</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 27:1">Kur 27:1</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 27:8">8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oru nirwo rugyero rw'eitambiro, nk'oku mikono yaaryo eri, (buri mukono gurimu mukono gumwe n'ekita). Ekitebe kyaryo, obwemi bwakyo buryaba mukono gumwe, obukiika bwakyo mukono gumwe, n'omugoma gwakyo gube ekita kimwe okwehinguririza. <verse eid="EZK 43:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 43:14" />Obu nibwo buriba obwemi bw'eitambiro, okuruga ahansi aha kitebe kyaryo okuhika aha mukugiro gw'ahansi mikono ebiri, n'obukiika bwaryo mukono gumwe; kandi okuruga aha mukugiro omukye okuhika aha muhango mikono ena, n'obukiika mukono gumwe; n'amahega gaaryo mikono ena; <verse eid="EZK 43:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 43:15" />kandi okuruga aha mahega gaaryo habeho amahembe ana ageemereire bwemi, oburaingwa bwa buri ihembe mukono gumwe. <verse eid="EZK 43:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 43:16" />Amahega g'eitambiro garyagira embaju ina ezirikwingaingana, oburaingwa mikono ikumi n'ebiri, n'obukiika mikono ikumi n'ebiri. <verse eid="EZK 43:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 43:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:26">Kur 20:26</ref>. </char></note> Omukugiro gwaryo nagwo guryagira embaju ina ezirikwingaingana, oburaingwa bwagwo mikono ikumi n'ena, n'obukiika mikono ikumi n'ena, kandi gwehinguririzibwe omuguno, obuhango bwagwo ekicweka kya mukono, n'ekitebe kyaryo mukono gumwe okwehinguririza; kandi amatembero g'eryo itambiro garyareeba oburugwa-izooba.<verse eid="EZK 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 43:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 1:5">Lev 1:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi yangira ati: Mwana w'omuntu, oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Egi niyo migyenzo y'eitambiro erikuratirwa. Aha izooba eri baririteeraho kuritambiraho ebitambo by'okwotsya n'okurimiishaho eshagama, <verse eid="EZK 43:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 43:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:46">Ezk 40:46</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 8:14">Lev 8:14</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 2:27">1 Bag 2:27</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 2:35">35</ref>. </char></note> abanyamurwa b'Abaleevi ab'omu ruzaaro rwa Zadoki, abanyirira haihi kumpeereza, oryabaha enimi kuba empongano y'ekibi; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira. <verse eid="EZK 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 43:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:12">Kur 29:12</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 29:36">36</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 8:15">Lev 8:15</ref>. </char></note> Kandi otware aha shagama yaayo, ogite ahari ago mahembe ana g'eitambiro n'aha nshonda ina z'omukugiro, n'aha muguno oguryehinguririize; okwo nikwo oririshemeza, okaririhiirira. <verse eid="EZK 43:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 43:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:14">Kur 29:14</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 13:11">Heb 13:11</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima oryatwara egyo nimi ey'empongano y'ekibi, eyokyezibwe omu mwanya gwa hekalu ogwaragiirwe, enyima y'orugo rw'ekibuga ekirikwera. <verse eid="EZK 43:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 43:22" />Aha kiro kya kabiri oryahonga empaya y'embuzi etaine kamogo kuba empongano y'ekibi; rityo eitambiro riryashemezibwa, nk'oku barishemeize n'egyo nimi. <verse eid="EZK 43:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 43:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:1">Kur 29:1</ref>. </char></note> Ku oriheza kurishemereza kimwe, oryahonga enimi etaine kamogo, n'empaya y'entaama y'omu busyo etaine kamogo, <verse eid="EZK 43:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 43:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 2:13">Lev 2:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:49">Mak 9:49</ref>. </char></note> ozimurikire MUKAMA; bwanyima abanyamurwa bazimemeerereho omwonyo, bazihongyere MUKAMA, zibe ekitambo ky'okwotsya. <verse eid="EZK 43:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 43:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:25, 26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:35-37">Kur 29:35-37</ref>. </char></note> Oryamara ebiro mushanju noohonga embuzi buri izooba kuba empongano y'ekibi, kandi bahongye enimi n'empaya y'entaama y'omu busyo etaine kamogo. <verse eid="EZK 43:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 43:26" />Baryamara ebiro mushanju nibarihiirira eitambiro n'okuryeza; batyo barishoroore. <verse eid="EZK 43:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 43:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:40">Ezk 20:40</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 9:1">Lev 9:1</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ku bariheza ebyo biro, okwiha aha kiro kya munaana n'okweyongyerayo, abanyamurwa baryaguma nibahongyera aha itambiro ebitambo byanyu by'okwotsya n'empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye; naanye ndyabaikiriza; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 43:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="EZK 44" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'emitwarize eshemeire omuri hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 44:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 43:1">Ezk 43:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima yangarura, yampitsya aha irembo ry'Omwanya ogurikwera ery'aheeru, eririkureeba oburugwa-izooba; naashanga rikingire. <verse eid="EZK 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 44:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 43:4">Ezk 43:4</ref>. </char></note> Yangira ati: Eirembo eri riryaguma rikingire; tiririigurwa, kandi tihaine oririrabamu, ahabw'okuba MUKAMA Ruhanga wa israeli arirabiremu; nikyo ririgumira rikingire. <verse eid="EZK 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 44:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:24">Ezk 34:24</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 46:2">46:2</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 46:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 31:54">Kut 31:54</ref>. </char></note> Omunyiginya wenka niwe aririshutamamu kuriira eby'okurya omu maisho ga MUKAMA; aryaguma ataahe naaraba omu kisasi ky'eryo irembo; kandi nimwo ariguma naashohorera.<verse eid="EZK 44:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 44:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 1:28">Ezk 1:28</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 43:5">43:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima yandabya omu irembo ery'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, yampitsya omu maisho ga hekalu; ku naagiire kugira nti, naareeba ekitiinisa kya MUKAMA kyaijura hekalu ye, naagwa ahansi njuumaire. <verse eid="EZK 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 44:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:4">Ezk 40:4</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 43:11">43:11</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yangira ati: Mwana w'omuntu, yetegyereze gye, oreebe n'amaisho gaawe, kandi ohurire n'amatu gaawe, ebi naaza kukugambira byona eby'emigyenzo ya hekalu ya MUKAMA yoona, n'ebiragiro byayo byona; kandi oyetegyereze gye abarikwikirizibwa kutaaha omuri hekalu, n'abatarikwirizibwa kutaaha omu Mwanya ogurikwera. <verse eid="EZK 44:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 44:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:5">Ezk 2:5</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 4:3">1 Pet 4:3</ref>. </char></note> Ogambire egyo nju engomi, enju ya Israeli, oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Imwe nju ya Israeli 'mwe, nyaabura 'mwe nimurekyere kimwe ebihagaro byanyu byona, <verse eid="EZK 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 44:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:39">Ezk 23:39</ref>; <ref loc="JER 9:26">Yer 9:26</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:51">Byak 7:51</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 21:28">21:28</ref>. </char></note> eby'okwikiriza abanyamahanga abatashazirwe omu mutima n'omu mubiri, kuguma omu Mwanya gwangye ogurikwera nibagushiisha, mwaba nimumpongyera eby'okurya, ebishaju n'eshagama. Mwitsire endagaano yangye n'ebihagaro byanyu byona. <verse eid="EZK 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 44:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:2">Kub 18:2</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 18:3">3</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 18:5">5</ref>. </char></note> Kandi timurinzire bintu byangye ebirikwera; kureka mutaireho abanyamahanga kuba nibo baabirindira omu Mwanya gwangye ogurikwera.<verse eid="EZK 44:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 44:9" />Nikyo Mukama RUHANGA arikugirira ati: Tihariho munyaihanga otashazirwe mu mutima n'omu mubiri ow'omu banyamahanga boona ab'omu ihanga rya Israeli oriikirizibwa kutaaha omu Mwanya gwangye ogurikwera. <verse eid="EZK 44:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 44:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 4:4">Ezk 4:4</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 22:26">22:26</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 48:11">48:11</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Abaleevi abaanyimwire bakahaba nibakuratira ebishushani byabo ebirikuramibwa, obu Israeli yaahaba, baryagiibwaho ekifubiro ky'ebibi byabo. <verse eid="EZK 44:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 44:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 46:24">Ezk 46:24</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 16:9">Kub 16:9</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 26:1">1 Bus 26:1</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka baryaba abaheereza omu Mwanya gwangye ogurikwera bari abakumiirizi aha marembo ga hekalu, kandi nibakoramu omurimo; baryaguma nibaita ebitambo by'okwotsya n'ebindi bitambo by'abantu b'obutoosha, kandi bagume beemerere omu maisho gaabo nibabaheereza; <verse eid="EZK 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 44:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 14:3">Ezk 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:26">Zab 106:26</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba abo Baleevi bakabaheerereza enju ya Israeli kucumura, nikyo naimukiize omukono nkarahira nti: Baryagiibwaho ekifubiro ky'ebibi byabo; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira. <verse eid="EZK 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 44:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 32:30">Ezk 32:30</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 18:3">Kub 18:3</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:9">2 Bag 23:9</ref>. </char></note> Tibarimpika haihi kunkorera omurimo gw'obunyamurwa, nari okugira eki bairira haihi omu bintu byangye ebirikwera n'ebindi ebirikwera munonga; kureka baryaitwa enshoni, ahabw'ebihagaro byabo ebi baakozire. <verse eid="EZK 44:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 44:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:45">Ezk 40:45</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 23:28">1 Bus 23:28</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 23:32">32</ref>. </char></note> N'obu kiraabe kiri kityo, ndyabataho kuba abarinzi ba hekalu, kukora obuheereza bwamwo bwona, n'ebindi byona ebishemereire kukorwamu.<verse eid="EZK 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 44:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 43:19">Ezk 43:19</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 48:11">48:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka abanyamurwa b'Abaalevi beene Zadoki, abaabaire bakwatsiibwe emirimo y'Omwanya gwangye ogurikwera, nibo barimpika, bakaguma nibeemerera omu maisho gangye kumpongyera ebishaju n'eshagama; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira. <verse eid="EZK 44:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 44:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 41:22">Ezk 41:22</ref>. </char></note> Abo baryaguma nibataaha omu Mwanya gwangye ogurikwera, nibairira haihi emeeza yangye kumpeereza, nibakora ebi ndikubaragiira. <verse eid="EZK 44:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 44:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:17, 18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 39:27-29">Kur 39:27-29</ref>. </char></note> Ku bariguma baataaha omu marembo g'ekibuga ky'omunda, baryataahamu bajwaire ebijwaro bya kitaani, tibarijwara kintu kyona ekirimu ebyoya by'entaama, baaba nibakora omurimo gw'obuheereza omu marembo g'ekyo kibuga n'omunda yaakyo. <verse eid="EZK 44:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 44:18" />Baryaguma bajware ebikwemba bya kitaani omu mitwe, bajware n'empare za kitaani omunda; kandi tibaryezirika kintu kyona ekirikubareetera okutuutuka. <verse eid="EZK 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 44:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 42:14">Ezk 42:14</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 29:37">Kur 29:37</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 30:29">30:29</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 6:11">Lev 6:11</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ku barishohora, baaza omu bantu omu kibuga ky'aheeru, baryajuura ebyo bijwaro, ebi bariba nibaheererezamu, babite omu bishengye ebirikwera, bajware ebindi bijwaro, ngu batakaayeza abantu n'ebyo bijwaro byabo. <verse eid="EZK 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 44:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 21:5">Lev 21:5</ref>. </char></note> Tibarimwa, kandi tibarikuza ishokye, kureka baryarituubya. <verse eid="EZK 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 44:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:9">Lev 10:9</ref>. </char></note> Tihariho munyamurwa weena orinywa viinyo, yaaba naataaha omu kibuga ky'omunda. <verse eid="EZK 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 44:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 21:14">Lev 21:14</ref>. </char></note> Tibarishwera mufaakazi, nari omukazi oshenzirwe, kureka omwishiki oshugaine ow'omu ruganda rw'enju ya Israeli, nari omufaakazi owaabaire ari muka omunyamurwa. <verse eid="EZK 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 44:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:10">Lev 10:10</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 10:11">11</ref>. </char></note> Baryaguma nibeegyesa abantu bangye omutaano gw'ebirikwera n'ebitari birikwera, baboorekye oku baakutaanisa ebishemeire n'ebitashemeire. <verse eid="EZK 44:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 44:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 22:26">Ezk 22:26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 17:8">Bir 17:8</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 17:9">9</ref>. </char></note> Ku haribaho empaka, baryakora nk'abaramuzi, baramure abantu nk'oku emicwere yangye eri. Baryayorobera ebiragiro byangye n'ebi naataireho omu magyenyi gangye goona agaatairweho, beeze na sabato zangye. <verse eid="EZK 44:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 44:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 21:1-3">Lev 21:1-3</ref>. </char></note> Tibaryesiisisa okuhika haihi omufu; kwonka omunyamurwa naikirizibwa kweshiisha ahabwa ishe, nari nyina, ahabwa mutabani we nari muhara we, n'ahabwa mwene ishe nari munyaanya otakashweirwe. <verse eid="EZK 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 44:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 19:11">Kub 19:11</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 19:12">12</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ku ariheza kusiisikara, aryayebarira ebiro mushanju, bwanyima abe oshemeire. <verse eid="EZK 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 44:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 4:3">Lev 4:3</ref>. </char></note> Aha izooba eri arigiiraho omu Mwanya ogurikwera omu kibuga ky'omunda kuheererezamu, aryahonga empongano ye y'ekibi; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 44:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 44:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 45:4">Ezk 45:4</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 45:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 18:20">Kub 18:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tibarigira buhunguzi, niinye buhunguzi bwabo; timuribaha mugabo omuri Israeli, niinye mugabo gwabo. <verse eid="EZK 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 44:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:9">Kub 18:9</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 18:10">10</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 18:14">14</ref>. </char></note> Baryaguma barye aha mpongano z'esaano n'aha mpongano y'ekibi, n'aha mpongano ey'okwihaho orubanja; kandi ekintu kyona ekyabiikirwe Ruhanga omuri Israeli kiryaguma kibe ekyabo. <verse eid="EZK 44:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 44:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 45:13">Ezk 45:13</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 45:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 23:19">Kur 23:19</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 15:20">Kub 15:20</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:10">Mal 3:10</ref>. </char></note> Emiganuro y'ebiribanza kwera byona eby'emiringo yoona, na buri mpongano yoona ey'omu mpongano zaanyu zoona ez'emiringo yoona biryaguma bibe eby'abanyamurwa; kandi muryaguma muhe abanyamurwa emiganuro y'ebiihuro byanyu, amaka gaanyu gabone kugumwamu emigisha. <verse eid="EZK 44:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 44:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 22:8">Lev 22:8</ref>. </char></note> Kandi abanyamurwa tibarirya ha kintu kyona ekyefeereire, nari ekiitsirwe enyamaishwa eky'ekirikuguruka nari eky'enyamaishwa.<verse eid="EZK 44:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="EZK 45" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'ebibanja by'abanyamurwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 45:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 48:8-10">Ezk 48:8-10</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 48:29">29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku muribagana ensi kuba obuhunguzi bwanyu, muryaihiraho MUKAMA omugabo gw'ekicweka ky'ensi, kibe ekyanga ekirikwera, oburaingwa bwakyo mikono obukumi bubiri n'enkumi itaano, n'obukiika bwakyo mikono obukumi bubiri; ekyo kyanga kyona oku kiingana kibe ekirikwera. <verse eid="EZK 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 45:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 42:16-20">Ezk 42:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 35:2">Kub 35:2</ref>. </char></note> Omuri ekyo kyanga ekibanja kya mikono magana ataano oburaingwa n'obukiika mikono magana ataano kiryaba obutaaho oburikwera bwehinguririzibwe akataajuure k'obukiika bwa mikono makumi ataano. <verse eid="EZK 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 45:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 41:4">Ezk 41:4</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omuri ekyo kyanga ekirikwera ogyeremu ekicweka kya mikono obukumi bubiri n'enkumi itaano oburaingwa, n'obukiika mikono kakumi ahu Obutaaho oburikwera buryombekwa, nigwo Omwanya gurikwera munonga. <verse eid="EZK 45:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 45:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 48:11">Ezk 48:11</ref>. </char></note> Ogwo mwanya guryaba ekicweka ky'ensi ekirikwera, kibe eky'abanyamurwa abaheereza omu Butaaho burikwera, kandi abahika MUKAMA kumuheereza; guryaba omwanya gw'okutamu Omwanya ogurikwera munonga. <verse eid="EZK 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 45:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 48:13">Ezk 48:13</ref>. </char></note> Ekindi kicweka kya mikono obukumi bubiri n'enkumi itaano oburaingwa, n'obukiika mikono kakumi, kiryaba eky'Abaleevi, abaheerereza omuri hekalu, kibe ekyabo eky'okwombekamu endembo z'okutuuramu.<verse eid="EZK 45:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 45:6" />Aha rubaju rw'ekyo kicweka ekyaihirweho kuba ekyanga ekirikwera, muryahatooranira orurembo omwanya gwa mikono enkumi itaano obukiika, noburaingwa mikono obukumi n'enkumi itaano; guryaba ogw'enju ya Israeli yoona.<verse eid="EZK 45:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 45:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 44:3">Ezk 44:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ekicweka ky'ensi eky'omugabe kiryaba aha mbaju zombi ez'ekyanga ekirikwera, n'omwanya gw'orurembo, omu mbaju z'ekyo kyanga ekirikwera, n'ez'ogwo mwanya gw'orurembo, aha rubaju rw'oburengyerwa-izooba, nihainganisa oburaingwa n'eky'omugabo gw'oruganda rumwe, okuruga aha mwatano gw'ensi ogw'oburengyerwa-izooba okuhika aha gw'oburugwa-izooba. <verse eid="EZK 45:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 45:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 22:27">Ezk 22:27</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 46:18">46:18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 47:13">47:13</ref>. </char></note> Kiryaba omugabo gwe omuri Israeli. Kandi abagabe bangye tibarigaruka kwita kubi bantu bangye, kureka baryareka enju ya Israeli etungye ensi nk'enganda zaabo oku ziri.<verse eid="EZK 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'abanyiginya okuragiirwa kukora eby'oburyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 45:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 44:6">Ezk 44:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:3">Yer 22:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Imwe banyiginya ba Israeli 'mwe, nimurekyere aho! Mwiheho omwaga n'okuhata; mukore eby'oburyo n'eby'okuhikiirira; murekyere aho kubinga abantu bangye omu bibanja byabo; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira. <verse eid="EZK 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 45:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:36">Lev 19:36</ref>. </char></note> Mugire eminzaani ehikire, eefa ehikire, n'encuro ehikire. <verse eid="EZK 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 45:11" />Eefa n'encuro bibe eby'orugyero rumwe; encuro egiibwemu ekicweka kya ikumi kya homeri, na eefa nayo ekicweka kimwe kya ikumi kya homeri; homeri nayo ebe niyo yaaguma neeba eky'okurengyesa. <verse eid="EZK 45:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 45:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:13">Kur 30:13</ref>. </char></note> Shekeli eryabamu geera makumi abiri; shekeli itaano zibe shekeli itaano buzima, shekeli ikumi zibe shekeli ikumi buzima, kandi miina yaanyu eingane shekeli makumi ataano.<verse eid="EZK 45:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'empongano z'abantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 45:13" />Egi niyo mpongano ei muriguma nimuhonga; ekicweka kimwe kya mukaaga kya eefa y'engano ekiihirwe omuri buri homeri; na kimwe kya mukaaga kya eefa ya sayiri omuri buri homeri, <verse eid="EZK 45:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 45:14" />n'encuro y'amajuta eyaatairweho, kimwe kya ikumi ky'enjoga omuri buri kooru (kooru emwe erimu enjoga ikumi, nk'oku kiri omuri homeri emwe); <verse eid="EZK 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 45:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 1:4">Lev 1:4</ref>. </char></note> kandi muhongye entaama emwe omuri buri busyo bw'entaama magana abiri. Emiryango ya Israeli yoona nikwo erihonga etyo, empongano y'esaano, ebitambo by'okwotsya, n'empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye, kugirihiirira; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira. <verse eid="EZK 45:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 45:16" />Abantu b'omu nsi boona baryaha omugabe wa Israeli egyo mpongano. <verse eid="EZK 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 45:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 30:24">2 Bus 30:24</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 35:7">35:7</ref>. </char></note> Kandi guryaba omurimo gw'ogwo mugabe kureeta ebitambo by'okwotsya, empongano z'esaano n'ez'eby'okunywa, omu magyenyi n'ahari buri kuboneka kw'okwezi n'aha sabato, amagyenyi goona agu enju ya Israeli yaaragiirwe; niwe aritebeekanisa empongano z'ekibi, empongano z'esaano, ebitambo by'okwotsya n'empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye okurihiirira enju ya Israeli.<verse eid="EZK 45:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 45:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 16:16">Lev 16:16</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 9:22">Heb 9:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Omu kwezi kw'okubanza, aha kiro kyakwo ky'okubanza, oryatwara enimi nto etaine kamogo, oshemeze Omwanya ogurikwera. <verse eid="EZK 45:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 45:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 43:4">Ezk 43:4</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 43:5">5</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 43:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12:7">Kur 12:7</ref>. </char></note> Omunyamurwa aryatwara aha shagama y'empongano y'ekibi, agite aha biti by'emiryango ya hekalu, aha nshonda ina z'omukugiro gw'eitambiro, n'aha biti by'eirembo ry'ekibuga ky'omunda. <verse eid="EZK 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 45:20" />Kandi oryatwaza otyo aha kiro kya mushanju eky'okwo kwezi ahabw'omuntu weena oshobize nari omushema; okwo nikwo muririhiirira hekalu.<verse eid="EZK 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 45:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:14">Kur 12:14</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 12:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:5">Lev 23:5</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 23:6">6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu kwezi kw'okubanza, aha kiro kyakwo kya ikumi na bina, muryagira obugyenyi bw'Okuhingurwaho, mumare ebiro mushanju nimurya omugaati ogutatumbisiibwe. <verse eid="EZK 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 45:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 4:14">Lev 4:14</ref>. </char></note> Ahari ekyo kiro omugabe aryareeta enimi nto ahabwe n'ahabw'abantu b'omu nsi boona, kuba empongano y'ekibi. <verse eid="EZK 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 45:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:8">Lev 23:8</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 28:15">Kub 28:15</ref>. </char></note> Kandi buri izooba omuri ebyo biro mushanju by'obugyenyi aryahongyera MUKAMA enimi mushanju n'empaya z'entaama mushanju ezitaine kamogo kuba ekitambo ky'okwotsya; kandi buri izooba ahongye empaya y'embuzi kuba empongano y'ebibi. <verse eid="EZK 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 45:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 2:1">Lev 2:1</ref>. </char></note> Kandi aryatebeekanisa empongano y'esaano, eefa emwe ahabwa buri nimi, eefa emwe ahabwa buri mpaya y'entaama, na hiini emwe y'amajuta ahabwa buri eefa. <verse eid="EZK 45:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 45:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:34-36">Lev 23:34-36</ref>. </char></note> Omu kwezi kwa mushanju aha kiro kyakwo kya ikumi na bitaano, aryatwaza atyo, n'ahabw'ebiro mushanju by'obugyenyi, ahongye empongano z'ekibi, ebitambo by'okwotsya, empongano z'esaano, n'amajuta.<verse eid="EZK 45:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="EZK 46" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'ebitambo n'empongano ebyaragiirwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 46:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 44:1">Ezk 44:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Omu biro mukaaga ebikorerwamu emirimo, eirembo ry'ekibuga ky'omunda eririkureeba oburugwa-izooba riryaguma rikingire; kwonka riryaigurwa aha izooba rya sabato n'aha izooba ry'okuboneka kw'okwezi. <verse eid="EZK 46:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 46:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:38">Ezk 40:38</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 40:39">39</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 44:3">44:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 45:19">45:19</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe aryaguma ataahire omu kisasi ky'eirembo eky'aheeru, ayemerere aha rubaju rw'ekiti kyaryo; abanyamurwa batambe ekitambo kye ky'okwotsya, bahongye empongano ze z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye, nawe aramize omu kisasi ky'eirembo; bwanyima ashohore, kwonka eirembo rirekye kukingwa okuhitsya omu mwabazyo. <verse eid="EZK 46:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 46:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:10">Luk 1:10</ref>. </char></note> Abantu b'omu nsi baryaguma baramize ah'orikutaahira nooza omuri eryo irembo omu maisho ga MUKAMA ahari buri sabato n'ahari buri kuboneka kw'okwezi. <verse eid="EZK 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 46:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 45:17">Ezk 45:17</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 28:9">Kub 28:9</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 28:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Ekitambo ky'okwotsya, eki omugabe ariguma naahongyera MUKAMA ahari sabato kiryaba abaana b'entaama mukaaga abataine kamogo, n'empaya y'entaama etaine kamogo; <verse eid="EZK 46:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 46:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 45:24">Ezk 45:24</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:17">Bir 16:17</ref>. </char></note> kandi empongano y'esaano erikuhongwa n'egyo mpaya y'entaama eryaba eefa emwe, n'esaano ey'okuhongwa n'abaana b'entaama ebe nyingi nk'oku arikubaasa, hamwe na hiini y'amajuta ahabwa buri eefa. <verse eid="EZK 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 46:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 45:18">Ezk 45:18</ref>. </char></note> Aha izooba ry'okuboneka kw'okwezi aryaguma ahongye enimi nto etaine kamogo, n'abaana b'entaama mukaaga, n'empaya y'entaama etaine kamogo; <verse eid="EZK 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 46:7" />kandi ahongye empongano y'esaano eefa emwe ahabwa buri nimi, eefa emwe ahabwa buri mpaya y'entaama, n'esaano nyingi ezi arikubaasa ahabw'abaana b'entaama, hamwe na hiini emwe y'amajuta ahabwa buri eefa y'esaano. <verse eid="EZK 46:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 46:8" />Omugabe ku ariba naataaha omuri hekalu, aryaguma arabe omu kisasi ky'eirembo; kandi n'omu kushohora, abe nimwo yaaraba.<verse eid="EZK 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 46:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 16:16">Bir 16:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka abantu b'obutoosha ab'omu nsi ku bariba nibaija omu maisho ga MUKAMA omu magyenyi agaatairweho, oritaahira omu irembo ry'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho aizire kuramya, aryashohohorera omu irembo ry'aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo; kandi oritaahira omu irembo ry'aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo, aryashohorera omu irembo ry'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho; tihariho n'omwe oriikirizibwa kugaruka omu irembo eri yaatahiramu, kureka omuntu weena aryashohora agumizemu. <verse eid="EZK 46:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 46:10" />Ku baritaahamu, omugabe aryataahamu nabo; kandi ku barishohora, nawe aryashohora.<verse eid="EZK 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 46:11" />Omu biro by'amagyenyi n'omu biro bikuru ebyatairweho, empongano eryaguma ebi eefa emwe ahabwa buri nimi nto, na eefa emwe ahabwa buri mpaya y'entaama, n'ahabw'abaana b'entaama omuntu ahe esaano nyingi nk'oku arikubaasa, hamwe na hiini y'amajuta ahabwa buri eefa y'esaano. <verse eid="EZK 46:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 46:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 1:3">Lev 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 3:1">3:1</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23:23">Bir 23:23</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omugabe ku ariteekateeka kuhongyera MUKAMA empongano n'omutima gwekundiire, yaaba kitambo ky'okwotsya nari empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye, aryaigurirwa eirembo eririkureeba oburugwa-izooba, ahongye ekitambo kye ky'okwotsya n'empongano ze z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye, nk'oku ashangwa atwaza aha izooba rya sabato. Bwanyima aryashohora; ku ariheza kushohora, eirembo rikingwe.<verse eid="EZK 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 46:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:13, 14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 29:38-40">Kur 29:38-40</ref>. </char>
    </note> Buri izooba omugabe aryahongyera MUKAMA omwana gw'entaama oguhikize omwaka gumwe, ogutaine kamogo, kuba ekitambo ky'okwotsya; aryaguma aguhongye buri kasheeshe. <verse eid="EZK 46:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 46:14" />Kandi aryahonga n'empongano y'esaano buri kasheeshe kimwe kya mukaaga kya eefa emwe, na kimwe kya kashatu kya hiini y'amajuta g'okworobya egyo saano, kuba empongano y'esaano ehongyeirwe MUKAMA; ekyo nikyo kiragiro ky'ekitambo ky'okwotsya ekiriguma nikitambwa. <verse eid="EZK 46:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 46:15" />Kandi okwo nikwo bariteebeekanisa omwana gw'entaama n'empongano y'esaano n'amajuta kuba ekitambo ky'okwotsya ekiriguma nikitambwa.<verse eid="EZK 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 46:16" />Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Omugabe ku ariiha ekiconco omu buhunguzi bwe, yaakiha omwe aha batabani, kiryaba eky'abatabani; omu biragiro by'obuhunguzi n'ekyabo. <verse eid="EZK 46:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 46:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 45:7">Ezk 45:7</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 25:10">Lev 25:10</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ku ariiha ekiconco omu buhunguzi bwe, yaakiha omwe aha baheereza be, kiryaguma kiri ekye okuhitsya omu mwaka gw'obusingye, bwanyima kigarukire omugabe; abatabani bonka nibo bariikirizibwa kugama n'ekiconco ekirugire omu buhunguzi bwe. <verse eid="EZK 46:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 46:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 45:8">Ezk 45:8</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 21:3">1 Bag 21:3</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 21:7">7</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omugabe taritwara ha buhunguzi bw'abantu ahabw'okubabinga omu bintu byabo, kureka aryaraga abatabani ebirugire omu bi atungire byonka, harekye kugira n'omwe omu bantu bangye owaayakwa ebi atungire.<verse eid="EZK 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 46:19" />Bwanyima yandabya aharikutaahirwa aha rubaju rw'eirembo, yampitsya aha mushorongo gw'ebishengye ebirikwera eby'abanyamurwa eby'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho; naareebayo omwanya oguri aha muheru gwabyo aha rubaju rw'oburengyerwa-izooba. <verse eid="EZK 46:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 46:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 44:19">Ezk 44:19</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 35:13">2 Bus 35:13</ref>. </char></note> Yangira ati: Hariya niho abanyamurwa bariguma nibateekyera empongano y'okwihaho orubanja, n'empongano y'ekibi; kandi niho bariguma nibateeka empongano y'esaano, ngu barekye kubishohoza omu kibuga ky'aheeru, bakabyezesa abantu.<verse eid="EZK 46:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 46:21" />Bwanyima yantwara omu kibuga ky'aheeru, yampitsya aha nshonda ina zaakyo; ahari buri nshonda hakaba hariho ekibuga; <verse eid="EZK 46:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 46:22" />omuri ezo nshonda ina z'ekibuga hakaba hariho obubuga bukye, buri kamwe mikono makumi ana oburaingwa, n'obukiika mikono makumi ashatu, bwona buna nibwingaingana. <verse eid="EZK 46:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 46:23" />Omunda y'obwo bubuga bwona, hakaba hombekirwemu omushorongo okwehinguririza ogurimu emyanya y'okuteekyeramu embaju zoona. <verse eid="EZK 46:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 46:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 44:11">Ezk 44:11</ref>. </char></note> Yangira ati: Ago nigo mateekyero agu abarikuheereza omuri hekalu bariteekyeramu ebitambo by'abantu.<verse eid="EZK 46:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="EZK 47" />
  <para style="s1">Amaizi g'amagara okuruga omuri hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 47:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">47:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 3:18">Yoel 3:18</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:8">Zek 14:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:1">Kush 22:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima yangarura aha muryango gwa hekalu, naareeba amaizi nigaruga ahansi y'ekisasi kyayo, nigatoora oburugwa-izooba, (ahabw'okuba hekalu niyo yaabaire neereeba); kandi ago maizi gakaba nigaruga okuzimu, nigashuumira aha rubaju rwa buryo rwa hekalu, nigaraba aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo bw'eitambiro. <verse eid="EZK 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 47:2" />Atyo yanshohoreza omu irembo ry'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, yanziguurutsya, yampitsya aha irembo ry'aheeru eririkureeba oburugwa-izooba; naashanga ago maizi nigashohorera aha rubaju rwayo rwa buryo. <verse eid="EZK 47:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 47:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:3">Ezk 40:3</ref>. </char></note> Ogwo muntu yaatoora aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba, naagyera aine omu ngaro omugoye gw'okugyeresa, yaagyera mikono rukumi, yaanyambutsya omuri ago maizi, naashanga nigahika aha bugombamburi. <verse eid="EZK 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 47:4" />Yaagaruka yaagyera mikono rukumi, yaanyambutsya, naashanga nigahika omu maju. Yaagaruka yaagyera mikono rukumi, aho naashanga nigakwata omunda. <verse eid="EZK 47:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 47:5" />Yaagaruka yaagyera mikono rukumi; aho gwaba omugyera ogu ntarikubaasa kwambuka; ahabw'okuba amaizi gakaba gaijwire, gari ag'okuziha, omugyera ogutarikwambukwa n'amaguru. <verse eid="EZK 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 47:6" />Yangira ati: Mwana w'omuntu, ekyo waakireeba?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 47:6">Bwanyima yangarurayo, yandabya aha nkungu y'omugyera; <verse eid="EZK 47:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 47:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:2">Kush 22:2</ref>. </char></note> ku naabaire ningarukayo naareeba ebiti bingi aha mbaju zombi z'omugyera. <verse eid="EZK 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 47:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:17">Bir 3:17</ref>. </char></note> Yangira ati: Amaizi aga nigahimintika nigatoora oburugwa-izooba, nigashuuma omuri Araba; ku garaahikye omu g'enyanja agatarikugyenda, ago maizi g'enyanja nigaija kuba marungi. <verse eid="EZK 47:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 47:9" />Ei ogwo mugyera gurihika yoona, ebihuriire byona biryagira amagara; kandi haryabamu eby'enyanja bingi munonga, ahabw'okuba amaizi ago nigaza omu nyanja, ngu ago maizi g'enyanja gabe marungi; n'ahabw'ekyo ei ogwo mugyera gurihika yoona, buri kintu kiryagira amagara. <verse eid="EZK 47:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 47:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 34:6">Kub 34:6</ref>. </char></note> Abajubi baryayemerera aha rubaju rw'enyanja; okuruga Eni-geedi okuhika Enegulaimu haryabaho okutega obutimba; haryababamu eby'enyanja by'emiringo mingi munonga, nk'eby'omu Nyanja empango. <verse eid="EZK 47:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 47:11" />Kwonka amaizi g'omu bisharara byayo n'ag'omu myanya yaayo y'orutenga tigariba marungi; garyatsigwaho kwihwamu omwonyo. <verse eid="EZK 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 47:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 1:3">Zab 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:8">Yer 17:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:2">Kush 22:2</ref>. </char></note> Kandi aha nkungu z'aha mbaju zombi z'ogwo mugyera haryamera ebiti by'emiringo yoona eby'ebijuma ebirikuriibwa. Amababi gaabyo tigarihotoka, n'ebijuma byabyo tibirihunduura, kureka ebyo biti biryaguma nibyana buri kwezi; ahabw'okuba amaizi gaabyo nigaruga omu Mwanya ogurikwera. Ebijuma byabyo biryaba eby'okurya, n'amababi gaabyo gabe ag'okutamba.<verse eid="EZK 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'emyatano y'ensi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 47:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">47:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 45:8">Ezk 45:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Egi niyo myatano ei muryatanisisa ensi nimugibaganisiza enganda ikumi na ibiri za Israeli kuba obuhunguzi bwazo. Yosefu aryagira emigabo ebiri. <verse eid="EZK 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 47:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Kut 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 34:2">Kub 34:2</ref>. </char></note> Muryagibagana omu bwinganisa, ahabw'okuba nkarahira kugiha baashwenkuriimwe; kandi egyo nsi eryaba obuhunguzi bwanyu.<verse eid="EZK 47:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 47:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">47:15-20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 34:3-12">Kub 34:3-12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ogu nigwo guriba omwatano gw'ensi. Aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-bumosho guryaruga aha Nyanja empango, gurabe Heselooni okuhika ah'orikutaahira nooza Hamasi, guhikye Zedadi, <verse eid="EZK 47:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 47:16" />Berosa, Siburaimu eri aha mwatano ogurikutaanisa Damasiko na Hamasi, n'okuhika Hazeri-hatikooni aha mwatano gwa Hauraani. <verse eid="EZK 47:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 47:17" />Kandi omwatano guryaruga aha nyanja, guhikye Hazarenooni eri aha mwatano gwa Damasiko ogw'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, gwatane n'ogwa Hamasi aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho. Ogwo nigwo guriba omwatano ogw'aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-bumosho.<verse eid="EZK 47:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 47:18" />Aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba omwatano guryaruga Hazarenooni eri ahagati ya Hauraani na Damasiko, gugyende aha rubaju rwa Yorudani ahagati ya Gileadi n'ensi ya Israeli, guhikye aha nyanja y'oburugwa-izooba, gugumizemu guhikye Tamari. Ogwo nigwo mwatano gw'oburugwa-izooba.<verse eid="EZK 47:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 47:19" />Aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo guryaruga Tamari, guhikye aha maizi ga Meribati-kadeshi, gurugyeyo gurabe aha rubaju rw'akagyera ka Misri, guhikye aha Nyanja empango. Ogwo nigwo mwatano gw'aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo.<verse eid="EZK 47:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 47:20" />Aha rubaju rw'oburengyerwa-izooba Enyanja empango niyo eriba omwatano, okuhika ahashungaine n'ah'orikutaahira nooza Hamasi. Orwo nirwo ruriba orubaju rw'oburengyerwa-izooba.<verse eid="EZK 47:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 47:21" />Okwo nikwo muribaganisa egyo nsi, nk'oku enganda za Israeli ziri. <verse eid="EZK 47:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 47:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 45:1">Ezk 45:1</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12:48">Kur 12:48</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 12:49">49</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 14:1">Isa 14:1</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 10:12">Rom 10:12</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 3:6">Efe 3:6</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:11">Kol 3:11</ref>. </char></note> Muryagibagana, ebe obuhunguzi bwanyu n'obw'abanyamahanga abatwire naimwe, bakabazaariramu; ahariimwe baryaba nk'enzaarwa za Israeli; baryaheebwa naimwe obuhunguzi omu nganda za Israeli. <verse eid="EZK 47:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 47:23" />Oruganda rwona oru omunyaihanga ariba atwiremu, mube nimwo mwamuha obuhunguzi; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 47:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="EZK 48" />
  <para style="s1">Amarembo g'orurembo n'eiziina ryarwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 48:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:1-7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 47:15-20">Ezk 47:15-20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aga nigo maziina g'enganda. Okutandikira aha mwatano gw'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, okuruga aha Nyanja empango, okuraba Heselooni, okuhika ah'orikutaahira nooza Hamasi, n'okugumizamu okuhika Hazarenooni eri aha mwatano gwa Damasiko ahashungaine na Hamasi, okuruga aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba okuhika oburengyerwa-izooba, guryaba omugabo gwa Daani. <verse eid="EZK 48:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 48:2" />Ahaheereraine n'ekyanga kya Daani, okuruga oburugwa-izooba okuhika oburengyerwa-izooba, guryaba omugabo gwa Ashera. <verse eid="EZK 48:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 48:3" />Ahaheereraine n'ekyanga kya Ashera, okuruga oburugwa-izooba okuhika oburengyerwa-izooba guryaba omugabo gwa Nafutaali. <verse eid="EZK 48:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 48:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:4, 5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 47:13">Ezk 47:13</ref>. </char></note> Aheereraine n'ekyanga kya Nafutaali, okuruga oburugwa-izooba okuhika oburengyerwa-izooba guryaba omugabo gwa Manaase. <verse eid="EZK 48:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 48:5" />Ahaheereraine n'ekyanga kya Manaase, okuruga oburugwa-izooba okuhika oburengyerwa-izooba, guryaba omugabo gwa Efuraimu. <verse eid="EZK 48:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 48:6" />Ahaheereraine n'ekyanga kya Efuraimu, okuruga oburugwa-izooba okuhika oburengyerwa-izooba guryaba omugabo gwa Reubeeni. <verse eid="EZK 48:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 48:7" />Ahaheereraine n'ekyanga kya Reubeeni, okuruga oburugwa-izooba okuhika oburengyerwa-izooba, guryaba omugabo gwa Yuda.<verse eid="EZK 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 48:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 45:1-3">Ezk 45:1-3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahaheereraine n'ekyanga kya Yuda, okuruga oburugwa-izooba okuhika oburengyerwa-izooba, guryaba omugabo ogu murishoroora, mikono obukumi bubiri n'enkumi itaano obukiika, kandi oburaingwa bwagwo bwingane n'omugabo gw'oruganda rumwe, okuruga oburugwa-izooba okuhika oburengyerwa-izooba, gwine Omwanya ogurikwera ahagati yaagwo. <verse eid="EZK 48:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 48:9" />Ekicweka eki muriihiraho MUKAMA kiryaba mikono obukumi bubiri n'enkumi itaano oburaingwa, n'obukiika mikono obukumi bubiri. <verse eid="EZK 48:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 48:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 45:4">Ezk 45:4</ref>. </char></note> Ekyo kicweka ekirikwera kiryabaganisibwa omu bicweka ebi-abanyamurwa baryatunga omugabo gw'ekicweka kya mikono obukumi bubiri n'enkumi itaano aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-bumosho, mikono kakumi aha rubaju rw'oburengyerwa-izooba, mikono kakumi aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba, na mikono obukumi bubiri n'enkumi itaano aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-rwa-buryo, kiine Omwanya ogurikwera gwa MUKAMA ahagati. <verse eid="EZK 48:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 48:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 44:10">Ezk 44:10</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 44:15">15</ref>. </char></note> Ekyo kiryaba eky'abanyamurwa abashoroirwe, beene Zadoki, abaarinzire ebi naabakwatsize, abatarahabire, obu Abaisraeli baahaba, nk'oku Abaleevi baahabire. <verse eid="EZK 48:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 48:12" />Guryaba omugabo gwabo ogu bacumiirwe ogwihirwe omuri ekyo kicweka ky'enki ekirikwera, ekiheereraine n'ekicweka ky'Abaleevi. <verse eid="EZK 48:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 48:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 45:5">Ezk 45:5</ref>. </char></note> Ahaheereraine n'ekicweka ky'abanyamurwa, Abaleevi baryaheebwa omugabo gwa mikono obukumi bubiri n'enkumi itaano oburaingwa, n'obukiika mikono kakumi. Oburaingwa bw'ekyo kicweka kyona buryaba mikono obukumi bubiri n'enkumi itaano n'obukiika mikono obukumi bubiri. <verse eid="EZK 48:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 48:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 44:30">Ezk 44:30</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 27:10">Lev 27:10</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 27:28">28</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 27:33">33</ref>. </char></note> Ekyo kicweka ky'ensi ekiriihwaho tibarikitunda n'obu kwakuba okuhingisa ekicweka kyakyo kyona n'ekindi; kandi tikiriba ky'abandi bantu; ahabw'okuba n'ekyereziibwe MUKAMA.<verse eid="EZK 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 48:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 45:2">Ezk 45:2</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 45:6">6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ekicweka ekiritsigaraho kya mikono enkumi itaano obukiika n'oburaingwa mikono obukumi bubiri n'enkumi itaano, kiryaba eky'abantu b'obutoosha okwombekamu orurembo n'amaka n'eky'omwanya gw'akataajuure. Ahagati yaakyo haryabaho orurembo. <verse eid="EZK 48:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 48:16" />Kandi ezi nizo ngyero zaarwo; aha rubaju rw'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho ruryaba mikono enkumi ina na magana ataano; orw'aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo mikono enkumi ina na magana ataano; orw'oburugwa-izooba mikono enkumi ina na magana ataano; n'orw'oburengyerwa-izooba narwo mikono enkumi ina na magana ataano. <verse eid="EZK 48:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 48:17" />Kandi orurembo ruryagira ogwo mwanya gw'akataajuure, aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-bumosho mikono magana abiri na makumi ataano, aha rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo mikono magana abiri na makumi ataano, aha rw'oburugwa-izooba mikono magana abiri na amakumi ataano, naha buryengyerwa-izooba naho mikono magana abiri na makumi ataano. <verse eid="EZK 48:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 48:18" />Ekicweka ekiritsigaraho, ekiheereraine n'ekicweka ky'omugabo ogurikwera, kiryaba mikono kakumi aha rubaju rw'orurembo orw'oburugwa-izooba, kandi mikono kakumi aha rubaju rwarwo orw'oburengyerwa-izooba; hoona haheererane n'ekyo kicweka ekirikwera. Kandi emyaka yaaho eryaguma ebe eby'okurya by'abakozi b'omu rurembo. <verse eid="EZK 48:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 48:19" />Abakozi b'omu rurembo, abarikuruga omu nganda zoona eza Israeli, nibo bariguma nibahahinga. <verse eid="EZK 48:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 48:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:16">Kush 21:16</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo ekicweka kyona, eki muriihaho, kiryaba ekya mikono obukumi bubiri n'enkumi itaano embaju zaakyo zoona ina, nikyo kicweka ky'omugabo ogurikwera hamwe n'omwanya gwona ogw'orurembo. <verse eid="EZK 48:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 48:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 45:7">Ezk 45:7</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ekicweka ekiritsigara aha mbaju zombi ez'ekicweka ky'omugabo ogurikwera n'omwanya gw'orurembo kiryaba eky'omugabe. Okuruga ahari ogwo mwanya gw'omugabo ogurikwera gwa mikono obukumi bubiri n'enkumi itaano, okuhika aha mwatano gw'oburugwa-izooba, kandi okutoora oburengyerwa-izooba okuruga ahari ogwo mwanya gw'omugabo ogurikwera gwa mikono obukumi bubiri n'enkumi itaano okuhika aha mwatano gw'oburengyerwa-izooba, ahaheereraine n'emigabo y'enganda, haryaba ah'omugabe. Kandi ogwo mugabo ogurikwera ogurimu Omwanya ogurikwera gwa hekalu ahagati, <verse eid="EZK 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 48:22" />hamwe n'omwanya gw'orurembo, guryaba ahagati y'ekyanga ky'omugabe. Ekyo kyanga kiryaba ahagati y'omugabo gwa Yuda n'ogwa Benyamiini.<verse eid="EZK 48:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 48:23" />Kandi eby'ezindi nganda, okuruga oburugwa-izooba okuhika oburengyerwa-izooba, guryaba omugabo gwa Benyamiini. <verse eid="EZK 48:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 48:24" />Ahaheereraine n'ekyanga kya Benyamiini okuruga oburugwa-izooba okuhika oburengyerwa-izooba guryaba omugabo gwa Simeoni. <verse eid="EZK 48:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 48:25" />Ahaheereraine n'ekyanga kya Simeoni, okuruga oburugwa-izooba okuhika oburengyerwa-izooba, guryaba omugabo gwa Isakaari. <verse eid="EZK 48:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 48:26" />Ahaheereraine n'ekyanga kya Isakaari, okuruga oburugwa-izooba okuhika oburengyerwa-izooba, guryaba ekyanga kya Zebuluuni. <verse eid="EZK 48:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 48:27" />Ahaheereraine n'ekyanga kya Zebuluuni, okuruga aha burugwa-izooba okuhika oburengyerwa-izooba, guryaba omugabo gwa Gaadi. <verse eid="EZK 48:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 48:28" />Ahaheereraine n'ekyanga kya Gaadi aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo, omwatano guryaruga Tamari, guhikye aha maizi ga Meribati-kadeshi, gugumizemu gurabe aha rubaju rw'akagyera ka Misri, guhikye aha Nyanja empango. <verse eid="EZK 48:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 48:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 47:21">Ezk 47:21</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 47:22">22</ref>. </char></note> Egyo niyo nsi ei muribagana omu nganda za Israeli kuba obuhunguzi, kandi egyo niyo migabo yaazo buri rumwe; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="EZK 48:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 48:30" />Kandi aga nigo gariba amarembo g'orurembo; aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-bumosho orwa mikono enkumi ina na magana ataano <verse eid="EZK 48:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 48:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:12">Kush 21:12</ref>, <ref loc="REV 21:13">13</ref>. </char></note> haryabaho amarembo ashatu, eirembo rya Reubeeni, erya Yuda n'erya Leevi, ago marembo geetererwe amaziina g'enganda za Israeli. <verse eid="EZK 48:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 48:32" />Aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba, orwa mikono enkumi ina na magana ataano, amarembo ashatu, erya Yosefu, erya Benyamiini, n'erya Daani; <verse eid="EZK 48:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 48:33" />aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo, orwa mikono enkumi ina na magana ataano, erya Simeoni, erya Isakaari n'erya Zebuluuni; <verse eid="EZK 48:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 48:34" />n'aha rubaju rw'oburengyerwa-izooba, orwa mikono enkumi ina na magana ataano, narwo amarembo ashatu, erya Gaadi, erya Asheri n'erya Nafutaali. <verse eid="EZK 48:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 48:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 35:10">Ezk 35:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 3:17">Yer 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:21">Yoel 3:21</ref>. </char></note> Aheehinguririize orurembo hoona haryaba mikono kakumi n'enkumi munaana. Kandi okwiha obwo orwo rurembo ruryayetwa Yehova-shama, amakuru ngu MUKAMA niyo ari.<verse eid="EZK 48:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 48" />
</usx>